hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Abd ibn Humayd ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne humein khabar di, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, Abu Bakr as-Siddiq se, Allah un se raazi hon, unhon ne kaha: Tum is ayat ki tilawat karte ho, {Ae iman walon, tum par apni fikr lazim hai, jo gumrah ho woh tumhein nuqsan na dega jab tum hidayat par ho}, halanke maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab log zalim ko dekhen aur use na roken to qareeb hai ke Allah un sab ko apne azab me gher le."
"2","Habban ibn Hilal ne mujhe khabar di, Hammam ibn Yahya ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Sabit al-Bunani ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Anas ibn Malik ne hum se riwayat ki: ke Abu Bakr as-Siddiq ne un se bayan kiya, farmaya: Maine mushrikon ke paon dekhe jab hum ghaar me the aur woh hamare upar the, to maine kaha, Ae Allah ke Rasul, agar un me se koi apne qadmon ki taraf dekhe to woh apne qadmon ke neeche humein dekh lega, to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr, un do ke bare me tumhara kya khayal hai jin ka teesra Allah hai."
"3","Abu Dawud Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se riwayat ki, Abd al-Wahid ibn Zayd se, Aslam al-Kufi se, Murra se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, Abu Bakr as-Siddiq se: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah azza wa jall ne us jism par Jannat haram kar di hai jo haram se pala ho."
"4","Rawh ibn Ubada ne hum se riwayat ki, Said ibn Abi Aruba ne hum se riwayat ki, Abu al-Tayyah se, al-Mughira ibn Subay se, Amr ibn Hurayth se, Abu Bakr as-Siddiq se, Allah un se raazi hon, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne hum se bayan farmaya: Dajjal mashriq ki ek zameen se niklega jise Khurasan kaha jata hai, us ke peeche aise log honge jin ke chehre thonke hue dhalon ki tarah honge."
"5","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne humein khabar di, Layth ibn Sad ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Yazid ibn Abi Habib ne hum se riwayat ki, Abu al-Khayr se, Abd Allah ibn Amr se, Abu Bakr as-Siddiq se, ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mujhe ek dua sikhaiye jis se main apni namaz me dua karun, to unhon ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, maine apni jan par bahut zulm kiya hai, aur gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta, pas mujhe apni taraf se bakhshish ata farma aur mujh par rehem farma, beshak Tu hi bahut Bakhshne wala, Nihayat Rehem wala hai."
"6","Yala ne hum se riwayat ki, al-Kalbi ne hum se riwayat ki, Salama ibn al-Saib se, Abu Rafi se, jo Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke azad karda ghulam the, unhon ne kaha: Hum zarurat me mubtala hue, to maine aurat ke dono karhe liye aur unhe lekar us saal me nikla jis me Abu Bakr khalifa banaye gaye, aur Abu Bakr mujhe mile aur farmaya, Ye kya hai, maine kaha, Aurat ke dono karhe hain, qabile ko kharch ki zarurat thi, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas chandi ke liye rakha hua chandi ka kaghaz hai, unhon ne tarazu mangwayi aur dono karhon ko ek palre me aur chandi ko dusre palre me rakha, aur dono karhe taqreeban ek daniq se bhari nikle, to unhon ne zayed miqdar kat di, maine kaha, Ae Khalifa-e-Rasulullah, ye aap ke liye halal hai, unhon ne farmaya: Ae Abu Rafi, agarche tum use halal samjho, Allah azza wa jall use halal nahin karta, maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Sona sone ke badle wazan ke barabar, aur chandi chandi ke badle wazan ke barabar hai, aur zayed aur izafa Aag me hai."
"7","Rawh ibn Ubada ne hum se riwayat ki, Musa ibn Ubayda al-Rabadhi ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Ibn Siba ke azad karda ghulam ne mujhe khabar di, farmaya: Maine Abd Allah ibn Umar ko Abu Bakr as-Siddiq se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sath tha jab ye ayat nazil hui: {Jo bhi burai karega us ka badla payega}, to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr, kya main tumhein woh ayat na parhaun jo mujh par nazil hui hai, maine kaha, Ji han, Ae Allah ke Rasul, unhon ne mujhe woh parh kar sunayi, aur mujhe aisa laga goya meri kamar toot gayi, yahan tak ke us ki wajah se main seedha hua, to Rasulullah ne farmaya, Ae Abu Bakr, tumhein kya hua, maine kaha, Ae Allah ke Rasul, mere maa baap aap par qurban hon, hum me se kaun hai jis ne burai na ki ho, aur hum apne kiye ka badla zaroor payenge, to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rahe tum, Ae Abu Bakr, aur tumhare momin sathi, to tumhein us ka badla isi duniya me diya jayega, yahan tak ke tum Allah azza wa jall se is haal me miloge ke tum par koi gunah na hoga, rahe dusre log, to un ke liye jama kiya jata rahega yahan tak ke unhein Qayamat ke Din us ka badla diya jayega."
"8","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Mamar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se: ke Umar ibn al-Khattab jab Juma ke din khutba dete hue khare the, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke Sahaba me se ek shakhs dakhil hua, to Umar ne use pukara, Ye kaun sa waqt hai, unhon ne kaha, Main aaj masruf raha aur apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas na aaya yahan tak ke maine azan suni, aur maine wuzu ke siwa kuch zyada na kiya, Umar ne farmaya: Aur wuzu bhi, halanke tum jante ho ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ghusl ka hukm diya karte the."
"9","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Mamar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne mujhe mere walid ki qasam khate hue suna, to unhon ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jall tumhein apne baapon ki qasam khane se mana karta hai, Umar ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, maine us ke baad un ki qasam kabhi nahin khai, na jan bujh kar aur na naqal ke taur par."
"10","Abd Allah ibn Yazid ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Haywa ibn Shurayh ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Bakr ibn Amr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abd Allah ibn Hubayra ko suna, ke unhon ne Abu Tamim al-Jayshani ko kehte suna: ke unhon ne Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte suna: ke unhon ne Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Agar tum Allah par us ke sache tawakkul ke sath tawakkul karo to woh tumhein aise rizq dega jaise parindon ko rizq deta hai, woh subah khali pet nikalte hain aur sham ko pet bhar kar wapas aate hain."
"11","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se riwayat ki, Daylam ibn Ghazwan ne hum se riwayat ki, Maymun al-Kurdi se, Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, Allah un se raazi hon, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe tumhare bare me sirf har ilm wale munafiq se darr hai jo hikmat ki baat kehta hai magar zulm ke sath amal karta hai."
"12","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Abd Allah ibn Lahia ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: al-Dahhak ibn Shurahbil ne hum se riwayat ki, Zayd ibn Aslam se, un ke walid se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko wuzu karte dekha, har uzw ek ek bar dhoya."
"13","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Mamar ne humein khabar di, Zayd se, un ke walid se, Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zaitun ke tel ko salan banao aur us se tel lagao, kyunke woh ek mubarak darakht se hai."
"14","Abu Nuaym ne hum se riwayat ki, Hisham ibn Sad ne hum se riwayat ki, Zayd ibn Aslam se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne humein sadqa dene ka hukm diya, aur ye us waqt hua jab mere paas maal tha, to maine kaha, Aaj main Abu Bakr se aage nikal jaunga agar kabhi aage nikal saka, main apna aadha maal laya, to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya: Apne ghar walon ke liye tum ne kya chhora hai, maine kaha, Isi ke barabar, aur Abu Bakr apna sara maal lekar aaye, unhon ne un se farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr, apne ghar walon ke liye tum ne kya chhora hai, unhon ne kaha, Maine un ke liye Allah aur Us ke Rasul ko chhora hai, maine kaha, Main phir kabhi kisi cheez me tum se muqabla nahin karunga."
"15","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Yunus ibn Sulayman ne humein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Urwa ibn al-Zubayr se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte suna: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam par wahi nazil hoti to aap ke chehre ke qareeb shahad ki makkhiyon ki bhinbhinahat jaisi awaz sunayi deti, ek din aap par wahi nazil hui, to hum kuch der khamosh rahe, phir woh aap se utha li gayi, aap ne qible ki taraf rukh kiya, apne hath uthaye, aur farmaya: Ae Allah, humein zyada de aur kam na kar, humein izzat de aur ruswa na kar, humein ata kar aur mehroom na kar, humein dusron par fazilat de aur dusron ko hum par fazilat na de, humein raazi kar de aur hum se raazi ho ja, phir unhon ne farmaya: Mujh par dus ayaten nazil hui hain, jo un par qayam rahega woh Jannat me dakhil hoga, phir unhon ne tilawat ki: {Yaqeenan momin kamyab ho gaye}, yahan tak ke dus ayaten mukammal kin."
"16","Harun ibn Ismail al-Khazzaz ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Ali ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ikrima ne mujh se riwayat ki, jo Ibn Abbas ke azad karda ghulam hain, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne mujh se bayan kiya, farmaya: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne mujh se bayan farmaya, farmaya: Aaj raat mere paas mere Rabb azza wa jall ki taraf se ek aane wala aaya jab main al-Aqiq me tha, kehte hue: Is mubarak wadi me namaz parho, aur kaho, Hajj ke andar umra hai."
"17","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, al-Haytham ibn Rafi ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Abu Yahya al-Makki ne hum se riwayat ki, Farrukh se, jo Uthman ke azad karda ghulam the: ke Umar ek din masjid se bahar nikle aur masjid ke darwaze par bikhra hua anaaj dekha, aur us ki kasrat ne unhein khush kiya, unhon ne farmaya, Ye anaaj kaisa hai, unhon ne kaha, Anaaj jo hamare paas laya gaya hai, unhon ne farmaya, Allah is me aur un me barkat de jo ise hamare paas laye, un ke sath chalne wale un ke sathiyon me se ek ne un se kaha, Ae Amir al-Muminin, ise zakhira kiya gaya hai, unhon ne farmaya, Kis ne ise zakhira kiya hai, unhon ne kaha, Fulan ne, jo Uthman ka azad karda ghulam hai, aur fulan ne, jo aap ka azad karda ghulam hai, unhon ne un dono ko bulwaya aur un se farmaya: Tumhein Musalmanon ke anaaj ko zakhira karne par kis ne ubhara, unhon ne kaha, Ae Amir al-Muminin, hum apne maal se kharidte hain aur jab chahein bechte hain, Umar ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo Musalmanon ke khilaf anaaj zakhira kare Allah use juzam ya diwaliya pan me mubtala karega, Farrukh ne kaha: Ae Amir al-Muminin, main Allah se ahd karta hun ke anaaj ki tijarat ki taraf kabhi wapas nahin aaunga, aur woh Misri kapre ki tijarat ki taraf mutawajjeh ho gaya, raha Umar ka azad karda ghulam, to us ne kaha, Ae Amir al-Muminin, ye hamara maal hai, hum us se jab chahein kharidte hain aur jab chahein bechte hain, Abu Yahya ne dawa kiya ke unhon ne Umar ke azad karda ghulam ko juzami aur bigri shakal wala dekha."
"18","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, al-Asbagh ibn Zayd ne humein khabar di, farmaya: Abu al-Ala ne humein khabar di, Abu Umama se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne ek naya libas pehna aur farmaya: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mujhe woh pehnaya jis se main apna satr chhupata hun aur apni zindagi me zeenat hasil karta hun, phir Umar ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo naya libas pehne aur kahe: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mujhe woh pehnaya jis se main apna satr chhupata hun aur apni zindagi me zeenat hasil karta hun, phir apne utare hue libas ki taraf mutawajjeh ho aur use sadqa kar de, woh Allah ki hifazat me, Allah ki dekh bhaal me, aur Allah ke parde me hoga, zinda aur murda, zinda aur murda, zinda aur murda."
"19","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne mujh se riwayat ki, apne walid se, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah ibn Utba se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte suna: Jab Abd Allah ibn Ubayy faut hua to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko us par namaz parhne ke liye bulaya gaya, aap us ki taraf khare hue, aur jab aap namaz ki niyyat se us par khare hue to main harkat karke aap ke samne khara ho gaya aur kaha, Ae Allah ke Rasul, Allah ke dushman Abd Allah ibn Ubayy par, jis ne fulan fulan din fulan fulan baat kahi, us ke din ginwate hue, to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam muskuraye, yahan tak ke jab maine aap par zor diya to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Umar, mujh se peeche hat jao, mujhe ikhtiyar diya gaya hai aur maine ikhtiyar kar liya hai, mujh se kaha gaya hai: {Chahe tum un ke liye bakhshish mango ya un ke liye bakhshish na mango, agar tum un ke liye sattar bar bhi bakhshish mango to Allah unhein kabhi nahin bakhshega}, agar main janta ke sattar se zyada karne par use bakhsh diya jayega to main zyada karta, phir unhon ne us par namaz parhi aur us ke sath chale aur us ki qabr par khare rahe yahan tak ke us se farigh ho gaye, Umar ne kaha: Mujh par aur Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke samne meri jurrat par kitna taajjub hai, aur Allah aur Us ke Rasul zyada jante hain, Allah ki qasam, thori der hi guzri thi ke ye do ayaten nazil huin: {Aur un me se jo mare us par kabhi namaz na parho, aur na us ki qabr par khare ho}, ayat ke aakhir tak, us ke baad Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne kabhi kisi munafiq par namaz na parhi aur na us ki qabr par khare hue yahan tak ke Allah azza wa jall ki taraf rehlat farma gaye."
"20","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr al-Aqadi ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Sulayman ibn Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, farmaya: Abd Allah ibn Dinar ne hum se riwayat ki, Ibn Umar se, Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Jab {Un me se badbakht bhi hain aur khushbakht bhi} nazil hui to maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se pucha, arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasul, hum kis bunyad par amal karte hain, kisi poori ho chuki cheez par ya kisi aisi cheez par jo abhi poori nahin hui, unhon ne farmaya: Balke us cheez par jo pehle hi poori ho chuki hai, Ae Umar, taqdiron se muqaddar ki hui hai, lekin har shakhs usi ke liye amal karta hai jis ke liye woh paida kiya gaya hai."
"21","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Layth ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Bukayr ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Ashajj se, Abd al-Malik ibn Said al-Ansari se, Jabir ibn Abd Allah se, ke Umar ibn al-Khattab ne kaha: Ek din mujhe khwahish mehsoos hui aur maine roze ki halat mein bosa le liya, pas main Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha, Maine aaj ek sangin kaam kar liya hai. Aap ne farmaya, Wo kya hai? Maine kaha, Maine roze ki halat mein bosa le liya. Aap ne farmaya, Tumhara kya khayal hai, agar tum pani se kulli kar lete? Maine kaha, Phir us se koi harj na hota. Aap ne farmaya, Phir kya baat hai?"
"22","Said ibn al-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak ibn Harb se, unhone kaha: Maine al-Numan ibn Bashir ko kehte hue suna: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko khutba dete hue suna, logon par aane wali duniyavi kushhali ka zikr karte hue, kehte hue: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko tadapte hue dekha, aap ko pet bharne ke liye raddi khajoor bhi mayassar na thi."
"23","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Abd Allah ibn al-Zubayr se, ke Umar ibn al-Khattab al-Jabiya mein khatib ke taur par khade hue aur kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam hamare darmiyan khade hue jaisa main tumhare darmiyan khada hun aur farmaya: Mere Sahaba ki izzat karo, pas beshak wo tum mein sab se behtar hain, phir wo jo un ke baad ayenge, phir wo jo un ke baad ayenge. Phir jhoot phail jayega, yahan tak ke aadmi baghair mutalba ke qasam khayega aur baghair mutalba ke gawahi dega. Jo Jannat ke dil mein khush hona chahe use chahiye ke jamaat ko lazim pakde, pas shaitan akele ke sath hai aur do se zyada door rehta hai. Koi mard kisi aurat ke sath tanhai mein na rahe, pas shaitan un ka teesra hota hai. Jise us ki neki khush kare aur us ki burai ghamgeen kare to wo momin hai."
"24","Ali ibn Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya al-Bakka se, unhone kaha: Abd Allah ibn Umar ne mujhe khabar di, kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj dhalne ke baad zuhr se pehle ki chaar rakaten fajar ki namaz ki misl ke barabar shumar ki jati hain. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi cheez aisi nahi magar wo is ghadi mein Allah ki tasbih karti hai. Phir aap ne ye ayat tilawat farmai: {Un ke saye dayen aur bayen jhukte hain, sajda karte hue}, poori ayat."
"25","Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Khalid se, apne bhai se, Musab ibn Sad se, unhone kaha: Hafsa ne apne walid se kaha: Allah ne rizq mein wusat di hai, kaash aap apne khane se zyada narm khana khate aur apne libas se zyada narm libas pehente. Unhone kaha: Main tumhare hi khilaf tum se hujjat karunga. Wo Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki halat aur jis tangi mein wo rahi thi use yaad dilane lage, yahan tak ke unhone use rula diya. Phir unhone kaha: Maine tum se kaha tha ke mere do sathi hain jinhone ek raasta ikhtiyar kiya, aur agar main un ke raaste ke siwa koi aur raasta ikhtiyar karunga to mujhe un ke raaste ke siwa kisi aur raaste par le jaya jayega. Allah ki qasam, main un ke jaisi zindagi mein un ka sharik rahunga, taake main un ke sath un ki aasuda zindagi pa sakun."
"26","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Abd Allah ibn Umar ne hamein khabar di, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Umar ne Hajar-e-Aswad ko bosa diya, phir kaha: Main janta hun ke tu ek patthar hai, aur agar maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko tujhe bosa dete hue na dekha hota to main tujhe bosa na deta."
"27","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamein khabar di, Abd Allah ibn al-Mubarak se, Abd Allah ibn Uqba al-Hadrami se, Ata ibn Dinar al-Hudhali se, Abu Yazid al-Khawlani se, Fadala ibn Ubayd al-Ansari se, unhone kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Shaheed chaar hain: ek momin jo sahih iman wala hai jo dushman se muqabala karta hai aur Allah se sachcha rehta hai yahan tak ke qatl kar diya jata hai; ye wo hai jis ki taraf log Qayamat ke din aankhein uthayenge. Aap ne apna sar uthaya yahan tak ke aap ki topi aap ke sar se, ya Umar ke sar se, gir gayi. Ye pehle darje mein hai. Ek momin jo, jab dushman se muqabala karta hai to goya us ki khaal ko buzdili ki wajah se talh ke kaanton se mara jata hai; ek be-maqsad teer use lagta hai aur use qatl kar deta hai; ye dusre darje mein hai. Ek momin jo nek amal ko dusre bure amal ke sath milata hai, dushman se muqabala karta hai aur ladta hai yahan tak ke qatl kar diya jata hai; ye teesre darje mein hai. Aur ek momin jo gunahon aur khataon ka bojh uthaye hue hai, dushman se muqabala karta hai aur ladta hai yahan tak ke qatl kar diya jata hai; ye chauthe darje mein hai."
"28","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: al-Azhar ibn Sinan ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Maine Muhammad ibn Wasi ko kehte hue suna: Main Makka aaya aur wahan apne bhai Salim ibn Abd Allah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab se mila, unhone kaha: Kya main tumhe ek hadith bayan na karun jo mujhe mere walid ne, mere dada se, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se bayan ki? Maine kaha, Haan. Unhone kaha: Jo shakhs Musalmanon ke bazaaron mein se kisi bazaar mein dakhil ho aur kahe: La ilaha illallah, wahdahu la sharika lahu; lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu; yuhyi wa yumitu, wa huwa al-Hayyu la yamutu; bi-yadihil-khairu, wa huwa ala kulli shayin qadir - to Allah us ke liye das lakh nekiyan likh deta hai, us se das lakh buraiyan mita deta hai, aur us ke liye das lakh darje buland kar deta hai. Muhammad ne kaha: Main Khurasan aaya aur Qutayba ibn Muslim se mila aur kaha, Main tumhare liye ek tohfa laya hun, aur maine use hadith bayan ki. Wo apne juloos mein sawar hote, bazaar aate, use kehte, phir chale jate."
"29","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, Zubayd se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Umar se, unhone kaha: Juma ki namaz do rakaten hai, Adha ki namaz do rakaten hai, Fitr ki namaz do rakaten hai, aur safar ki namaz do rakaten hai, mukammal baghair qasr ke, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki zaban par."
"30","Jafar ibn Awn ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Abu Umays ne hamein khabar di, Qays ibn Muslim se, Tariq ibn Shihab se, unhone kaha: Yahudiyon mein se ek aadmi Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha, Aye Amir al-Muminin, tumhari Kitab mein ek ayat hai jo tum tilawat karte ho - agar wo hum par, Yahud ki jamaat par, nazil hoti to hum us din ko eid bana lete. Unhone kaha, Kaun si ayat? Us ne kaha: {Aaj maine tumhare liye tumhara din mukammal kar diya aur tum par apni nemat poori kar di aur tumhare liye Islam ko din ke taur par pasand kar liya}. Umar ne kaha: Main us din ko janta hun jis mein ye nazil hui aur us jagah ko jis mein ye nazil hui; ye Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam par Arafat mein juma ke din nazil hui."
"31","Umar ibn Yunus al-Yamami ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Ikrima ibn Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Abu Zumayl ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Abd Allah ibn Abbas ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Jang-e-Badr ke din Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne mushrikeen ki taraf dekha, jo ek hazar the, jabke aap ke Sahaba teen sau unnees mard the. Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne qibla ki taraf rukh kiya, apne haath phailaye, aur apne Rabb se girya karte hue pukarne lage: Aye Allah, mere liye wo poora farma jo Tune mujh se wada kiya hai; Aye Allah, Tera wada kahan hai; Aye Allah, agar Tu Islam walon ke is giroh ko halak kar dega to zameen par kabhi Teri ibadat na ki jayegi. Wo barabar apne Rabb se girya karte hue pukarte rahe, haath phailaye hue, qibla ki taraf rukh kiye hue, yahan tak ke un ki chadar un ke kandhe se gir gayi. Abu Bakr un ke paas aaye, un ki chadar li, use un ke kandhe par dala, phir peeche se unhe gale lagaya aur kaha, Aye Allah ke Nabi, apne Rabb se aap ka ye aajizi se mangna kafi hai; Wo zaroor aap se kiya hua wada poora farmayega. Phir Allah azza wa jalla ne nazil farmaya: {Jab tum ne apne Rabb se madad mangi to Us ne tumhari dua qubool farmai: Main ek hazar farishton se tumhari madad karunga, jo ek dusre ke peeche aa rahe hain}. Pas Allah azza wa jalla ne farishton se un ki madad farmai. Abu Zumayl ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Jab ek Musalman mard apne aage ek mushrik ke peeche daud raha tha, us ne apne upar kode ki awaz aur ek sawar ki awaz suni jo keh raha tha, Aage badho, Hayzum, jab us ne apne aage mushrik ko dekha to wo chit gir pada. Us ne use dekha, to us ki naak par lagam lagi hui thi aur us ka chehra jaise kode se phata hua tha, aur sab sabz ho gaya tha. Ansari aaya aur us ne ye baat Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko bayan ki, to aap ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha hai; ye teesre aasman ki madad mein se tha. Us din unhone sattar ko qatl kiya aur sattar ko qaid kiya. Abu Zumayl ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Jab unhone qaidiyon ko qaid kar liya to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Abu Bakr aur Umar se kaha, In qaidiyon ke baare mein tumhara kya khayal hai? Abu Bakr ne kaha, Aye Rasulullah, ye chacha-zad bhai aur rishtedar hain; meri raye hai ke aap un se fidya le len, taake wo kafiron ke muqabale mein hamare liye quwwat bane, aur shayad Allah unhe Islam ki hidayat de de. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya, Aye Ibn al-Khattab, tumhara kya khayal hai? Unhone kaha, Nahi, Allah ki qasam, Aye Allah ke Nabi, main wo nahi sochta jo Abu Bakr sochte hain; balke meri raye hai ke aap hamein un par ikhtiyar de den taake hum un ki gardanein maarein: Ali ko Aqil par ikhtiyar de den taake wo us ki gardan maare, aur mujhe falan par, jo Umar ka rishtedar hai, ikhtiyar de den taake main us ki gardan maarun, pas ye kufr ke sardar, us ke bade aur us ke commander hain. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Abu Bakr ki baat ki taraf mayel hue aur meri baat ki taraf mayel na hue. Agle din main Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya jab Abu Bakr baithe ro rahe the. Maine kaha, Aye Rasulullah, mujhe batayiye ke aap aur aap ke sathi kis baat par ro rahe hain; agar mujhe rona aaya to main rounga, aur agar mujhe rona na aaya to main aap ke rone par rone ki koshish karunga. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main is par ro raha hun jo mere Sahaba ne mujhe fidya lene ki tajweez pesh ki; un ka azab mujh par is darakht se zyada qareeb pesh kiya gaya, ek darakht jo Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke qareeb tha. Phir Allah azza wa jalla ne nazil farmaya: {Kisi nabi ke liye ye rawa nahi ke us ke paas qaidi hon yahan tak ke wo zameen mein khoob khoon bahaye. Tum duniya ka maal chahte ho, jabke Allah Akhirat chahta hai, aur Allah Zabardast, Hikmat wala hai. Agar Allah ki taraf se pehle se ek tehreer na hoti to jo kuch tum ne liya us par tumhe bada azab pahunchta. Pas jo kuch tum ne hasil kiya hai us mein se halal pakiza khao}. Pas Allah azza wa jalla ne un ke liye maal-e-ghanimat ko halal kar diya."
"32","Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwa se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Umar se kaha gaya, Kya aap janashin muqarrar nahi karenge? Unhone kaha: Agar main ise chhod dun to mujh se behtar hasti ne ise chhoda hai, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne; aur agar main janashin muqarrar karun to mujh se behtar hasti ne janashin muqarrar kiya hai, Abu Bakr ne."
"33","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Israil ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Salim ibn Thawban [matbua mein ibn Shawal] se, unhone kaha: Ali ibn Zayd ibn Judan ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Maine Said ibn al-Musayyab ko kehte hue suna: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maal laane wala ko rizq diya jata hai, aur zakhira karne wala maloon hai."
"34","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad al-Darawardi ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn al-Had ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Uthman ibn Suraqa se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi mujahid ko saya faraham kare use us ke ajar jaisa ajar milega yahan tak ke wo wapas aaye ya faut ho jaye, aur jo koi masjid banaye, Allah us ke liye Jannat mein ek ghar banayega."
"35","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Husayn ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Mukhariq ne hum se bayan kiya, Tariq ibn Shihab se, Umar ibn al-Khattab se, unhone kaha: Kuch Yahudi Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kaha, Aye Muhammad, kya Jannat mein phal hai? Aap ne farmaya, Haan, us mein phal, khajooren aur anaar hain. Unhone kaha, Kya wo waise hi khate hain jaise is duniya mein khate hain? Aap ne farmaya, Haan, aur us se kai guna zyada. Unhone kaha, Kya wo qaza-e-hajat karte hain? Aap ne farmaya, Nahi, lekin wo paseena bahayenge aur un ke jism se paseena niklega, aur Allah un ke peton mein jo muzarr cheez hogi use door kar dega."
"36","Amr ibn Talha ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: al-Asbat ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas se, Umar se, unhone kaha: Ek din maine apne walid ki qasam khai, jab mere peeche ek aadmi ne kaha, Apne baapon ki qasam mat khao. Maine mud kar dekha, to dekha ke wo Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam the."
"37","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abd Allah al-Awdi se, unhone kaha: Abd al-Rahman al-Musalli ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Maine al-Ashath ibn Qays ko kehte hue suna: Main ek raat Umar ibn al-Khattab ka mehman raha aur maine unhe apni biwi ko maarte hue suna. Subah maine kaha, Aye Amir al-Muminin, maine raat jo aap ko apni biwi ko maarte hue suna us ke baare mein kya hai? Unhone kaha, Aye Ashath, mujh se teen khaslaten yaad rakho jo maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se yaad rakhi hain: Aadmi se ye na pucho ke wo apne ghar walon ko kis wajah se maarta hai, aur witr par hi so, Unhone kaha: Aur main teesri bhool gaya."
"38","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Dinar se jo aal-e-Zubayr ke wakeel the, Salim ibn Abd Allah ibn Umar se, apne walid se, apne dada se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, unhone farmaya: Jo kisi museebat mein mubtala shakhs ko dekhe aur kahe: Alhamdulillahilladhi aafani mimma ibtalaka bihi wa faddalani ala kathirin mimman khalaqa tafdila, to wo museebat use kabhi nahi pahunchegi, chahe wo koi bhi ho."
"39","Hammad ibn Isa al-Basri ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Hanzala ibn Abi Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Maine Salim ibn Abd Allah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab ko apne walid se, apne dada se bayan karte hue suna, unhone kaha: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam dua ke liye haath phailate to unhe wapas na karte yahan tak ke un se apna chehra ponchh lete."
"40","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujhe bayan kiya, kaha: Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah ibn Umar se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, Umar se, unhone kaha: Maine zamana-e-jahiliyat mein ek nazr mani thi, phir Islam lane ke baad Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se pucha, to aap ne mujhe apni nazr poori karne ka hukm diya."
"41","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaiba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne bayan kiya, Hajjaj se, Amr ibn Shuayb se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Baap ko bete ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega."
"42","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaiba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah ibn Numayr ne bayan kiya, hamein Hisham ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar ibn al-Khattab ko kehte hue suna: Mujhe Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne maal bheja to maine use wapas kar diya, jab main aap ke pas aaya to aap ne farmaya, tumhen meri bheji hui cheez wapas karne par kis cheez ne ubhara, maine kaha, ai Allah ke Rasul, aap ne mujh se farmaya tha, tumhare liye behtar hai ke logon se kuchh na lo, aap ne farmaya: ye to sirf logon se mangne ke bare mein tha, jo cheez tumhare pas baghair mange aaye to wo to rizq hai jo Allah azza wa jall ne tumhen ata kiya hai."
"43","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaiba ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ibn Adam ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Zakariyya se, Salih ibn Hayy se, Salama ibn Kuhayl se, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, Umar se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hafsa ko talaq di, phir un se ruju kar liya."
"44","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaiba ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Lahia ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu al-Aswad ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Muhammad ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Labiba ko Abu Sinan al-Duali se riwayat karte hue suna, ke wo Umar ibn al-Khattab ke pas hazir hue, aur Umar raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: jis kisi par bhi duniya kholi jati hai to Allah azza wa jall un ke darmiyan qiyamat ke din tak dushmani aur bughz dal deta hai, aur mujhe tumhare bare mein isi ka dar hai."
"45","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, hamein Said ibn Abi Aruba ne khabar di, Ayyub se, Nafi se, Nubayh se, Aban ibn Usman se, un ke walid Usman raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, ke aap ne farmaya: ehram wala na nikah kare aur na nikah karaye."
"46","Hamein Abdus Samad ibn Abdul Waris ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hurays ibn al-Saib ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine al-Hasan ko kehte hue suna: mujhe Humran ne bayan kiya, Usman ibn Affan se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ko in khaslaton se zyada mein koi haq nahin: rehne ke liye ghar, satr chhupane ke liye kapra, khushk roti aur pani."
"47","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salama ne bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Ubayd se, Ata ibn Farrukh se, ke Usman ibn Affan ne ek shakhs se zamin kharidi to wo shakhs nadim hua aur un se iqala chaha to Usman ne us se iqala kar liya, phir unhon ne kaha: maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah ne ek aise shakhs ko Jannat mein dakhil kiya jo bechne aur kharidne mein, ada karne aur taqaza karne mein narm tha."
"48","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hammad ibn Salama ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Sinan ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Mawhab se, ke Usman ibn Affan ne Ibn Umar se kaha, logon ke darmiyan faisla karo, unhon ne kaha, main na do aadmiyon ke darmiyan faisla karunga aur na un ki imamat karunga, unhon ne kaha, tumhare walid faisla kiya karte the, unhon ne kaha, mere walid faisla kiya karte the, aur jab un par koi cheez mushtabih hoti to wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se puchte, aur jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par koi cheez mushtabih hoti to wo Jibril se puchte, aur mujhe koi nahin milta jis se main puchhun, aur main apne walid ki tarah nahin hun, mujhe ye baat pahunchi hai ke qazi teen hain: ek sakht mizaj shakhs jo khwahish ki pairwi kare to wo Aag mein hai, ek shakhs jo qaza ka zimma le aur jahalat mein faisla kare to wo Aag mein hai, aur ek shakhs jo ijtihad kare aur durust ho to wo mushkil se bachega, na us ke haq mein na us ke khilaf, unhon ne kaha: aur unhon ne kaha, kya tum ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: jo Allah ki panah mange us ne panah pa li, unhon ne kaha, haan, unhon ne kaha, main tum se Allah ki panah mangta hun, is se ke tum mujhe qazi banao, to unhon ne unhen ma'zur samjha aur kaha, kisi ko na batana."
"49","Mujhe Rawh ibn Ubada ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Imran ibn Hudayr ne bayan kiya, Abdul Malik ibn Ubayd se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Humran ibn Aban ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman ibn Affan ne kaha, jabke wo Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bahut kam riwayat karte the, ke aap ne farmaya: jo shakhs jaan le ke namaz us par lazim farz ya muqarrar haq hai, wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"50","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Usman ibn Hakim se, Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Amra se, Usman ibn Affan se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: jis ne isha jamaat se parhi to goya us ne aadhi raat qiyam kiya, aur jis ne fajr jamaat se parhi to goya us ne sari raat qiyam kiya."
"51","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Lays ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Aqil Zuhra ibn Mabad ne bayan kiya, Abu Salih mawla Usman se, unhon ne kaha: maine Usman ibn Affan ko minbar par kehte hue suna: maine tum se ek hadith chhupai thi jo maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suni thi, is napasandidgi se ke tum mujh se door ho jaoge, phir mere dil mein aaya ke main use tum se bayan kar dun taake har shakhs apne liye jo chahe ikhtiyar kare, maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah ke raste mein ek din sarhad ki hifazat dusri jaghon ke hazar dinon se behtar hai."
"52","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abdul Hamid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn al-Mubarak ne khabar di, Ibn Lahia se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Musa ibn Wardan ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyab ko kehte hue suna: maine Usman ibn Affan ko minbar par kehte hue suna: main nikalta, khajuren kharidta, unhen apne bartanon mein naapta, phir unhen bazar mein lata aur kehta ke is mein itna itna naap hai, apna nafa leta aur baqi ke sath unhen chhor deta, ye baat Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pahunchi to aap ne farmaya: ai Usman, jab kharido to pura naapo, aur jab becho to naap kar do."
"53","Hamein Muhammad ibn Bishr ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn al-Aswad ne bayan kiya, Husayn ibn Umar se, Mukhariq ibn Abdullah ibn Jabir se, Tariq ibn Shihab se, Usman ibn Affan se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: jo Arbon ko dhoka de wo meri shafaat mein dakhil nahin hoga, aur na us tak meri muhabbat pahunchegi."
"54","Hamein Muhammad ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Abi Fudayk ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Firas se [matbua mein ibn Umar], Aban ibn Usman se, Usman ibn Affan se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se marfuan, aap ne farmaya: jo subah kahe: Bismillah, jis ke naam se zamin mein aur na aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin pahunchati, aur Wo sunne wala, janne wala hai, wo shaam tak mehfooz rahega, aur jo use shaam ko kahe wo subah tak mehfooz rahega."
"55","Hamein Ibn Abi Shaiba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Ulayya ne bayan kiya, Khalid se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe al-Walid ibn Muslim ne bayan kiya, Humran se, Usman ibn Affan se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: jo is haal mein mare ke wo janta ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"56","Mujhe Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Muslim al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, apne chacha Muhammad ibn Muslim al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Salih ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Farwa ne khabar di ke unhen Amir ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas ne khabar di ke unhon ne Aban ibn Usman ko kehte hue suna: Usman ne kaha: maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: tumhara kya khayal hai, agar tum mein se kisi ke sehan mein ek behti nahar ho, jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusl kare, to us ke mail se kya baqi rahega, unhon ne kaha, kuchh nahin, aap ne farmaya: namazen gunahon ko is tarah door karti hain jaise pani mail ko door karta hai."
"57","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, hamein Ishaq ibn Said ibn Amr ibn Said ibn al-As ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: main Usman ke sath tha jab unhon ne taharat ka pani mangwaya aur kaha: maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: jis bhi Musalman shakhs par farz namaz ka waqt aaye, aur wo us ke wuzu, us ke khushu aur us ke ruku ko kamil kare, to wo us se pehle ke gunahon ka kaffara hai, jab tak koi kabira gunah na kiya jaye, aur ye hamesha ke liye hai."
"58","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, Shuba se, Jami ibn Shaddad se, unhon ne kaha: maine Humran ibn Aban ko Abu Burda se Usman ke hawale se bayan karte hue suna, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: jo wuzu mukammal kare jaisa Allah ne use hukm diya, to namazen un ke darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hain."
"59","Hamein Usman ibn Umar ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Awf ne bayan kiya, Mabad al-Juhani se, Humran se, unhon ne kaha: maine Usman ko wuzu karte hue dekha, use mukammal kiya, phir hanse, unhon ne kaha, kya tum jante ho main kyun hansa, hum ne kaha, nahin, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko wuzu karte hue dekha, use mukammal kiya, phir hanse aur farmaya: kya tum jante ho main kyun hansa, hum ne kaha, Allah aur us ke Rasul zyada jante hain, aap ne farmaya: jab Musalman banda wuzu kare, use mukammal kare, phir namaz mein dakhil ho, use mukammal kare, to wo apne gunahon se is tarah nikalta hai jaise us ki maan ne use jana tha."
"60","Mujhe Muhadir ibn al-Muwarri ne bayan kiya, hamein Hisham ibn Urwa ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Humran mawla Usman ibn Affan se, Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: jo wuzu kare, use khoob kamil kare, phir namaz parhe, to Allah us ke is namaz aur agli namaz ke darmiyan ke gunah bakhsh dega."
"61","Ubaid Allah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Israil se, Usman ibn Mauhab se, unhon ne kaha: Humran ibn Aban ne kaha: Main Usman ke paas tha jab un ka munadi unhein namaz ki ittila dene aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas thay jab Bilal unhein namaz ki ittila dene aaye. Phir Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya tha ke tumhein ek baat bayan karun, phir mujhe khamosh rehne ka khayal aaya. Hum ne kaha, Ai Allah ke Rasool, hamein bayan farmaiye; agar woh khair hogi to hum us ki taraf jaldi karenge, aur agar us ke siwa hogi to hum us se ruk jayenge. Unhon ne farmaya: Koi Musalman mard wuzu nahi karta jaisa Allah ne use hukm diya, phir namaz padhta hai jaisa Allah ne use hukm diya, ruku aur sujud ko mukammal karte hue, magar woh us ke pichle gunahon ka kaffara ban jata hai."
"62","Ibn Abi Shaiba ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdullah ibn Numair ne hamein bayan kiya, kehte hue: Israil ne hamein bayan kiya, Amir ibn Shaqiq se, Abu Wail se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Usman ibn Affan ko wuzu karte dekha: unhon ne apne hathon ko teen martaba dhoya, apne chehre ko teen martaba dhoya, teen martaba kulli ki aur naak mein pani dala, apne bazoun ko teen martaba dhoya, apne sar aur apne kaanon ka masah kiya, un ke bahar aur andar ka, phir apne paon ko teen martaba dhoya, phir un mein aur apni dadhi mein ungliyon se khilal kiya teen martaba jab unhon ne apna chehra dhoya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aisa karte dekha jaisa tum ne mujhe karte dekha hai."
"63","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: al-Awwam ibn Haushab ne hamein khabar di, Amr ibn Murra ne hamein bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Laila se, Ali radi Allahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamare paas tashrif laye yahan tak ke unhon ne apne qadam mere aur Fatima ke darmiyan rakhe, aur hamein sikhaya ke jab hum apne bistaron par jayen to kya kahen: taintis martaba tasbih, taintis martaba tahmid, aur chauntis martaba takbir. Ali radi Allahu anhu ne kaha: Maine us ke baad unhein kabhi tark nahi kiya. Ek shakhs ne un se kaha, Siffin ki raat bhi nahi? Unhon ne kaha, Siffin ki raat bhi nahi."
"64","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Karim al-Jazari se, Mujahid se, Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Laila se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe apne qurbani ke unton ke bare mein hukm diya ke un ke gosht, khalen aur jhulen miskino mein taqsim kar dun, aur qassab ko un mein se kuch na dun, farmate hue: Hum use ujrat apni taraf se denge."
"65","Abdul Malik ibn Amr ne hamein bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum ne tumhare liye ghode aur ghulam maaf kar diye hain, pas apne malon ki zakat ada karo: har chalis dirham mein se ek dirham."
"66","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein bayan kiya, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bimar ke liye panah talab karte to farmate: Taklif door farma de, ai logon ke Rab, aur shifa ata farma; Tu hi Shafi hai; Teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, jo koi bimari baqi na chhode."
"67","Ubaid Allah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ai Ali, main tumhare liye wahi pasand karta hun jo apne liye pasand karta hun, aur tumhare liye wahi napasand karta hun jo apne liye napasand karta hun: Ruku mein qirat na karo aur na sajde mein, balon ko jod kar namaz na padho, kyunke woh shaitan ka hissa hai; do sajdon ke darmiyan ukdun na baitho, kankariyon se na khelo, imam ko talqin na karo, sone ki anguthi na pehno, qassi kapde na pehno, mayasir par sawar na ho, aur apne bazoun ko na bichhao."
"68","Ubaid Allah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Mufassal ki nau suraton se witr padhte thay: pehli rakat mein al-Takasur, Inna Anzalnahu aur Iza Zulzilat; dusri rakat mein al-Asr, Iza Ja-a aur Inna Ataynaka al-Kausar; aur tisri rakat mein Qul Ya Ayyuhal Kafirun, Tabbat aur Qul Huwallahu Ahad."
"69","Ubaid Allah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke mere Sahaba mein se ek mard ko talash kiya jayega jaise bhatki hui cheez talash ki jati hai, phir woh nahi paya jayega."
"70","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shuba ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Asim ibn Damra se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Witr namaz ki tarah farz nahi hai, lekin woh sunnat hai, pas use tark na karo."
"71","Abu Nuaim ne hamein bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Asim ibn Damra se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam yaqinan har farz namaz ke baad do rakaten padhte thay, siwaye asr aur fajr ke."
"72","Said ibn Amir aur Sulaiman ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Shuba se, Abu Ishaq se, Asim ibn Damra se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Raat ke har hisse mein Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne witr padha hai: us ke awwal mein, us ke darmiyan mein aur us ke aakhir mein; aur un ka witr raat ke aakhri hisse par khatam hota tha."
"73","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shuba ne hamein khabar di, Amr ibn Murra se, Abdullah ibn Salima se: ke Ali ne bimari ki shikayat ki aur kaha: Ai Allah, agar mera waqt aa gaya hai to mujhe aaram de; agar woh azmaish hai to mujhe sabr de; aur agar woh ek muddat ki taraf hai to mujhe sehat de. Ali ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere paas se guzre jab main yeh keh raha tha aur farmaya, Tum ne kya kaha? Maine woh kalimat unhein dohra diye, to unhon ne farmaya: Ai Allah, use shifa de aur use sehat ata farma. Main shifayab ho gaya, aur us ke baad maine us dard ki kabhi shikayat nahi ki."
"74","Ibn Abi Shaiba ne mujhe khabar di, Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Asadi ne hamein bayan kiya, Ali ibn Salih se, Abu Ishaq se, Amr ibn Murra se, Abdullah ibn Salima se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein aise kalimat na sikhaun jinhein agar tum kaho to tum bakhsh diye jaoge, halanke tum pehle se bakhshe hue ho: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, Burdbar, Karam wala; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, Buland, Azmat wala; paak hai Allah, saaton aasmanon ka Rab aur izzat wale Arsh ka Rab; aur tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai, jo tamam jahanon ka Rab hai."
"75","Abu Nuaim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ribi ibn Hirash se, ek shakhs se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda momin nahi hota yahan tak ke woh chaar baton par iman laye: woh gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi aur ke main Allah ka Rasool hun, haq ke saath bheja gaya; woh taqdir par iman laye; aur woh maut ke baad dobara uthaye jane par iman laye."
"76","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Bishr ibn Numair ne hamein khabar di, al-Qasim se, Abu Umama se, Ali ibn Abi Talib ibn Abdul Muttalib ibn Hashim ibn Abd Manaf se, ke woh Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke farman ke bare mein kehte thay, ke aap farmate thay: Iman ke bandhan chaar hain, aur Islam un ke pairau hain: iman ke bandhan Allah wahdah par iman lana hain, aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par aur jo woh laye us par; Allah par iman lana aur yeh janna ke tum maut ke baad uthaye jaoge; aur namaz qaim karna, zakat dena, Ramazan ke roze rakhna, Baitullah ka hajj karna, aur Allah azza wa jalla ke raste mein jihad karna hain."
"77","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hisham ibn Hassan ne hamein bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Abida se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khandaq ke din farmaya: Unhein kya ho gaya hai? Allah un ki qabron aur un ke gharon ko aag se bhar de, kyunke unhon ne hamein darmiyani namaz se rok diya yahan tak ke suraj ghurub ho gaya."
"78","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Said ibn Zaid, jo Hammad ibn Zaid ke bhai hain, ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Amr ibn Khalid ne hamein bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ali se, un ke aba o ajdad se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Fatima se farmaya: Utho aur apni qurbani par hazir raho; kyunke tumhare liye us ke khun ke pehle qatre ke girne ke saath har guzishta gunah ki maghfirat hai. Use Qayamat ke din laya jayega, us ke gosht aur us ke khun samet, sattar guna karke, yahan tak ke tumhare tarazu mein rakha jayega. Abu Said al-Khudri ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, kya yeh khas taur par Aal e Muhammad ke liye hai, jo is ke mustahiq hain jo unhein dusron se alag karke diya gaya, ya Aal e Muhammad aur aam logon ke liye hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Balke Aal e Muhammad aur aam logon ke liye hai."
"79","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Salim ibn Ubaid [matbua mein Abu Abdullah] ne hamein khabar di, Abu Abdullah se, Abu Jafar se, jo Ali ibn Abi Talib ke aazad karda ghulam thay, ke Ali ne ek din kaha: Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Fatima se farmaya: Jab tum so jao to taintis martaba tasbih karo, taintis martaba tahmid karo, aur chauntis martaba takbir kaho; yeh sau hain, aur yeh hazar nekiyan hain. Jo shakhs har raat jab woh soye use kahe, to woh us ke liye har raat ek ghulam aazad karne se behtar hai, aur us ke jism ki har rag ke badle ek gunah mitaya jata hai aur ek neki likhi jati hai. Ali ne kaha: Jab se maine Fatima ko mujh se unhein kehte suna, maine unhein kabhi tark nahi kiya, Siffin ke din bhi nahi."
"80","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Habib ne hamein bayan kiya, Abdul Aziz ibn Abi al-Saba se, Abu Aflah al-Hamdani se, Abdullah ibn Zurair al-Ghafiqi se, Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamare paas tashrif laye, ek hath mein sona aur dusre mein resham liye hue, aur farmaya: Yeh dono meri ummat ke mardon par haram hain."
"81","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, hamein Hammad ibn Salama ne khabar di, Hisham ibn Amr al-Fazari se, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham se, Ali se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apne witr ke akhir mein yun farmate the: Ai Allah, main Teri raza ke waseele se Tere ghazab se panah mangta hun, Teri muafi ke waseele se Tere azab se panah mangta hun, aur Tujh hi se Teri panah mangta hun; main Teri sana ka shumar nahi kar sakta; Tu waisa hi hai jaisa Tune apni sana khud bayan farmayi hai."
"82","Hamein Abd al-Rahman ibn Sad ne khabar di, kehte hain: hamein Abu Jafar al-Razi ne khabar di, Ata ibn al-Saib se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne farmaya: Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne hamare liye khana tayyar kiya, hamein dawat di aur hamein sharaab pilayi. Sharaab ne hamein madhosh kar diya, namaz ka waqt aa gaya aur logon ne mujhe aage badha diya. Maine padha: Keh do, ai kafiro, main us ki ibadat nahi karta jis ki tum ibadat karte ho, aur hum us ki ibadat karte hain jis ki tum ibadat karte ho. Tab Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ye ayat nazil farmayi: {Ai iman walo, nashe ki halat mein namaz ke qareeb na jao yahan tak ke tum jan lo ke tum kya keh rahe ho}."
"83","Mujhe Yusuf ibn Buhlul ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd Allah ibn Idris ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: mujhe Husayn ibn Abd al-Rahman ne bayan kiya, Sad ibn Ubayda se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe, al-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam aur Abu Marthad al-Ghanawi ko rawana farmaya, hum mein se har ek sawar tha, farmaya: Jao yahan tak ke Rawdat Khakh tak pahuncho, kyunke wahan mushrikin ki ek aurat ke paas Hatib ibn Abi Baltaa ki taraf se mushrikin ke naam ek khat hai. Hum us aurat tak pahunche jabke wo apne oont par sawar ja rahi thi jahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hamein bataya tha. Hum ne kaha, Tumhare paas jo khat hai wo kahan hai? Us ne kaha, Mere paas koi khat nahi hai. Hum ne us ke oont ko bithaya aur us ke saman ki talashi li aur kuch na paya. Mere dono sathiyon ne kaha, Hum koi khat nahi dekh rahe. Maine kaha: Main janta hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jhoot nahi bola; us Zaat ki qasam jis ke naam ki qasmein khai jati hain, tum zaroor khat pesh karogi warna main tumhein barahna kar dunga. Jab us ne mera pukhta irada dekha to us ne apne haath se apne tehband ki taraf haath badhaya jo ek chadar se bandha hua tha aur khat nikal diya. Hum use le kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye, Aap ne farmaya: Ai Hatib, kis cheez ne tumhein is kaam par amada kiya jo tum ne kiya? Us ne kaha: Mera Allah aur Us ke Rasul par iman mein koi nuqs nahi, lekin maine chaha ke logon par mera koi ehsan rahe jis ke zariye Allah mere maal ki hifazat kare, kyunke aap ke Sahaba mein se wahan koi bhi nahi magar us ka koi aisa hai jis ke zariye Allah us ke ahl o maal ki hifazat karta hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha hai, lihaza us se bhali baat ke siwa kuch na kaho. Umar ibn al-Khattab ne kaha, Us ne Allah, Us ke Rasul aur momineen se khayanat ki hai; mujhe ijazat dijiye ke main us ki gardan maar dun. Aap ne farmaya: Ai Umar, tum kya jante ho? Shayad Allah ne ahl-e-Badr par nazar farmayi aur farmaya: Jo chahe karo, tumhare liye Jannat wajib ho chuki hai. Umar ki aankhein aansuon se bhar gayin aur unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul behtar jante hain."
"84","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ibn Hammam ne khabar di, Mamar se, Mansur se, Sad ibn Ubayda se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Sulami se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ek janaze ke liye nikle, aur jab hum al-Baqi mein the to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laye haath mein ek asa liye hue. Aap tashreef laye, baithe, phir us se kuch der tak zameen ko khurachne lage, phir farmaya: Koi jaandar nahi magar us ka Jannat ya Jahannam mein thikana likha ja chuka hai, aur ye bhi likha ja chuka hai ke wo badbakht hai ya khushbakht. Ek shakhs ne kaha, Kya hum apni likhai par bharosa karke amal chhod na dein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke amal karo; har ek ke liye asani kar di gayi hai. Jahan tak ahl-e-saadah ka talluq hai to un ke liye ahl-e-saadah ke amal ki asani di gayi hai; aur jahan tak ahl-e-shaqawah ka talluq hai to un ke liye ahl-e-shaqawah ke amal ki asani di gayi hai. Phir Aap ne tilawat farmayi: {To jis ne diya aur taqwa ikhtiyar kiya, aur bhali baat ki tasdeeq ki, to Hum use asani ke liye asan kar denge; aur jis ne bukhl kiya aur beparwahi barati aur bhali baat ko jhutlaya, to Hum use sakhti ke liye asan kar denge}."
"85","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Israil ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Ala al-Thalabi se, Abu Abd al-Rahman se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) sehri tak musalsal wisal ke saath roza rakhte the."
"86","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Israil ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Ala al-Thalabi se, Abu Abd al-Rahman se, Ali se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak marfu taur par, Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne khwab ke baare mein jhoot bole use Qayamat ke din jo ke daane par girh lagane ka mukallaf banaya jayega."
"87","Mujhe Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: hamein Abu Shihab ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Thumali se, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Juhayfa al-Suwai se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Ali ke paas dakhil hue, to unhon ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ek aisi hadith na sunaun jo momineen ko yaad rakhni chahiye? Hum ne kaha, Kyun nahi, ai Amir al-Mumineen. Unhon ne hamein hadith bayan ki, aur jab hum bahar nikle to hum use bhool gaye. Hum dobara un ke paas laute to unhon ne ye ayat tilawat farmayi: {Tumhein jo bhi museebat pahunchti hai wo tumhare hathon ki kamai ki wajah se hai, aur Wo bahut kuch muaf farma deta hai}. Allah ne duniya mein jis gunah ki saza de di, Allah Azza wa Jalla is se zyada ba-haya hai ke Akhirat mein us ki saza ko dugna kare; aur Allah ne duniya mein jis gunah ko muaf farma diya, Allah is se zyada sakhi hai ke apne muaf karne ke baad us par rujoo kare."
"88","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne farmaya: hamein Ali ibn Rabia ne khabar di: ke unhon ne Ali ko dekha jab wo sawar hue; jab unhon ne apna qadam rakab mein rakha to kaha, Bismillah; jab jam kar baithe to kaha, Alhamdulillah. Phir unhon ne kaha: {Paak hai Wo Zaat jis ne is ko hamare qabze mein de diya, aur hum is par qabu pane wale na the, aur be shak hum apne Rab ki taraf laut kar jane wale hain}. Phir unhon ne teen martaba hamd bayan ki aur teen martaba takbeer kahi, phir kaha: Tere siwa koi mabud nahi; maine apni jaan par zulm kiya, pas mujhe bakhsh de, kyunke tere siwa koi gunahon ko nahi bakhshta. Phir wo hanse. Kaha gaya, Ai Amir al-Mumineen, kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne waisa hi kiya jaisa maine kiya aur waisa hi kaha jaisa maine kaha, phir Aap hanse. Hum ne kaha, Ai Rasulullah, kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? Aap ne farmaya: Banda - ya farmaya: Main bande par tajjub karta hun - jab wo kehta hai: Tere siwa koi mabud nahi; maine apni jaan par zulm kiya, pas mujhe bakhsh de, kyunke tere siwa koi gunahon ko nahi bakhshta; wo janta hai ke us ke siwa gunahon ko koi nahi bakhshta."
"89","Hamein Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, Ali ibn Rabia se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Ali ke peeche sawar tha, aur jab unhon ne apna qadam rakab mein rakha to kaha, Bismillah; jab zeen par jam gaye to kaha, Alhamdulillah. Phir unhon ne kaha: {Paak hai Wo jis ne is ko hamare liye musakhkhar kar diya, aur hum is par qudrat nahi rakhte the}, poori ayat. Phir unhon ne kaha: Alhamdulillah, Alhamdulillah, Alhamdulillah, teen martaba; Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar, teen martaba. Phir kaha: SubhanAllah, SubhanAllah, SubhanAllah, teen martaba. Phir kaha: Tere siwa koi mabud nahi, paak hai Tu; maine apni jaan par zulm kiya, pas mujhe bakhsh de, kyunke tere siwa koi gunahon ko nahi bakhshta. Phir wo hanse. Maine kaha, Ai Amir al-Mumineen, aap kis baat par hanse? Unhon ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke peeche sawar tha, aur Aap ne waisa hi kiya jaisa tum ne mujhe karte dekha, phir Aap hanse. Maine kaha, Ai Rasulullah, aap kis baat par hanse? Aap ne farmaya: Main apne Rab par tajjub karta hun; Wo apne bande par tajjub farmata hai jab wo kehta hai: Mere gunah bakhsh de, kyunke tere siwa koi gunahon ko nahi bakhshta. Aap ne farmaya: Mera banda janta hai ke us ka mere siwa koi Rab nahi hai."
"90","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shayba ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ibn Adam ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: mujhe Ubayd Allah al-Ashjai ne bayan kiya, Sufyan ibn Said se, Uthman ibn al-Mughira al-Thaqafi se, Salim ibn Abi al-Jad se, Ali ibn Alqama al-Anmari se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab ye ayat nazil hui {Ai iman walo, jab tum Rasul se sargoshi karo to apni sargoshi se pehle sadqa pesh karo} to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal hai, ek dinar? Maine kaha: Log is ki taqat nahi rakhte. Aap ne farmaya, To phir kitna? Maine kaha: Jo ka ek dana. Aap ne farmaya: Tum bahut zahid ho. Phir ye ayat nazil hui: {Kya tum sargoshi se pehle sadqat pesh karne se dar gaye}, poori ayat. Mere zariye Allah ne is ummat par takhfeef farma di."
"91","Hamein Safwan ibn Isa ne bayan kiya, al-Harith ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Said ibn al-Musayyab se, Ali ibn Abi Talib se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sakhtiyon mein wuzu ko mukammal karna, paidal chal kar masajid ki taraf jana, aur ek namaz ke baad dusri namaz ka intezar karna gunahon ko achhi tarah dho deta hai."
"92","Hamein Muhammad ibn Bishr ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Abi al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, hamein Zayd ibn Aslam ne bayan kiya, Abu Sinan al-Duali Yazid ibn Umayya se, unhon ne farmaya: Ali ek aisi beemari mein mubtala hue jis mein hamein un ke baare mein andesha hua, phir wo sehatyaab ho gaye aur tandrust ho gaye. Hum ne kaha: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne aap ko shifa di, ai Amir al-Mumineen; hamein aap ki is beemari mein aap ke baare mein khauf tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Lekin mujhe apne baare mein khauf nahi tha. Sadiq o Musaddaq ne mujh se bayan farmaya, kehte hue: Tumhein maut nahi aayegi yahan tak ke tumhara ye hissa zakhmi kiya jaye, yani un ka sir, aur ye khoon se ranga jaye, yani un ki dadhi, aur tumhein sab se zyada badbakht shakhs qatl karega, jaisa ke falan qaum ke sab se badbakht shakhs ne Allah ki oontni ki koonchein kaati thin; unhon ne apni raan ki taraf ishara karte hue takhsees farmayi: Thamud ke alawa duniya."
"93","Hamein Abu Nuaym aur Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Israil se, Abu Ishaq se, Hubayra se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Ramzan ke akhiri ashre mein apne ghar walon ko jagate the."
"94","Hamein Yala ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murra se, Abu al-Bakhtari se, Ali se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe Yaman bheja, aur maine arz kiya, Ai Rasulullah, aap mujhe bhej rahe hain jabke main kam umar hun ke un ke darmiyan faisla karun, aur main faisla karna nahi janta? Aap ne apne haath se mere seene par mara aur farmaya: Ai Allah, is ke dil ko hidayat de aur is ki zaban ko sabit qadam rakh. Unhon ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne dane ko phaada, us ke baad do ke darmiyan faisla karne mein mujhe kabhi shak nahi hua."
"95","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Mukhtar ibn Nafi ne bayan kiya, Abu Matar se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab hum Amir al-Mumineen ke saath masjid mein al-Rahba ke darwaze par Musalmanon ke saath baithe hue the, ek shakhs Ali ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe dopahar ke waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka wuzu dikhaiye. Unhon ne Qanbar ko bulaya aur farmaya, Mere liye pani ka ek pyala lao. Unhon ne apne hathon aur chehre ko teen martaba dhoya, apni kuch ungliyan munh mein dakhil ki, teen martaba naak jhadi, apne bazuon ko teen martaba dhoya, sir ka ek martaba masah kiya, phir farmaya, yani kanon ke baare mein: In ka zahir sir ka hissa hai aur in ka batin chehre ka hissa hai; aur pairon ko takhnon tak dhoya, dadhi seene par tapak rahi thi. Phir wuzu ke baad ek ghoont piya, phir farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke wuzu ke baare mein puchhne wala kahan hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka wuzu aisa hi tha."
"96","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Mukhtar ibn Nafi ne bayan kiya, Abu Matar se, unhon ne farmaya: Main masjid se nikla jab ek shakhs ne mere peeche se pukara: Apna tehband ooncha rakho, kyunke ye tumhare kapde ke liye zyada saaf hai aur tumhare liye zyada taqwa ka bais hai, aur apne sir mein se kuch lo agar tum Musalman ho. Main us ke peeche chala jabke wo mere aage tha, tehband bandhe hue, chadar odhe hue, haath mein asa liye hue, goya ek sehrai badwi ho. Maine kaha, Ye kaun hai? Ek shakhs ne mujh se kaha, Main dekhta hun tum is sheher mein ajnabi ho? Maine kaha, Haan, Basra ka ek aadmi hun. Us ne kaha, Ye Ali, Amir al-Mumineen hain. Wo chalte rahe yahan tak ke Bani Abi Muayt ke ghar, oont bazaar tak pahunche aur farmaya: Becho aur qasam na khao, kyunke qasam saman ko bech to deti hai magar barkat ko mita deti hai. Phir wo khajoor faroshon ke paas aaye, aur ek kaneez ro rahi thi. Unhon ne farmaya, Tumhein kya rula raha hai? Us ne kaha, Is shakhs ne mujhe ek dirham mein khajoorein bechi thin, lekin mere aqaon ne use wapas kar diya aur ye use qubool karne se inkar kar raha hai. Ali ne us se kaha, Apni khajoorein lo aur use us ka dirham wapas do, kyunke us ko ikhtiyar nahi hai. Us ne use jhidak diya, to maine kaha, Kya tum jante ho ye kaun hain? Us ne kaha, Nahi. Maine kaha, Ye Ali, Amir al-Mumineen hain. Us ne apni khajoorein undel din aur use us ka dirham de diya. Us ne kaha, Main chahta hun ke aap mujh se raazi ho jayen, ai Amir al-Mumineen. Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhare baare mein mujhe jo cheez raazi karegi wo ye hai jab tum un ke huqooq ada karoge. Phir wo khajoor faroshon ke paas se guzre aur farmaya, Ai khajoor faroshon, miskeenon ko khilao; tumhari kamai mein izafa hoga. Phir Musalmanon ke saath aage badhe yahan tak ke machhli faroshon tak pahunche aur farmaya, Hamare bazaar mein koi teerthi hui murda machhli farokht na ki jaye. Phir wo Dar Furat, kapda bazaar aaye aur ek budhe aadmi ke paas aaye aur farmaya, Ai budhe, mujhe teen dirham mein achhi tarah ek qamees bech do. Jab us ne unhein pehchana to un se khareedna na chaha. Phir wo dusre ke paas aaye, aur jab us ne unhein pehchana to un se khareedna na chaha. Wo ek naujawan ladke ke paas aaye aur us se teen dirham mein ek qamees khareedi, use kalaiyon aur takhnon ke darmiyan pehente hue, pehente waqt kehte hue: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mujhe zeenat ka libas ataa kiya jis se main logon mein khud ko muzayyan karta hun aur apna satr chhupata hun. Un se kaha gaya, Ai Amir al-Mumineen, kya ye koi baat hai jo aap apni taraf se bayan kar rahe hain ya koi baat jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se suni hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Balke ye koi baat hai jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kapda pehente waqt suni hai. Kapde ke malik, ladke ke baap aaya, aur us se kaha gaya, Ai falan, tumhare bete ne aaj Amir al-Mumineen ko teen dirham mein ek qamees bechi hai. Us ne kaha, Kaash tum ne us se do dirham liye hote. Us ke baap ne ek dirham liya, phir use Amir al-Mumineen ke paas laya jabke wo Musalmanon ke saath al-Rahba ke darwaze par baithe hue the aur kaha, Ye dirham rakhein. Unhon ne farmaya, Ye kaunsa dirham hai? Us ne kaha, Hamari qamees do dirham ki thi. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne mujhe apni raza se bechi aur apni raza se qeemat li."
"97","Hamein Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Shayban ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne farmaya: mujhe Yaish ibn al-Walid ibn Hisham ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: al-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam se riwayat ki gayi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein pehli ummaton ki beemari sarayat kar aayi hai: hasad aur baghz, aur baghz moonDne wali hai. Main nahi kehta ke wo baal ko moonDti hai, balke wo deen ko moonDti hai. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, tum Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoge yahan tak ke iman lao, aur tum iman nahi laoge yahan tak ke ek dusre se muhabbat karo. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein ek aisi baat na bataun ke agar tum use karoge to ek dusre se muhabbat karoge? Unhon ne kaha, Wo kya hai, ai Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aapas mein salam ko phailao."
"98","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shayba ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: mujhe Ibn Numayr aur Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ubayda se, Muhammad ibn Thabit se, Abu Hakim ghulam al-Zubayr se, al-Zubayr, Allah un se raazi ho, se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Bandon par koi subah tali nahi hoti magar ek pukarne wala pukarta hai: Paak Badshah, Quddus ki tasbeeh karo."
"99","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shayba ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: hamein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ajlan se, Amir ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Zubayr se, Abd Allah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) dua ke liye baithe to Aap apni dahini hatheli ko apni dahini raan par rakhte, shahadat ki ungli se ishara karte, anguthe ko beech ki ungli par rakhte, apna bayan haath apni bayen raan par rakhte, aur apni bayen hatheli ko apne ghutne par jama dete."
"100","Hamein Husayn al-Jufi aur Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, Zaida se, Simak se, Musa ibn Talha se, un ke walid, Allah un se raazi ho, se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek ko chahiye ke apne samne zine ki pichhli lakdi jaisi koi cheez rakh le, phir namaz padhe."
"101","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Musa ibn Talha se, unke walid se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se kisi ke liye ye kaafi hai ke uske samne kaathi ki pichli lakdi jaisi cheez ho, phir jo kuchh uske samne se guzre woh use nuqsan na pahunchayega."
"102","Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Musa ibn Talha se, unke walid se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam khajoor ke darakhton par chadhe hue logon ke paas se guzre aur farmaya: Ye kya kar rahe hain, unhone kaha: Ye tabeer karte hain, nar ko mada me daalte hain to us se phal lagta hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mera khayal hai ye kuchh faida nahi deta, unhein ye baat pahunchayi gayi to unhone ise chhod diya, Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko iski khabar di gayi to Aap ne farmaya: Agar is se unhein faida hota hai to woh ise karein, maine sirf ek raay qaim ki thi to raay par mera muakhaza na karo, lekin jab main tumhein Allah azza wa jalla ki taraf se koi baat bataun to use le lo, kyunke maine Allah azza wa jalla ke baare me kabhi jhoot nahi bola."
"103","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Bilal ibn Yahya ibn Talha ibn Ubayd Allah se, unke walid se, unke dada se, unhone kaha: Jab Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam hilal dekhte to farmate: Ae Allah, ise hum par yumn aur iman ke saath, salamati aur islam ke saath tulu farma, mera aur tumhara Rabb Allah hai."
"104","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Talha ibn Yahya se, unhone kaha: Ibrahim ibn Muhammad ibn Talha ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd Allah ibn Shaddad se, unhone kaha: Banu Udhra ke teen aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaye aur islam laye, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Inhe mere liye kaun apne zimme lega, Talha ne kaha: Main lunga, woh mere paas tehre, logon me ek muhim ka elaan hua to un me se ek us me nikla aur shaheed ho gaya, woh rahe jitna Allah ne chaha, phir ek aur ka elaan hua to dusra us me nikla aur shaheed ho gaya, teesra raha yahan tak ke apne bistar par faut hua, Talha ne kaha: Maine neend me dekha goya mujhe Jannat me dakhil kiya gaya aur maine unhein dekha, unhein unke nasab aur alamat se pehchanta tha, jo apne bistar par mara tha woh un me sab se pehle dakhil hua, phir uske baad shaheedon me se dusra, aur un me se pehla un sab se aakhir me tha, is baat ne mujhe fikr me daal diya to main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur un se iska zikr kiya, Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jalla ke nazdeek us momin se badh kar koi fazeelat wala nahi jo islam me lambi umr paye apne takbeer, tahmeed, tasbeeh aur tauheed ki wajah se."
"105","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Talha ibn Abd Allah ibn Awf se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Sahl se, Said ibn Zayd ibn Amr ibn Nufayl se, unhone kaha: Maine Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Jo shakhs na-haq ek balisht zameen lega Qayamat ke din use saat zameenon se uska tauq pehnaya jayega."
"106","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unke walid se, Abu Ubayda ibn Muhammad ibn Ammar se, Talha ibn Abd Allah ibn Awf se, Said ibn Zayd se, Allah un se raazi ho: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Jo apne deen ka difa karte hue qatl kiya jaye woh shaheed hai, jo apne maal ka difa karte hue qatl kiya jaye woh shaheed hai, jo apne khoon ka difa karte hue qatl kiya jaye woh shaheed hai, aur jo apne ahl o ayal ka difa karte hue qatl kiya jaye woh shaheed hai."
"107","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, al-Jurayri ne hamein khabar di, Abu al-Ward ibn Thumama se, al-Lajlaj se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, Allah un se raazi ho, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek aadmi ke paas se guzre jo keh raha tha: Ae Allah main Tujh se sabr mangta hun, Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tune Allah se aazmaish mangi hai to Us se aafiyat mang, Aap ek aadmi ke paas se guzre jo keh raha tha: Ae Allah main Tujh se naimat ke tamam hone ka sawal karta hun, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam kya tu janta hai naimat ka tamam hona kya hai, usne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul ek dua hai jo maine bhalai ki ummeed me mangi hai, Aap ne farmaya: Naimat ka tamam hona Jannat me dakhil hona aur Aag se nijaat pana hai, Aap ek aadmi ke paas se guzre jo keh raha tha: Ae jalal aur ikram wale, Aap ne farmaya: Teri dua qubool kar li gayi hai to mang."
"108","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Baqiyya ibn al-Walid ne hamein khabar di, Safwan ibn Amr se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Jubayr aur Shurayh ibn Ubayd al-Hadrami se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Faisla karne wala apne faisle me ek phislan wali jagah utarta hai jo Adan se zyada door hai, jo Jahannam me sab se zyada numayan hai."
"109","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Baqiyya ne hamein khabar di, Bahir ibn Sad se, Khalid ibn Madan se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jihad do tarah ka jihad hai, raha woh jo is se Allah ki raza chahta hai, ameer ki itaat karta hai, qeemti maal kharch karta hai, saathi se narmi karta hai aur fasad se bachta hai to uski neend aur bedari sab ajr hai, aur raha woh jo fakhr, riya aur shohrat ke liye jihad karta hai, ameer ki nafarmani karta hai aur zameen me fasad karta hai to woh kuchh bhi lekar nahi lautega."
"110","Husayn al-Jufi yani ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaida se, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Muadh ibn Jabal se: Ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul us aadmi ke baare me Aap kya farmate hain jo ek aurat se mila jis se uski koi pehchan na thi, aur jo kuchh aadmi apni biwi se karta hai usne us se kiya siwa iske ke usne us se jima na kiya, phir Allah azza wa jalla ne nazil farmaya: 'Din ke dono kinaron aur raat ke kuchh hisson me namaz qaim karo, beshak nekiyan buraiyon ko door karti hain, ye naseehat hasil karne walon ke liye naseehat hai', Aap ne use wuzu karke namaz padhne ka hukm diya, Muadh ne kaha: Maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul kya ye uske liye khaas hai ya mominon ke liye aam tor par hai, Aap ne farmaya: Balke mominon ke liye aam tor par hai."
"111","Husayn al-Jufi ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaida se, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, unhone kaha: Do aadmiyon ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ek dusre ko bura bhala kaha aur un me se ek ko shadeed gussa aaya yahan tak ke goya uski naak tadap rahi thi, Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Main ek kalima janta hun ke agar ye ghusse wala use keh le to uska gussa jata rahe: Main Allah Sami Alim ki panah mangta hun shaitan mardood se, unhone kaha: Tadapna yani goya shiddat e ghazab se phat padna."
"112","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhone kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Asim ibn Abi al-Nujud se, Abu Wail se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, unhone kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath ek safar me tha aur ek subah main Aap ke qareeb tha jabke hum safar kar rahe the, maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi mujhe aise amal ki khabar dijiye jo mujhe Jannat me dakhil kare aur Aag se door kare, Aap ne farmaya: Tune ek azeem muamle ke baare me puchha hai magar ye uske liye aasan hai jiske liye Allah ise aasan kare: Tu Allah ki ibadat kare aur Uske saath kisi ko shareek na kare, namaz qaim kare, zakat de, Ramazan ke mahine ke roze rakhe aur Baitullah ka hajj kare, phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein bhalai ke darwazon ki rehnumai na karun, roza dhaal hai, sadqa gunah ko bujha deta hai aur aadmi ki namaz raat ke andhere me, phir Aap ne tilawat ki: 'Unke pehlu bistaron se alag rehte hain', phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein muamle ke sar, uske sutun aur uske kohan ki bulandi ki khabar na dun, maine kaha: Kyun nahi Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne farmaya: Muamle ka sar Islam hai, uska sutun namaz hai aur uske kohan ki bulandi jihad hai, phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein in sab ke nigrani wale ki khabar na dun, maine kaha: Kyun nahi Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne apni zuban pakdi aur farmaya: Ise apne upar rok kar rakh, maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul kya waqai hum jo bolte hain us par hamara muakhaza hoga, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh teri maa tujhe gum paye, Qayamat ke din logon ko Aag me unke chehron par ya unki naakon par unki zabanon ki katayi ke siwa aur kya girayega."
"113","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Hamid ibn Bahram se, unhone kaha: Shahr ibn Hawshab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Ghanm ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muadh ibn Jabal se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jiske haath me meri jaan hai, farz namaz ke baad Jannat ke darjat talb karne wale kisi amal me chehra zard hona aur qadam ghubaar alood hona Allah ke raste me jihad jaisa nahi, aur na bande ka tarazu aisi sawari se bhari hota hai jo Allah azza wa jalla ke raste me uske liye halak ho ya Allah ke raste me sawari ke tor par istemal ho."
"114","Husayn ibn Ali al-Jufi ne hum se bayan kiya, Fudayl ibn Iyad se, Aban se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Shaitan Ibn Adam ka bhediya hai jaise bakriyon ka bhediya, bakriyon ka bhediya kamzor aur bhatki hui bakri ko pakadta hai aur jamaat me dakhil nahi hota, to umumiyat, jamaat aur masajid ko lazam pakdo."
"115","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdillah ibn Amir al-Aslami se, al-Walid ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Jubayr ibn Nufayr se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ki panah mango us tama se jo pakki bukhl me le jaye, us tama se jisme koi tawaqqo nahi, aur us tama se jahan tama ki koi bunyad nahi."
"116","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Suhayb se, Anas ibn Malik se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Muadh se farmaya: Ae Muadh, unhone kaha: Hazir hun Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh, unhone kaha: Hazir hun Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh, unhone kaha: Hazir hun Ae Allah ke Rasul, Aap ne farmaya: Logon ko khushkhabri do, jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi woh Jannat me dakhil hoga."
"117","Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Shuba ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo maut ke waqt ikhlas se kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, woh Jannat me dakhil hoga."
"118","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Maine Amr ibn Dinar al-Makki ko suna, unhone kaha: Jabir ibn Abdillah al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muadh ibn Jabal ne apni beemari me kaha: Agar ye na hota ke tum is par bharosa karne lagoge to main tumhein ek hadees sunata jo maine Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suni, Aap ne farmaya: Jo is haal me mare ke uske dil me yaqeen ke saath Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi hai woh Jannat me dakhil hoga."
"119","Abu Asim al-Nabil ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Jurayj ne khabar di, unhone kaha: Sulayman ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Malik ibn Yukhamir ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muadh ibn Jabal ne bayan kiya ke unhone Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Jo musalman mard Allah ke raste me oontni ke do dohano ke darmiyani waqt ke barabar qital kare uske liye Jannat wajib ho jati hai, jo apne dil me ikhlas se Allah se shahadat mange use shaheed ke ajr jaisa milega, jo Allah ke raste me zakhmi ho ya Allah ke raste me use koi hadsa pesh aaye to woh is haal me aayega ke khoon kasrat se beh raha hoga, uska rang zaafran jaisa aur khushbu mushk jaisi hogi, jo Allah ke raste me zakhmi ho us par shaheedon ki muhr hogi."
"120","Abdillah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Haywah ibn Shurayh ne bayan kiya, Uqbah ibn Muslim se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, al-Sunabihi se, Muadh ibn Jabal se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek din mera haath pakda aur farmaya: Ae Muadh beshak main Allah ke liye tum se muhabbat karta hun, Muadh ne kaha: Mere maa baap Aap par qurban, Allah ki qasam beshak main Aap se muhabbat karta hun, phir Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Muadh har namaz ke baad ye kehna na chhodna: Ae Allah meri madad farma ke main Tujhe yaad karun, Tera shukr ada karun aur Teri umda ibadat karun, aur Muadh ne iski waseeyat al-Sunabihi ko ki, aur al-Sunabihi ne Abu Abd al-Rahman ko waseeyat ki, aur Abu Abd al-Rahman ne Uqbah ibn Muslim ko waseeyat ki."
"121","Ismail ibn Abi Uways ne hum se riwayat ki, Abd al-Aziz ibn al-Muttalib ne riwayat ki, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Ayyash se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shuayb se, unhon ne Tawus se, unhon ne Muadh se, unhon ne Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se ke aap ne farmaya: Jis ne nikah na kiya ho us ki talaq nahi, jo kisi cheez ka malik na ho us ka azaad karna nahi, aur Allah ki nafarmani me koi mannat nahi."
"122","Abu Nuaym ne hum se riwayat ki, Hisham ibn Sad ne riwayat ki, Abu al-Zubayr se, Abu al-Tufayl se, Muadh ibn Jabal se ke hum Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath ghazwah-e-Tabuk par nikle, aur aap dopahar ko koch na karte hatta ke thandak ho jati, aur aap Zuhr aur Asr ko jama karte, phir sham me Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karte."
"123","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se riwayat ki, Israil ibn Yunus se, Yahya se, Ubaydullah ibn Muslim al-Hadrami se, Muadh se ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Koi do Musalman aise nahi jin ke teen bachche faut ho jayen magar Allah apne fazl o rehmat se un ke walidain ko Jannat me dakhil karega. Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ya do hon to? Aap ne farmaya: Ya do hon to bhi. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ya ek ho to? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak hamal-e-saqit bhi apni naal se apni maan ko kheench kar Jannat tak le jata hai."
"124","Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se riwayat ki, Shubah ne riwayat ki, kaha: Abu Awn ne mujhe khabar di, al-Harith ibn Amr se jo al-Mughirah ibn Shubah ke bhai hain, Muadh ke ashab me se jo ehl-e-Hims me se hain, Muadh se ke jab Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne unhen Yaman bheja to aap ne un se farmaya: Jab tumhare paas koi muqaddama pesh ho to kaise faisla karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Main Kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karunga. Aap ne farmaya: Agar Kitabullah me na mile to? Unhon ne kaha: To Sunnat-e-Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke mutabiq. Aap ne farmaya: Agar Sunnat-e-Rasulullah me bhi na mile to? Unhon ne kaha: Main apni raay se ijtihad karunga aur koi kasar na chhodunga. Kaha: Phir Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne un ke seene par haath mara aur farmaya: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne Rasulullah ke qasid ko us cheez ki tawfiq di jo Rasulullah ko pasand hai."
"125","Al-Qanabi ne hum se riwayat ki, Malik ne riwayat ki, Abu Hazim se, Abu Idris se, Muadh se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jalla farmata hai: Meri muhabbat un logon ke liye wajib ho gayi jo meri khatir aapas me muhabbat karte hain, jo meri khatir aapas me mulaqat karte hain, jo meri khatir aapas me kharch karte hain, aur jo meri khatir aapas me majalis jamate hain."
"126","Amr ibn Asim al-Kilabi ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hammad ibn Salamah ne khabar di, Asim ibn Bahdalah se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Abu Zabyah se, Muadh ibn Jabal se ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman aisa nahi jo ba-taharat Allah azza wa jalla ka zikr karte hue soye, phir raat me bedar ho kar Allah se duniya o akhirat ki koi bhalai mange magar Allah use ata farma deta hai. Hammad ne kaha: Thabit al-Bunani ne kaha: Abu Zabyah hamare paas aaye aur hum se yeh hadith bayan ki."
"127","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne riwayat ki, Yahya ibn Said se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Tawus se, Muadh se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn-e-Adam ne aag se bachao ka koi amal zikr-e-Allah azza wa jalla se badh kar nahi kiya. Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya Allah ke raste me jihad bhi nahi? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste me jihad bhi nahi, illa yeh ke tum apni talwar se maro hatta ke woh toot jaye, phir maro hatta ke toot jaye; aap ne teen martaba farmaya."
"128","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, al-Hasan ibn Musa ne riwayat ki, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Ata ibn al-Saib se, Abu Razin se, Muadh ibn Jabal se ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne un se farmaya: Kya main tumhen Jannat ke darwazon me se ek darwaze ki rehnumai na karun? Unhon ne kaha: Woh kaun sa hai? Aap ne farmaya: La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah."
"129","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abu Muawiyah ne riwayat ki, Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, al-Harith ibn Umayr al-Zubayri se ke unhon ne kaha: Sham me ta'un phoot pada to Muadh Hims me logon ke darmiyan khade hue aur khutba diya, kaha: Yeh ta'un tumhare Rab ki rehmat, tumhare Nabi ki dua, aur tum se pehle saleheen ki wafaat hai."
"130","Musnad Sad ibn Abi Waqqas radiyallahu anhu. Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, kaha: Salim ibn Ubayd ne khabar di, Abu Abdillah se, Muhammad ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, un ke walid se ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam farmaya karte the: Har Musalman ke liye teen cheezen hain: Koi Musalman mard jo Allah ke raste me dushman par teer chalaye, chahe lage ya khata jaye, magar us teer ka sawab us ke liye ek jaan azaad karne ke barabar hai; koi Musalman mard jis ka koi baal Allah ke raste me safed ho jaye to woh Qayamat ke din us ke liye roshni hoga jo us ke aage chamkegi; aur koi Musalman mard jo kisi chhote ya bade ghulam ko azaad kare to Allah par lazim hai ke us ke har uzu ke badle use kai guna badla de."
"131","Abd al-Aziz ibn Aban ne hum se riwayat ki, Israil ne riwayat ki, al-Miqdam ibn Shurayh se, un ke walid se, Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se ke mushrikeen ne Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se kaha: In logon ko hum se door kar dijiye kahin yeh hum par jurrat na karen. Wahan Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke chaar ashab mojood the, aur aap ke dil me jo Allah ne chaha khayal aaya, to yeh ayat nazil hui: 'Aur un logon ko mat hatayiye jo subh o sham apne Rab ko pukarte hain' aakhir-e-ayat tak."
"132","Salm ibn Qutaybah ne hum se riwayat ki, Shubah ne riwayat ki, Simak se, Musab ibn Sad se, un ke walid se ke unhon ne kaha: Mere baare me chaar aayaten nazil huin. Kaha: Meri walidah ne qasam khai ke woh na khana khayegi na peena piyegi hatta ke main Muhammad sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ka inkar kar dun. Kaha: Jab hum use khilana chahte to ek lakdi le kar us ke munh me daalte aur khana peena us ke munh me undelte; to mere baare me yeh ayat nazil hui: 'Aur hum ne insan ko us ke walidain ke saath husn-e-sulook ka hukm diya' us ke qaul 'lekin agar woh tum par zor dein ke tum mere saath us cheez ko shareek karo jis ka tumhen ilm nahi' tak. Kaha: Hum sharab pee rahe the aur fakhr kar rahe the; to main ne Ansar ke ek mard ke muqable me fakhr kiya to us ne oont ke jabde ki haddi utha kar mere naak par mari aur use phaad diya; to Sad ki naak phat gayi. Kaha: Phir mere baare me sharab ki hurmat nazil hui. Kaha: Jang-e-Badr ke din mujhe ek talwar mili to main use Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas laya aur kaha: Ya Nabi Allah, use ghanimat ke taur par mujhe ata kar dijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Use rakh do. Kaha: Main ne kaha: Sakht ladne wale ko us jaisa na banaiye jo qital nahi karta. To Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use rakh do. Phir yeh nazil hua: 'Woh aap se ghanimaton ke baare me sawal karte hain'. Kaha: Aur mere baare me wasiyat ki ayat nazil hui."
"133","Abd al-Razzaq ne humen khabar di, Mamar ne riwayat ki, al-Zuhri se, Amir ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, un ke walid se ke unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath Hajjatul Wada ke mauqe par tha aur main ek aise marz me mubtala ho gaya jis se mujhe maut ka andesha hua. To Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam meri ayadat ko tashreef laye, aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas bahut maal hai aur meri ek beti ke siwa koi waris nahi; kya main apne maal ka do tihai wasiyat kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Main ne kaha: To apne maal ka nisf? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Main ne kaha: To apne maal ka tihai? Aap ne farmaya: Tihai, aur tihai bhi bahut hai. Beshak ay Sad, agar tum apne warison ko ghani chhod jao to yeh is se behtar hai ke unhen mohtaaj chhodo jo logon se mangte phiren. Beshak ay Sad, tum Allah ka chehra chahte hue jo bhi kharch karoge us par tumhen ajr diya jayega, hatta ke woh luqma bhi jo tum apni biwi ke munh me rakhte ho. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya main apne sathiyon ke baad peeche chhod diya jaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum peeche chhod diye gaye aur tum ne Allah azza wa jalla ka chehra chahte hue koi amal kiya to tum is se darja o bulandi me hi badhoge; aur shayad tum peeche chhode jao taake Allah tumhare zariye kuch logon ko nafa pahunchaye aur kuch ko nuqsan. Ay Allah, mere ashab ki hijrat ko mukammal farma aur unhen un ke qadmon par wapas na lauta. Lekin bad-naseeb Sad ibn Khawlah - Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne un par rahem farmaya, kyunke woh Makkah me faut ho gaye the."
"134","Jafar ne hum se riwayat ki, Musa al-Juhani ne riwayat ki, Musab ibn Sad se, un ke walid se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne paas baithe hue logon se farmaya: Kya tum me se koi rozana ek hazar nekiyan kamane se aajiz hai? Unhon ne kaha: Hum me se koi rozana ek hazar nekiyan kaise kama sakta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh sau martaba Allah ki tasbeeh kare to is ke sabab us ke liye ek hazar nekiyan likh di jati hain, aur is ke sabab us se ek hazar gunah mita diye jate hain."
"135","Said ibn Amir ne hum se riwayat ki, Shubah se, Asim al-Ahwal se, Abu Uthman se, Sad aur Abu Bakrah se, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se ke aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs jaan boojh kar apne baap ke siwa kisi aur ki taraf apni nisbat kare jabke woh janta hai ke woh us ka baap nahi, to us par Jannat haram hai."
"136","Jafar ne humen khabar di, Musa al-Juhani ne khabar di, Musab se, un ke walid se ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe kuch kalime sikhaiye jo main kahun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, woh akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahi; Allah bahut bada hai, bahut bada; Allah ke liye bahut zyada hamd hai; paak hai Allah jo tamam jahanon ka Rab hai; aur gunah se bachne ki taqat aur neki ki quwwat sirf Allah ke zariye hai, jo zabardast hikmat wala hai. Us ne kaha: Yeh to mere Rab ke liye hai, to mere liye kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ay Allah, mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehem farma, mujhe hidayat de, mujhe aafiyat de, aur mujhe rizq ata farma."
"137","Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se riwayat ki, Usamah ibn Zayd ne riwayat ki, Ibn Labibah se, Sad se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen zikr posheeda zikr hai, aur behtareen rizq woh hai jo kafi ho jaye."
"138","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se riwayat ki, Mamar ne humen khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, Umar ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, kaha: Sad ibn Abi Waqqas ne bayan kiya, kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman se qital karna kufr hai, aur use gaali dena fisq hai, aur kisi Musalman ke liye apne bhai ko teen din se zyada chhodna jaiz nahi."
"139","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se riwayat ki, Mamar ne khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, al-Ayzar ibn Hurayth se, Umar ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, un ke walid se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main momin par ta'ajjub karta hun; agar use khair pahunchti hai to woh Allah azza wa jalla ki hamd karta hai aur shukr ada karta hai, aur agar use musibat pahunchti hai to woh Allah ki hamd karta hai aur sabr karta hai. To momin ko us ke har muamle me ajr diya jata hai, hatta ke us luqme par bhi jo woh apni biwi ke munh me dalta hai."
"140","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se riwayat ki, Mamar ne riwayat ki, al-Zuhri se, Amir ibn Sad se, un ke walid se ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne kuch logon ko ata farmaya aur un me se ek aadmi ko kuch na diya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aap ne falan falan ko ata farmaya aur falan ko kuch na diya, halanke woh momin hai. To Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ya Musalman - aap ne ise teen martaba farmaya. Al-Zuhri ne kaha: To hum Islam ko zabani iqrar aur iman ko amali tasdeeq shumar karte hain."
"141","'Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar ne khabar di, az al-Zuhri, az 'Amir ibn Sa'd, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne chhipkali ko qatl karne ka hukm diya aur use chhoti fasiqah qarar diya."
"142","Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, az Hakim ibn 'Abdillah, az 'Amir ibn Sa'd, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs azan sunte waqt kahe: Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud-e-barhaq nahin, wah akela hai, us ka koi sharik nahin, aur Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain; main Allah ke Rab hone par aur Muhammad ke Nabi hone par razi hun, to us ka gunah bakhsh diya jata hai.' Main ne kaha: Us ke guzishta gunah? Unhon ne kaha: Aisa nahin; Sa'd ne kaha: Unhon ne farmaya: Us ka gunah bakhsh diya jata hai."
"143","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne bayan kiya, main ne al-Ayzar ibn Hurayth ko 'Umar ibn Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas se riwayat karte hue suna, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Main Musalman par ta'ajjub karta hun; agar use bhalai pahunche to Allah 'azza wa jall ki hamd karta hai aur shukr ada karta hai, aur agar use musibat pahunche to use sawab ke liye shumar karta hai aur sabr karta hai. Beshak Musalman ko har cheez mein ajr diya jata hai, hatta ke us luqme mein bhi jise wah apne munh tak uthata hai.'"
"144","'Abd al-Malik ibn 'Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: 'Abdillah ibn Ja'far al-Mukharrimi ne bayan kiya, az Isma'il ibn Muhammad, az 'Amir ibn Sa'd, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam apni dayen taraf salam pherte to un ke bayen rukhsar ki safedi dikhai deti, aur jab apni bayen taraf salam pherte to un ke dayen rukhsar ki safedi dikhai deti."
"145","'Abd al-Malik ibn 'Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mus'ab ne bayan kiya, az 'Abdillah ibn 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ma'mar, unhon ne kaha: Kuch log 'Umar ibn 'Abd al-'Aziz ke pas se nikle aur unhon ne khabar di ke 'Amir ibn Sa'd ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs Madinah ke do harron ke darmiyan saat khajuren khaye, us din raat tak use koi zeher nuqsan nahin pahunchayega.'"
"146","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, az 'Asim ibn Abi al-Nujud, az Mus'ab ibn Sa'd, az Sa'd, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam se pucha gaya: Kin logon ko sab se sakht azmaya jata hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Ambiya ko, phir jo un se behtar hon, phir jo un se behtar hon. Admi ka imtihan us ke din ke mutabiq hota hai; agar us ke din mein pukhtagi ho to pukhtagi barha di jati hai, aur agar us ke din mein narmi ho to us ke liye halka kar diya jata hai. Aur bande se azmaish khatm nahin hoti hatta ke wah zamin par is hal mein chalta hai ke us par koi gunah nahin hota."
"147","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Salam ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, az Yunus ibn 'Ubayd, az Ziyad ibn Jubayr, az Sa'd, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne 'aurton se bay'at li to un ke samne ek 'aurat khari hui goya ke wah Mudar ki 'aurton mein se thi aur us ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, hum apne baapon, apne beton aur apne shauharon par bojh hain, to un ke mal mein se hamare liye kya halal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Taza paidawar; tum us mein se khao aur us mein se tohfe ke taur par do."
"148","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn 'Ayyash ne bayan kiya, az Musa ibn 'Ubaydah al-Rabadhi, az 'Abdillah ibn 'Ubaydah, az Sa'd ki beti, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Bani Israil ikhattar firqon mein bat gaye, aur raat din nahin guzrenge hatta ke meri ummat un hi ki manind bat jayegi, ya unhon ne kaha: usi ki manind; aur un mein se har firqah Jahannam mein hai siwaye ek ke, aur wah al-jama'ah hai.'"
"149","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Salih al-Tammar ne mujh se bayan kiya, az Sa'd ibn Ibrahim ibn 'Abd al-Rahman, unhon ne kaha: Main ne 'Amir ibn Sa'd ko un ke walid se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab Sa'd ibn Mu'adh ne Banu Qurayzah ke bare mein faisla kiya ke jin par ustura chal chuka ho unhen qatl kiya jaye, aur un ke amwal aur aulad taqsim kiye jayen, to Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Us ne aaj un ke darmiyan Allah 'azza wa jall ke hukm ke sath faisla kiya hai, jo Us ne sat asmanon ke upar muqarrar farmaya tha.'"
"150","'Abdillah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: 'Abd al-'Aziz ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, az al-'Ala ibn 'Abd al-Rahman, az Abu Kathir, ke Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas ek shakhs ke zimme apne qarz ki adayegi talab karne aye, to unhon ne kaha: Wah bahar gaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: To main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: 'Agar koi shakhs Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jaye, phir zindah kiya jaye, phir qatl kiya jaye, phir zindah kiya jaye, phir qatl kiya jaye, to wah Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga hatta ke apna qarz ada kare.'"
"151","Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Layth ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: 'Abdillah ibn Abi Mulaykah ne bayan kiya, az 'Abdillah ibn Abi Nahik, az Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Wah hum mein se nahin jo Qur'an ko khush awazi se nahin parhta.'"
"152","'Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, 'Asim ibn Bahdalah ne khabar di, az Mus'ab ibn Sa'd ibn Malik, az un ke walid, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ke pas ek pyala laya gaya aur unhon ne us mein se khaya, aur kuch baqi reh gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Is pahari raste se Jannat walon mein se ek admi ayega jo is baqi ko khayega.' Sa'd ne kaha: Main apne bhai 'Umayr ko wuzu karte hue chhor kar aya tha, aur main ne kaha: Wah 'Umayr hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir 'Abdillah ibn Salam aye aur use khaya."
"153","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, 'Abdillah ibn Numayr ne bayan kiya, az 'Uthman ibn Hakim, az 'Amir ibn Sa'd, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Main Madinah ke do harron ke darmiyan ko haram qarar deta hun, ke us ke kantedar darakht kate jayen ya us ke shikar ko qatl kiya jaye. Aur unhon ne farmaya: Madinah un ke liye behtar hai agar wah jante hote; jo koi us se naraz ho kar use chhorta hai to Allah us ki jagah us se behtar ko la deta hai, aur jo koi us ki sakhti aur mashaqqat par sabit qadam rehta hai to main Qiyamat ke Din us ke liye gawah ya sifarshi hun.'"
"154","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: 'Abdillah ibn Numayr ne bayan kiya, az Badr ibn 'Uthman, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Hafs ibn 'Umar ibn Sa'd ne mujh se bayan kiya, az 'Umar ibn Sa'd, az Sa'd, az Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam, unhon ne farmaya: 'Tum qatl, ta'un, dubne, pet ki bimari, aur bachcha jante hue marne wali 'aurat ki maut, us ki nifas mein maut ke zariye shahid qarar diye jate ho.'"
"155","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ibn al-Jarrah ne bayan kiya, az Sufyan, az Habib ibn Abi Thabit, az Ibrahim ibn Sa'd, az Sa'd ibn Malik, Usamah ibn Zayd, aur Khuzaymah ibn Thabit, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Ye ta'un gandagi hai aur us 'azab ka baqiyah hai jis se ek qaum ko 'azab diya gaya tha; pas agar wah kisi zamin mein waqe' ho jabke tum us mein ho to us se bhagte hue use na chhoro, aur agar wah kisi zamin mein waqe' ho aur tum us mein na ho to us mein dakhil na ho.'"
"156","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn 'Umar ne bayan kiya, az 'Abdillah ibn Ja'far, az Isma'il ibn Muhammad, az 'Amir ibn Sa'd, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jab bandah sajdah karta hai to sat haddiyon par sajdah karta hai: apne chehre, apne dono hathon, apne dono ghutnon, aur apne dono qadmon par; jo 'uzw wah nahin rakhta, us ne kami ki.'"
"157","'Abd al-Rahman ibn 'Awf radiyallahu 'anhu ki Musnad. Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Bilal ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: 'Amr ibn Abi 'Amr ne mujh se bayan kiya, az 'Asim ibn 'Umar ibn Qatadah al-Ansari, az 'Abd al-Wahid ibn Muhammad ibn 'Abd al-Rahman, az 'Abd al-Rahman ibn 'Awf radiyallahu 'anhu, ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne un se farmaya: 'Main Jibrail 'alaihis salam se mila aur unhon ne mujhe khushkhabri di, kehte hue: Beshak Allah 'azza wa jall tum se farmata hai: Jo tum par salat bheje, main us par salat bhejta hun, aur jo tum par salam bheje, main us par salam bhejta hun. Pas main ne shukr mein Allah ko sajdah kiya.'"
"158","Habban ibn Hilal ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Qasim ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, al-Nadr ibn Shayban ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Salamah se mila aur kaha: Mujhe koi hadith bayan karo jo tum ne apne walid se suni ho, jo tumhare walid ne Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam se suni ho, tumhare aur un ke darmiyan koi na ho. Unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, az Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam, unhon ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah 'azza wa jall ne Ramadan ke roze farz kiye hain, aur main ne us ke qiyam ko sunnat qarar diya hai; pas jo use iman aur sawab ki niyyat se roza rakhe aur qiyam kare wah gunahon se aise nikal jayega jaise us din tha jab us ki maan ne use jana tha.'"
"159","Habban ibn Hilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu 'Awanah ne bayan kiya, az 'Umar ibn Abi Salamah, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Falastin ke rehne walon mein se ek qass ne mujh se bayan kiya, az 'Abd al-Rahman ibn 'Awf, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Tin cheezen hain, qasam Us Zat ki jis ke Hath mein Muhammad ki jan hai, main un par zarur qasam khaunga: sadaqah se mal kam nahin hota, pas sadaqah karo; koi bandah Allah Ta'ala ki Raza chahte hue kisi zulm ko mu'af nahin karta magar Allah us ke zariye Qiyamat ke Din us ki 'izzat buland karta hai; aur koi bandah apne liye mangne ka darwazah nahin kholta magar Allah us ke liye faqr ka darwazah khol deta hai.'"
"160","Ibn Abi Fudayk ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne mujhe khabar di, az Muslim ibn Jundub, az Nawfal ibn Iyas al-Hudhali, unhon ne kaha: 'Abd al-Rahman ibn 'Awf hamare sathi the, aur kya hi behtarin sathi; ek din wah hamare sath wapas aye hatta ke hamen apne ghar le aye, phir andar dakhil hue aur ghusl kiya, phir bahar aye aur hamare sath baith gaye, aur hamare pas roti aur gosht se bhara ek tabaaq laya gaya. Jab use rakh diya gaya to 'Abd al-Rahman ro pare. Pas main ne un se kaha: Ai Abu Muhammad, tumhen kya cheez rulati hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam wafat pa gaye aur na unhon ne aur na un ke ghar walon ne kabhi jau ki roti se pet bhar kar khaya; pas main nahin samajhta ke hamen piche rakha gaya hai magar us ke liye jo hamare liye behtar hai."
"161","Ubayy ibn Kab radiyAllahu anhu ki riwayat. Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sulayman al-Taymi ne khabar di, Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: ek aadmi tha - main ahl-e-Madinah mein se kisi aise shakhs ko nahi janta jo qiblah ki taraf namaz padhta ho jiska ghar us se zyadah masjid se door ho - aur woh Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath namaz mein hazir hota tha. To us se kaha gaya: kaash tum ek gadha kharid lete jis par garmi aur tareeki mein sawar hote. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mujhe ye pasand nahi ke mera ghar masjid ke pehlu mein ho. Ye baat Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ko pahunchayi gayi, to aap ne us se is bare mein pucha. Us ne kaha: Ya RasulAllah, taake mere qadam, mera ghar walon ki taraf jana aur lautna, mera aana aur jana likha jaye - ya jaisa us ne kaha. To Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhein ye sab ata kar diya hai, aur tumhein woh sab de diya hai jiski tum ne ummeed ki thi - ya jaisa aap ne farmaya."
"162","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan al-Thawri ne khabar di, Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, Suwayd ibn Ghafalah se, unhon ne kaha: main Zayd ibn Suhan aur Salman ibn Rabiah ke saath nikla, aur mujhe ek koda mila to maine use utha liya. Unhon ne kaha: ise chhod do. Maine kaha: main ise janwaron ke liye nahi chhodunga; main ise le lunga aur is se faida uthaunga. Phir maine Ubayy ibn Kab se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: tum ne achha kiya. Mujhe Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein ek thaili mili jis mein sau dinar the, aur main use aap ke paas laya. Aap ne farmaya: ek saal tak iska elaan karo. To maine ek saal tak elaan kiya aur koi pehchanne wala na mila, phir main aap ke paas aaya. Aap ne farmaya: ek aur saal elaan karo. Phir main aap ke paas aaya, to aap ne farmaya: ek aur saal elaan karo. Phir aap ne farmaya: iski ginti, iska bandhan, aur iska zarf gino; phir agar iska talash karne wala aaye aur tumhein iski ginti, iska bandhan, aur iska zarf bataye to use de do, warna is se faida uthao."
"163","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan ne khabar di, Asim ibn Abi al-Nujud se, Zirr ibn Hubaysh se, unhon ne kaha: main Ubayy ibn Kab ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, Laylat al-Qadr ke bare mein aap kya kehte hain, kyunke Abdillah kehte hain: jo pura saal qiyam karega woh use pa lega? Unhon ne kaha: Allah Abu Abd al-Rahman par rehem farmaye; beshak woh jante hain ke woh Ramadan mein hai aur woh sattaiswin raat hai, lekin bahut se logon par ise poshida rakha gaya hai taake woh is par bharosa na kar lein. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Muhammad sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam par Kitab nazil farmayi, beshak woh Ramadan mein hai, aur beshak woh sattaiswin raat hai. Unhon ne kaha: maine kaha: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, aap ko kaise malum hua? Unhon ne kaha: us nishani se jo Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne hamein batayi thi, jise hum ne yaad rakha aur shumar kiya; Allah ki qasam, beshak woh yahi hai, bila istisna. Unhon ne kaha: maine Zirr se kaha: aur woh kaun si nishani hai jiska unhon ne zikr kiya? Suraj us subah aise tulu hota hai jaise ek tasht, us mein shu'aen nahi hotin."
"164","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Humayd al-Tawil ne khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: ek aadmi ne ek ayat padhi, jabke maine use mukhtalif tarah padha tha. To maine kaha: tumhein ye kis ne sikhayi? Us ne kaha: mujhe Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne sikhayi hai. To main uske saath Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas gaya aur kaha: Ya RasulAllah, kya aap ne mujhe falan falan ayat aise sikhayi thi? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Phir us aadmi ne kaha: kya aap ne mujhe falan falan ayat aise sikhayi thi? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Phir aap ne farmaya: Jibril aur Mikail mere paas aaye; Jibril mere dayen baitha aur Mikail mere bayen. Jibril ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, Quran ko ek harf par padhiye. Mikail ne kaha: zyadah talab kijiye. To maine kaha: mujhe zyadah dijiye. Us ne kaha: ise do huroof par padhiye. Mikail ne kaha: zyadah talab kijiye. To maine kaha: mujhe zyadah dijiye. Us ne kaha: ise teen huroof par padhiye. Mikail ne kaha: zyadah talab kijiye. To maine kaha: mujhe zyadah dijiye; is tarah yahan tak ke ye saat huroof tak pahunch gaya, Jibril har baar us se kehte: padhiye, aur Mikail kehte: zyadah talab kijiye, yahan tak ke ye saat huroof tak pahunch gaya. Phir us ne kaha: ise saat huroof par padhiye, har ek kaafi aur shafi hai."
"165","Abu Usamah ne mujhe khabar di, Abd al-Hamid ibn Jafar al-Ansari se, al-Ala ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Yaqub al-Huraqi se, unke walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya: kya main tumhein ek surat na sikhaun jaisi Tawrat mein, na Zabur mein, na Injil mein, na Quran mein nazil nahi hui? Maine kaha: kyun nahi, Ya RasulAllah. Aap ne farmaya: shayad tum is darwaze se na niklo yahan tak ke main tumhein uske bare mein bata dun. Unhon ne kaha: to main aap ke saath khada raha, aur aap mujh se baat karne lage jabke mera haath aap ke haath mein tha, aur main dheere chalne laga, is baat ko na pasand karte hue ke aap mujhe batane se pehle nikal jayen. Jab main darwaze ke qareeb hua to maine kaha: Ya RasulAllah, woh surat jiska aap ne mujh se wada kiya tha. Aap ne farmaya: jab tum namaz mein khade hote ho to kaise padhte ho? To maine Fatihat al-Kitab padhi. Aap ne farmaya: wahi hai, aur wahi sab'a mathani hai jiska Allah Azza wa Jall ne zikr farmaya: {Wa laqad ataynaka sab'an min al-mathani wa al-Quran al-azim}; wahi hai jo mujhe di gayi hai."
"166","Abu Nuaym ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Abdillah ibn Amir al-Aslami ne bayan ki, Imran ibn Abi Anas se, Sahl ibn Sad se, Ubayy ibn Kab se: ke Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se us masjid ke bare mein pucha gaya jo taqwa par bunyad ki gayi hai, to aap ne farmaya: woh meri masjid hai."
"167","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Shubah ne bayan ki, Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Dharr se, Said ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abza se, unke walid se, Ubayy ibn Kab se: ke Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein hawa tez chali, aur ek aadmi ne use bura bhala kaha. Aap ne farmaya: use bura na kaho, kyunke woh hukm ki paband hai; balke kaho: Ae Allah, main Tujh se iski bhalai, iske andar ki bhalai, aur jis bhalai ka use hukm diya gaya hai uska sawal karta hun, aur Teri panah chahta hun iske shar se, iske andar ke shar se, aur jis shar ka use hukm diya gaya hai us se."
"168","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Aban ne bayan ki, Abu Ishaq se, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ubayy ibn Kab ne mujhe Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se Allah Azza wa Jall ke is farman ke bare mein hadees bayan ki: {Wa dhakkirhum bi ayyami Allah} - aap ne farmaya: Allah ki nematon ke zariye."
"169","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Israil ibn Yunus se, Abu Ishaq se, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se - aur hum unke paas the - aur logon ne kaha: Nawf al-Shami ka da'wa hai ke ilm ki talash mein jane wala Musa Bani Israil wale Musa nahi the. Ibn Abbas tek lagaye hue the, phir seedhe baith gaye aur kaha: kya aisa hi hai, Ae Said ibn Jubayr? Maine kaha: maine khud use aise kehte hue suna hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nawf ne jhoot kaha hai. Ubayy ibn Kab ne mujhe hadees bayan ki ke unhon ne Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ko ye kehte hue suna: Allah ki rehmat hum par aur Musa par ho; agar woh jaldi na karte, sharm mehsus na karte, aur apne saathi ke samne sharmindagi mein mubtala na hote - kyunke unhon ne us se kaha tha: agar main iske baad tum se kisi cheez ke bare mein puchun to mujhe apne saath na rakhna - to woh apne saathi se ajeeb cheezen dekhte. Unhon ne kaha: aur jab Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam nabiyon mein se kisi nabi ka zikr karte to apne aap se ibtida karte hue farmate: Allah ki rehmat hum par aur Salih par ho; Allah ki rehmat hum par aur Aad ke bhai par ho. Phir unhon ne kaha: Musa alayhi al-salam, jabke woh ek din apni qaum ko khitab kar rahe the, unhon ne un se kaha: zameen par mujh se zyadah janne wala koi nahi. To Allah Ta'ala ne unki taraf wahi farmayi ke zameen par tum se zyadah janne wala ek shakhs hai, aur uski nishani ye hai ke tum namkeen machhli ka tosha lo; jab tum use kho doge to woh wahin hoga jahan tum use khooge. To unhon ne namkeen machhli ka tosha liya, aur chale, woh aur unke ladke, yahan tak ke jab woh us jagah pahunche jahan ka unhein hukm diya gaya tha, aur jab woh chattan par pahunche, Musa alag talash mein chale gaye, aur unke ladke ne machhli ko chattan par rakh diya; woh harkat mein aayi aur samandar mein apna rasta le kar phisal gayi. Unke ladke ne kaha: jab Allah ke Nabi ayenge to main unhein bataunga, lekin Shaytan ne use bhula diya. Phir woh chale, aur unhein woh thakan aur mashaqqat pesh aayi jo musafir ko pesh aati hai - aur musafir ko pesh aane wali thakan aur mashaqqat unhein us waqt tak pesh nahi aayi thi jab tak woh us jagah se aage nahi badh gaye jahan ka unhein hukm diya gaya tha - to Musa ne apne ladke se kaha: {Atina ghada'ana laqad laqina min safarina hadha nasaba}. Unke ladke ne un se kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi, {ara'ayta idh awayna ila al-sakhrati fa inni nasitu al-huta} aap ko batana, {wa ma ansanihi illa al-Shaytan} {fa ittakhada sabilahu fi al-bahri ajaba}. Unhon ne kaha: wahi to hai jise hum talash kar rahe the. To woh apne qadmon par wapas laute, peeche ki taraf palat te hue, yahan tak ke chattan tak pahunche; unhon ne uske gird chakkar lagaya, aur wahan woh ek kapde mein lipta hua tha. Unhon ne use salam kiya, aur us ne apna sar uthaya aur kaha: tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Musa. Us ne kaha: kaun se Musa? Unhon ne kaha: Bani Israil ke Musa. Us ne kaha: tumhara kya maamla hai? Unhon ne kaha: mujhe bataya gaya hai ke tumhare paas ilm hai, to maine chaha ke tumhare saath rahun. Us ne kaha: {innaka lan tastati'a ma'iya sabra}. Unhon ne kaha: {satajiduni in sha'a Allahu sabiran wa la a'si laka amra}. Us ne kaha: tum us par kaise sabr kar sakte ho jiska tum ihata nahi karte? Unhon ne kaha: mujhe iska hukm diya gaya hai; tum mujhe in sha'a Allah sabir paoge. Us ne kaha: {fa ini ittaba'tani fa la tas'alni an shay'in hatta uhditha laka minhu dhikra}. To woh chale yahan tak ke jab woh kashti par sawar hue, us par sawar log utar gaye, aur woh peeche reh kar usmein surakh karne laga. Musa ne us se kaha: kya tum ismein surakh kar rahe ho taake iske walon ko gharq kar do? Beshak tum ne ek sangin kaam kiya hai. Us ne kaha: kya maine nahi kaha tha ke beshak tum hargiz mere saath sabr nahi kar sakoge? Unhon ne kaha: {la tu'akhidhni bima nasitu wa la turhiqni min amri usra}. To woh chale yahan tak ke jab woh samandar ke kinare khelte hue ladkon par se guzre, un mein ek ladka tha jis se zyadah haseen ya saaf suthra ladkon mein koi nahi tha, to us ne use pakad kar qatl kar diya. Musa is par ghabra gaye aur kaha: {a qatalta nafsan zakiyyatan bi ghayri nafs laqad ji'ta shay'an nukra. Qala a lam aqul laka innaka lan tastati'a ma'iya sabra}? Unhon ne kaha: apne saathi ke samne sharmindagi ne unhein gher liya, aur woh sharminda hue, to unhon ne kaha: {la in sa'altuka an shay'in ba'daha fa la tusahibni qad balaghta min ladunni udhra}. To woh chale yahan tak ke jab woh ek kamine gaon walon ke paas aaye - aur Musa sakht bhook mein mubtala ho gaye the, aur unhon ne unki mehmaan nawazi na ki - {fa wajada fiha jidaran yuridu an yanqadda fa aqamahu}. Musa ne use, us bhook ki wajah se jo unhein lahiq hui thi, kaha: {law shi'ta la ittakhadhta alayhi ajra. Qala hadha firaqu bayni wa baynik}; to Musa ne uske kapde ke kinare ko pakad liya aur kaha: mujhe bataiye. Us ne kaha: rahi kashti, to woh samandar par kaam karne wale ghareebon ki thi, aur unke peeche ek badshah tha jo har kashti ko zabardasti pakad raha tha; to jab woh uske paas se guzra aur use surakh shuda dekha to use chhod diya, aur uske walon ne lakdi ke tukde se use jod diya aur is se faida uthaya. Raha ladka, to use jis din paida kiya gaya usi din se kafir ke taur par naqsh kiya gaya tha, aur uski mohabbat uske walidain ke dil mein daal di gayi thi; agar woh kisi cheez mein uski nafarmani karte to woh unhein sarkashi aur kufr mein mubtala kar deta. To aap ke Rabb ne chaha ke unhein uske badle us se behtar paakizgi mein aur mohabbat mein zyadah qareeb ata kare; to uske baap ne uski maa se sohbat ki, aur us ne hamila ho kar us se behtar paakizgi mein aur mohabbat mein zyadah qareeb ko janam diya. Rahi deewar, to woh shahar mein do yateem ladkon ki thi, aur uske neeche unke liye ek khazana tha, yahan tak ke Uske farman: {dhalika ta'wilu ma lam tastati' alayhi sabra} tak."
"170","Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Sufyan ne bayan ki, Abdillah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, al-Tufayl ibn Ubayy ibn Kab se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: jab raat ka chauthai hissa guzar jata to Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam khade hote aur farmate: Ae logo, Allah ko yaad karo, Allah ko yaad karo; rajfa aa gayi hai, uske peeche radifa hai; rajfa aa gayi hai, uske peeche radifa hai; maut apne andar maujood cheezon ke saath aa gayi hai; maut apne andar maujood cheezon ke saath aa gayi hai. Ubayy ibn Kab ne kaha: to maine kaha: Ya RasulAllah, main aap par kasrat se durud bhejta hun; apni dua ka kitna hissa aap ke liye mukhtas karun? Aap ne farmaya: jitna tum chaho. Unhon ne kaha: chauthai? Aap ne farmaya: jitna tum chaho, aur agar tum zyadah karo to behtar hai. Unhon ne kaha: nisf? Aap ne farmaya: jitna tum chaho, aur agar tum zyadah karo to behtar hai. Unhon ne kaha: do tihai? Aap ne farmaya: jitna tum chaho, aur agar tum zyadah karo to behtar hai. Unhon ne kaha: kya main apni sari dua aap ke liye mukhtas kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: tab tumhari fikr kifayat ki jayegi aur tumhara gunah bakhsh diya jayega."
"171","Zakariyya ibn Adi ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Amr ne khabar di, Abdillah ibn Muhammad se, al-Tufayl ibn Ubayy se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: jab Qayamat ka din aayega to main nabiyon ka sardar, unka khatib, aur unki shafa'at ka malik hunga, baghair fakhr ke."
"172","Musa ibn Masud ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne bayan ki, Abdillah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, al-Tufayl ibn Ubayy se, unke walid se, ke Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: logon mein meri misaal us shakhs ki si hai jis ne ek ghar banaya, use mukammal, muzayyan, aur tamam kiya, aur ek eent ki jagah chhod di use lagaye baghair; to log imarat ke gird ghoomte hain, use pasand karte hain aur kehte hain: kaash is eent ki jagah mukammal ho jati. To main nabiyon mein us eent ki jagah hun."
"173","Said ibn Amir ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Shubah se, Abu Ishaq se, Abdillah ibn Abi Basir se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek din fajr ki namaz padhayi, phir apne chehre ke saath hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: kya falan shakhs hazir hai? Unhon ne kaha: nahi. Aap ne farmaya: falan shakhs? Unhon ne kaha: nahi - munafiqeen ke ek giroh ke liye jo namaz mein hazir nahi hue the. Aap ne farmaya: ye do namazen beshak munafiqeen par sab se bhaari namazen hain; agar woh jante ke in mein kya hai to ghutnon ke bal ghisat te hue bhi in mein aate. Phir aap ne farmaya: pehli saf ka iltizam karo, kyunke woh farishton ki saf ki tarah hai; agar tum uski fazilat jante to uski taraf daudte. Unhon ne kaha: phir aap ne farmaya: ek aadmi ke saath tumhari namaz akele tumhari namaz se zyadah paakizah hai, aur do aadmiyon ke saath tumhari namaz ek aadmi ke saath tumhari namaz se zyadah paakizah hai; aur jitne zyadah hon, Allah Azza wa Jall ko utne hi zyadah mehboob hai."
"174","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan ki, Thabit se, Jarud ibn Abi Sabrah se, Ubayy ibn Kab se: ke Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne logon ko namaz padhayi aur ek ayat chhod di. Jab aap ne salam phera to farmaya: tum mein se kis ne mujhe meri qiraat mein tok di? Ubayy ne kaha: maine, Ya RasulAllah. Aap ne farmaya: mujhe malum tha ke agar koi mujhe tokega to woh tum hi hoge."
"175","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ibn Yahya ne bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Juhadah ne bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Aban nami ek aadmi ne mujhe khabar di, Ubayy ibn Kab se, ke unhon ne ek aadmi ko Quran ki ek surat sikhayi, aur us ne unhein tohfe ke taur par ek kapda diya - ya unhon ne kaha: ek chadar. Unhon ne kaha: unhon ne ye baat Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se zikr ki, to aap ne farmaya: agar tum ne use liya - ya unhon ne kaha: agar tum use lete ho, Muhammad ko shak hua - to tumhein aag ka kapda pehnaya jayega."
"176","Abd al-Rahman ibn Sad ne hamein khabar di, Abu Jafar al-Razi ne khabar di, al-Amash se, Zubayd aur Talhah se, Dharr se, Said ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abza se, unke walid se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam witr mein ye padhte the: Sabbihi isma Rabbika al-A'la; Qul ya ayyuha al-kafirun; aur Qul huwa Allahu ahad."
"177","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Jafar ne bayan ki, Shubah se, Abu Jamrah se, unhon ne kaha: Iyas ibn Qatadah ne bayan ki, Qays ibn Ubad se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, ke Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne hum se farmaya: mere qareeb wali saf mein raho."
"178","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Abd al-Ala ibn Abd al-Ala ne bayan ki, al-Jurayri se, Abu al-Salil se, Abdillah ibn Rabah al-Ansari se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, Allah Azza wa Jall ki Kitab mein tumhare paas kaun si ayat sab se azeem hai? Maine kaha: Allah aur Uske Rasul behtar jante hain. Phir aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, Allah Azza wa Jall ki Kitab mein tumhare paas kaun si ayat sab se azeem hai? Maine kaha: {Allahu la ilaha illa Huwa al-Hayyu al-Qayyum}. Aap ne farmaya: aap ne mere seene par thapki di aur farmaya: Ae Abu al-Mundhir, tumhein ilm mubarak ho. Us Zaat ki qasam jiske Haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, beshak is ayat ki ek zaban aur do hont hain jo Arsh ke paye ke paas Badshah ki taqdees karte hain."
"179","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Abdillah ibn Numayr ne bayan ki, Yazid ibn Ziyad ibn Abi al-Jad ne bayan ki, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein do aadmiyon ne apna nasab bayan kiya. Unmein se ek ne kaha: main falan bin falan hun; to tum kaun ho, tumhari maa na rahe? To Rasulullah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa alayhi al-salam ke zamane mein do aadmiyon ne apna nasab bayan kiya. Unmein se ek ne kaha: main falan bin falan hun, yahan tak ke us ne nau tak gina; to tum kaun ho, tumhari maa na rahe? Us ne kaha: main falan bin falan, Islam ka beta hun. To Allah Azza wa Jall ne Musa ki taraf wahi farmayi: ye do jo nasab bayan kar rahe hain - raha tu, Ae nau walon ka da'wedar jo Jahannam mein hain, tu Jahannam mein unka daswan hai; aur raha tu, Ae do walon ka da'wedar, tu Jannat mein unka teesra hai."
"180","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine apne walid Muhammad ibn Abi Shaybah ki kitab mein paya, Abd al-Hamid ibn Jafar se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sulayman ibn Yasar se khabar di gayi, Abdillah ibn al-Harith ibn Nawfal se, Ubayy ibn Kab se, Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se, aap ne farmaya: qareeb hai ke Furat sone ke pahad se hat jaye; jab log uske bare mein sunenge to uski taraf daudenge, aur uske qareeb wale kahenge: agar hum logon ko is mein se lene ke liye chhod denge to woh ise sara le jayenge. To woh us par ladenge yahan tak ke har sau mein se ninyanwe qatl ho jayenge."
"181","Mujh se Sulayman ibn Harb aur Yaqub ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Abu Rafi se, unhon ne Ubayy ibn Kab se bayan kiya: ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) Ramazan ke akhri das raaton mein itikaf farmaya karte thay; ek saal aap safar mein thay aur itikaf na kar sake, to agle saal aap ne bees raaton ka itikaf farmaya."
"182","Ubadah ibn al-Samit (radi Allahu anhu) ki Musnad. Mujh se Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, Hammam ibn Yahya ne Zayd ibn Aslam se bayan kiya, Atha ibn Yasar ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit se bayan kiya, unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, aap ne farmaya: Jannat sau darje hain; har do darjon ke darmiyan itna fasla hai jitna asman aur zameen ke darmiyan hai. Al-Firdaws sab se buland darja hai; us ke upar al-Firdaws hai, jis se Jannat ki char nehren jaari hoti hain. Pas jab tum Allah se Jannat mango to Us se al-Firdaws mango."
"183","Hamein Abu Asim ne al-Mughirah ibn Ziyad se, unhon ne Ubadah ibn Nusayy se, unhon ne al-Aswad ibn Thalabah se, unhon ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main Ahl-e-Suffah mein se kuch logon ko taleem diya karta tha, aur mujhe ek kaman hadiya ki gayi. Main ne kaha: Ye maal nahi hai; main is se Allah ke raste mein teer chalaunga. Phir mere dil mein aya ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se is ke bare mein puchun, to main ne is ka zikr Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se kiya. To Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum chahte ho ke Allah tumhein us ke badle aag ka tauq pehnaye to use qubool karo."
"184","Mujh se Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, Hammam ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, Qatadah ne Anas se khabar di, unhon ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah se mulaqat ko mehboob rakhta hai, Allah us se mulaqat ko mehboob rakhta hai; aur jo Allah se mulaqat ko napasand karta hai, Allah us se mulaqat ko napasand karta hai. Aishah - ya aap ki azwaj mein se ek - ne kaha: Hum to maut ko napasand karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Ye murad nahi hai; balkay momin ko, jab maut ati hai, Allah ki khushnudi aur Us ki izzat ki khushkhabri di jati hai, to jo kuch us ke samne hai us se zyada use koi cheez mehboob nahi hoti; pas wo Allah se mulaqat ko mehboob rakhta hai, aur Allah us se mulaqat ko mehboob rakhta hai. Raha kafir, jab use maut ati hai to use Allah ke azab aur Us ki saza ki khabar di jati hai, to jo kuch us ke samne hai us se zyada use koi cheez napasandida nahi hoti; pas wo Allah se mulaqat ko napasand karta hai, aur Allah us se mulaqat ko napasand karta hai."
"185","Mujh se Ismail ibn Abd al-Karim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se al-Walid ibn Muslim aur Abd al-Majid ibn Abi Rawwad ne Marwan ibn Salim se, unhon ne Khalid ibn Madan se, unhon ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein do shakhs honge: un mein se ek Wahb hai, jise hikmat ata ki jayegi; aur dusra Ghaylan hai, jis ka is ummat par fitna Shaitan ke fitne se zyada sakht hai. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Main ne ise Abd al-Majid se suna hai."
"186","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Abu Khalid al-Ahmar Sulayman ibn Hayyan ne Muhammad ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, unhon ne Ibn Muhayriz se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ubadah ibn al-Samit ke paas baithe thay jab al-Sunabihi un ke paas rote hue aye. Unhon ne un se kaha: Tumhein kya cheez rulati hai? Allah ki qasam, agar main shaheed kiya gaya to main tumhare haq mein zaroor gawahi dunga, aur agar mujhe shafaat ata ki gayi to main tumhare liye zaroor shafaat karunga, aur agar main istitaat rakhta hua to tumhein zaroor faida pahunchaunga. Main ne tum se koi hadith jo main ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se suni, nahi chhupayi siwaye ek hadith ke, aur main use tum se bayan karunga, kyunke main ghir gaya hun: Main ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Beshak Allah azza wa jalla ne aag ko us par haram kar diya hai jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi aur ke main Allah ka Rasool hun."
"187","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Hubab ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Thawban se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Umayr ibn Hani ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Junadah ibn Abi Umayyah ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit ko Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se bayan karte hue suna: ke Jibril (alayhis salam) ne un par dam kiya jabke unhein bukhar tha, ye kehte hue: Allah ke naam se main tum par dam karta hun, har us beemari se jo tumhein takleef deti hai, har hasad karne wale se jab wo hasad kare, aur har nazar se; aur Allah ka naam tumhein shifa deta hai."
"188","Abu Qatadah ibn Ribi al-Ansari (radi Allahu anhu) ki Musnad. Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Sulayman al-Taymi ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abdillah ibn Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya gaya, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mere peeche qirat karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam, ya Rasool Allah. Aap ne farmaya: To Umm al-Kitab ke siwa qirat na karo."
"189","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Mamar ne Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se khabar di, unhon ne Abdillah ibn Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz qayam ki jaye to khare na ho jab tak mujhe apni taraf nikalta hua na dekh lo."
"190","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn Amr ne al-Maqburi se khabar di, unhon ne Abdillah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas ek janaza laya gaya taake aap us par namaz parhen. Aap ne farmaya: Kya us par qarz hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, do dinar. Aap ne farmaya: Kya us ne un ki adayegi ke liye kuch chhora hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Apne saathi par namaz parh lo. Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Wo mere zimme hain, ya Rasool Allah. To aap ne us par namaz parhi."
"191","Hamein Said ibn Amir ne Shubah se, unhon ne Uthman ibn Abdillah ibn Mawhab se, unhon ne Abdillah se, unhon ne apne walid se khabar di: ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas ek shakhs laya gaya taake aap us par namaz parhen, aur aap ne farmaya: Apne saathi par namaz parh lo, kyunke us par qarz hai. Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Ye mere zimme hai, ya Rasool Allah. Aap ne farmaya: Mukammal adayegi ke sath? Unhon ne kaha: Mukammal adayegi ke sath. Us par qarz sirf atharah ya unnis dirham tha."
"192","Hum se Sulayman ibn Dawud ne Ibn Abi Dhib se, unhon ne Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi se, unhon ne Abdillah ibn Abi Qatadah al-Ansari se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne khutba diya aur jihad ka zikr kiya, aur farz namaz ke siwa kisi cheez ko us par fazilat na di. Ek shakhs khara hua aur kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, agar main Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jaun to main kahan hun? Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah ke raste mein qatl kiye jao, sabr karne wale, sawab chahne wale, aage barhne wale, peeth na pherne wale ho, to tum Jannat mein ho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur aap par wahi nazil hui; jab wo shakhs wapas murha to aap ne use bulaya aur us se kaha: Siwaye is ke ke us par qarz ho, kyunke wo apne qarz ki wajah se roka gaya hai; is tarah Jibril (alayhis salam) ne kaha."
"193","Hamein Safwan ibn Isa ne Abdillah ibn Said se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Halhalah se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Kab ibn Malik ke ek bete ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Qatadah ibn Ribi ko kehte hue suna: Ek janaza Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke samne se guzra, to aap ne farmaya: Ek aram pane wala hai aur ek jis se aram paya jata hai. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, aram pane wala aur jis se aram paya jata hai kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Momin banda duniya ki mashaqqat aur us ki takleef se aram pata hai, jabke badkar bande se bande, zameenen, darakht aur janwar aram pate hain."
"194","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, al-Thawri ne Mansur se khabar di, unhon ne Mujahid se, unhon ne Harmalah ibn Iyas al-Shaybani se, unhon ne Abu Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se Ashura ke din ke roze ke bare mein pucha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Ye ek saal ka kaffara hai. Aur aap se Arafah ke din ke roze ke bare mein pucha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Ye do saalon ka kaffara hai: ek guzre hue saal ka aur ek ane wale saal ka."
"195","Hum se Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne Abu Jafar al-Khatmi se bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Kab al-Qurazi se: ke Abu Qatadah ka ek shakhs par qarz tha, aur wo taqaze ke liye us ke paas ate thay aur wo un se chhup jata tha. Ek din wo aye, aur ek ladka bahar nikla; unhon ne us se us ke bare mein pucha, to us ne kaha: Haan, wo ghar mein hai. To unhon ne use pukara: Ay falan, bahar ao, kyunke mujhe bataya gaya hai ke tum yahan ho. To wo un ke paas bahar aya aur kaha: Tumhein mujh se kya cheez roke rakhti hai? Us ne kaha: Main tangdasti mein hun aur mere paas kuch nahi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, kya tum waqai tangdasti mein ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Qatadah roye aur kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo apne qarzdaar ko mohlat de, ya us se use maaf kar de, wo Qayamat ke din Arsh ke saye mein hoga."
"196","Mujh se Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se mere walid ne, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdillah ibn Abi Qatadah ne apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko kisi janaze ke liye bulaya jata to aap us ke bare mein puchte; agar us ki bhalayi ke sath tareef ki jati to aap khare hote aur us par namaz parhte, aur agar us ki us ke ilawa kuch aur ke sath tareef ki jati to aap us ke ghar walon se kehte: Tum khud use sambhalo, aur us par namaz na parhte."
"197","Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, Sufyan ne Abd al-Aziz ibn Rufay se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdillah ibn Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zamane ko bura na kaho, kyunke Allah hi Zamana hai."
"198","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Mamar ne Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se khabar di, unhon ne Abdillah ibn Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) hamein Zuhr ki namaz parhaya karte thay, aur kabhi kabhi hamein koi ayat suna dete thay; aur aap Fajr ki namaz ki pehli rakat aur Zuhr ki namaz ki pehli rakat lambi karte thay, to hum samajhte thay ke aap is se ye irada karte thay ke log rakat pa len, yani pehli."
"199","Abu al-Darda (radi Allahu anhu) ki Musnad. Hum se Muhammad ibn al-Qasim al-Asadi ne bayan kiya, Fitr ibn Khalifah ne Habib ibn Abi Thabit se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya ibn Jadah se, unhon ne Abu al-Darda se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hawa Allah ki rehmat mein se hai; jab tum use dekho to Allah azza wa jalla se us ki bhalayi mango, aur Allah se us ke shar se panah mango."
"200","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Musa ibn Ubaydah al-Rabadhi se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ibrahim se, unhon ne Yuhannas se, unhon ne Abu al-Darda se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs ek raat mein sau ayaten tilawat kare wo ghafilon mein nahi likha jata; jo do sau ayaten tilawat kare wo ibadat guzaron mein uthaya jata hai; aur jo paanch sau se ek hazar ayaten tilawat kare, wo qintar ke sath subah karta hai, jis ke ek qirat ka sawab bare pahad jaisa hai."
"201","Hamein Yala ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Safwan ibn Abdillah ibn Safwan se - aur un ke nikah mein al-Darda thin - jinhon ne kaha: Main Sham aaya aur Abu al-Darda ke paas aaya lekin un se mulaqat na ho saki; meri mulaqat Umm al-Darda se hui, aur unhon ne kaha: Kya tum is saal Hajj ka irada rakhte ho? Main ne kaha: Ji haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hamare liye bhalai ki dua karna, kyunke Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam farmaya karte the: Musalman aadmi ki dua apne bhai ke liye us ki ghaybata mein qubool hoti hai; us ke sir ke paas ek muwakkal farishta hota hai: jab bhi woh apne bhai ke liye bhalai ki dua karta hai, woh kehta hai: Ameen, aur tumhare liye bhi isi ki manind ho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main bazaar ki taraf nikla aur Abu al-Darda se mila, aur unhon ne mujh se isi tarah ki baat kahi."
"202","Yala ne bayan kiya, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Habibah se, jinhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne apne maal ka ek hissa mere supurd kiya taake main use sarf karoon. Pas main Abu al-Darda ke paas aaya aur fuqara ya mujahideen ke bare mein un se mashwara kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Mere aitabar se, agar main tumhari jagah hota to mujahideen par kisi ko tarjeeh na deta. Main ne Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Maut ke waqt ghulam azaad karne wale ki misaal us shakhs ki si hai jo ser hone ke baad tohfa deta hai."
"203","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Mamar ne khabar di, Zayd ibn Aslam se, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan Umm al-Darda ko bulwa bhejte the, aur woh un ki khawateen ke saath raat guzarti thin, aur woh un se Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke bare mein sawal karte the. Ek raat woh khare hue, aur apni kaniz ko pukara, aur us ne aane mein der ki, to unhon ne use la'nat ki. Unhon ne kaha: La'nat na karo, kyunke Abu al-Darda ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Zyada la'nat karne wale Qiyamat ke din na sifarishi honge, na gawah."
"204","Hamein Wahb ibn Jarir aur Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne bayan kiya, al-Qasim ibn Abi Bazzah se, Ata al-Kanjarani se, Umm al-Darda se, Abu al-Darda se, Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se, jinhon ne farmaya: Meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se zyada bhaari koi cheez nahi hai."
"205","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne bayan kiya, Abdillah ibn al-Mubarak ne bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Abi Maryam se, Khalid ibn Muhammad al-Thaqafi se, Bilal ibn Abi al-Darda se, Abu al-Darda se, Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se: Tumhari kisi cheez se mohabbat tumhein andha aur behra kar deti hai."
"206","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Abi Layla se, al-Hakam se, Ibn Abi al-Darda se, un ke walid se, jinhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ki maujoodgi mein ek aadmi ki burai ki, aur ek aadmi ne us ka radd kiya. To Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne bhai ki izzat ka difa karega, woh us ke liye Jahannam se ek hijab ban jayegi."
"207","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Shayban ibn Abd al-Rahman ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Khulayd al-Asari se, Abu al-Darda se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi suraj kabhi tulu nahi hua magar us ke dono pehluon par do farishte bheje jate hain, jo pukarte hain - aur zameen par rehne wale sab ko sunate hain siwaye saqlain ke: Ai logo, apne Rabb ki taraf jaldi karo; kyunke thoda jo kifayat kare, us zyada se behtar hai jo ghafil kar de. Aur koi suraj kabhi ghuroob nahi hua magar us ke dono pehluon par do farishte bheje jate hain, jo pukarte hain: Ai Allah, kharch karne wale ko us ka naim al-badal ata farma, aur rok kar rakhne wale ko halakat de."
"208","Hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Uthman ibn Hayyan al-Dimashqi se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Umm al-Darda ne khabar di, Abu al-Darda se, jinhon ne kaha: Hum ne apne aap ko Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath un ke ek safar mein sakht garmi ke din mein paya, yahan tak ke aadmi shiddat-e-garmi ki wajah se apna haath apne sar par rakh leta tha; aur logon mein se Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam aur Abdillah ibn Rawahah ke siwa koi roza-dar na tha."
"209","Mujhe Fihr ibn Awf ne bayan kiya - matbua nuskhe aur qalamy nuskhe mein aise hi hai, aur sahih Fahd hai, dal-e-muhmala ke saath, jo Zayd ibn Awf ka laqab hai - Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Bilal ibn Abi al-Darda se, Abu al-Darda se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Na sabz aasman ne saya kiya, na ghubaar-aalud zameen ne uthaya, Abu Dharr se zyada sacchi zabaan wale kisi shakhs ko."
"210","Hamein Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Shubah ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Khumayr ne bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Marshad se, Abu al-Darda se, Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se, jinhon ne farmaya: Agar tum woh jaante jo main jaanta hoon, to bahut rote aur kam hanste, aur cheekhte hue bahar nikal jate, jabke tumhein maloom na hota ke tum nijaat paoge ya nahi."
"211","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne khabar di, Shubah se, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim ibn Abi al-Jad ko Madan ibn Abi Talhah se, Abu al-Darda se riwayat karte hue suna ke Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi ek raat mein Quran ka tihai hissa padhne se aajiz hai? Kaha gaya: Ai Allah ke Rasul, ye kaun bardasht kar sakta hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Woh padhe: Qul huwa Allahu ahad."
"212","Hamein Umar ibn Yunus al-Yamami ne bayan kiya, Abu Said al-Bakri ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata se, Abu al-Darda se ke Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj ne kisi aise shakhs par tulu ya ghuroob nahi kiya jo Abu Bakr se zyada afzal ya behtar ho, siwaye kisi nabi ke."
"213","Mujhe Amr ibn Awn ne bayan kiya, Hushaym ne bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Amr se, Abdillah ibn Abi Zakariyya al-Khuzai se, Abu al-Darda se, Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se, jinhon ne farmaya: Qiyamat ke din tumhein tumhare naamon aur tumhare baapon ke naamon se pukara jayega, pas apne naam acche rakho."
"214","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Ibn Uyaynah ne bayan kiya, Amr se, Ibn Abi Mulaykah se, Yala ibn Mamlak se, Umm al-Darda se, Abu al-Darda se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise narmi mein se us ka hissa diya gaya, use bhalai mein se us ka hissa diya gaya."
"215","Khuzaymah ibn Thabit radiyAllahu anhu ki riwayat. Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Lahiah ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Aswad Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Nawfal ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ko Umarah ibn Khuzaymah ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, un ke walid se riwayat karte hue suna, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan aadmi ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Aasman kis ne paida kiye? Woh kehta hai: Allah ne. Woh kehta hai: Zameen kis ne paida ki? Woh kehta hai: Allah ne - yahan tak ke woh kehta hai: Phir Allah ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jab tum mein se koi ye mehsoos kare, to use kehna chahiye: Main Allah aur us ke Rasul par iman laya."
"216","Hamein Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Abu Jafar al-Khatmi se, Umarah ibn Khuzaymah ibn Thabit se, un ke walid se ke Khuzaymah ne khwab mein dekha jaise woh Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ki peshani par sajda kar rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne is ka zikr Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam se kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Beshak rooh rooh se milti hai - ya: beshak rooh rooh se milti hai, Yazid ko shak hua - pas Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam aage ko jhuke, aur unhon ne use hukm diya, aur unhon ne peeche se Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ki peshani par sajda kiya."
"217","Abu Ayyub al-Ansari radiyAllahu anhu ki riwayat. Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Riyah ibn Amr ne khabar di, Abu Yahya al-Raqashi ne bayan kiya, mujhe Abu Sawrah ne jo Abu Ayyub ke bhatije hain, Abu Ayyub se bayan kiya, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam hamare paas bahar tashreef laye aur farmaya: Wuzu aur khane mein khilal karne wale kya hi khoob hain."
"218","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Wasil al-Raqashi ne bayan kiya, Abu Sawrah se, Abu Ayyub se: ke Nabi sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam jab wuzu karte to kulli karte aur pani se dadhi ka niche se masah karte."
"219","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Wasil al-Raqashi ne bayan kiya, Abu Sawrah se, Abu Ayyub se: ke Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam raat ko do ya teen martaba miswak karte; jab raat ko namaz ke liye khare hote to chaar rakatein padhte, na koi baat karte na kisi cheez ka hukm dete, aur har do rakat ke darmiyan salam pherte."
"220","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, al-Hajjaj ibn Artah ne khabar di, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar cheezein rasoolon ki sunnaton mein se hain: khushbu lagana, nikah karna, miswak karna, aur mehndi lagana."
"221","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Abi Hind ne khabar di, Amir se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood-e-barhaq nahin, woh tanha hai, us ka koi shareek nahin, usi ki badshahi hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai, usi ke haath mein khair hai aur woh har cheez par qadir hai, to ye us ke liye das gardanein azad karne ke barabar hongi, ya ek gardan azad karne ke barabar."
"222","Husayn ibn Ali al-Jufi ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaidah se, Mansur se, Hilal ibn Yasaf se, Rabi ibn Khuthaym se, Amr ibn Maymun se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ansar ki ek aurat se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ayyub yani al-Ansari ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi is se aajiz hai ke ek raat mein Quran ka teesra hissa parhe, pas jo shakhs ek raat mein Allah Yekta, Beniyaz hai parhe, us ne teesra hissa parha, ya Quran ka teesra hissa parha."
"223","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, marfooan riwayat karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Kisi Musalman ke liye halal nahin ke apne bhai ko teen din se zyada chhore rakhe, woh dono milte hain to ye bhi munh pher leta hai aur ye bhi munh pher leta hai, aur un dono mein behtar woh hai jo salam mein pehal kare."
"224","Uthman ibn Umar ne hamein khabar di, Shubah ne khabar di, Awn ibn Abi Juhayfah se, un ke walid se, al-Bara ibn Azib se, Abu Ayyub se: ke Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bahar tashreef laye jab suraj ghuroob ho chuka tha aur farmaya: Ye Yahoodiyon ki aawazein hain jinhein un ki qabron mein azab diya ja raha hai."
"225","Abdillah ibn Yazid ne hamein khabar di, Said ibn Abi Ayyub ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shurahbil al-Maafiri ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, ke unhon ne Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ko kehte suna: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke raaste mein subah ka ek hamla ya shaam ka ek hamla us sab se behtar hai jis par suraj tulu hua aur ghuroob hua."
"226","Yala ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydah ibn Mutattib ne bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Ibn Minjab se, al-Qarthi se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Jab suraj dhal jata to Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chaar rakatein parhte. Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, ye kaun si namaz hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab suraj dhalta hai to aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur Zuhr parhne tak band nahin kiye jate, aur main pasand karta hun ke is waqt mein mere liye bhali cheez upar chadhayi jaye is se pehle ke aasman ke darwaze band hon. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, kya un sab mein qiraat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Kya un mein judagana salam hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, magar un ke aakhir mein."
"227","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Layth ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Sufyan ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Asim ibn Sufyan se: ke unhon ne al-Salasil ki muhim mein jihad kiya, aur muhim un se reh gayi, pas woh wahin thehre rahe, phir Muawiyah ki taraf wapas aaye, aur un ke paas Abu Ayyub aur Uqbah ibn Amir the. Asim ne kaha: Ae Abu Ayyub, hum se is saal muhim reh gayi, aur hamein bataya gaya hai ke jo chaar masjidon mein namaz parhe us ka gunah bakhsh diya jata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere bhai ke bete, kya main tumhein is se zyada aasan cheez ki rehnumai na karun, main ne Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kehte suna: Jo wuzu kare jaisa hukm diya gaya, aur namaz parhe jaisa hukm diya gaya, us ke pichhle kiye hue bakhsh diye jate hain. Kya aisa hi hai, ae Uqbah, Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"228","Muhadir ibn al-Muwarri ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sad ibn Said ne bayan kiya, Umar ibn Thabit al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ko kehte suna: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kehte suna: Jo Ramazan ke roze rakhe, phir us ke baad Shawwal ke chhe roze rakhe, to ye hamesha ke rozon ki tarah hai."
"229","Sad ibn al-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah ne bayan kiya, Simak ibn Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Samurah ko suna, Abu Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khana khate to bacha hua kuch mujhe bhej dete, pas unhon ne mujhe ek pyala bheja jis mein se unhon ne kuch nahin khaya tha, aur us mein lehsan tha, pas main ne un se poocha: Kya ye haram hai, Unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, lekin main ne is ki boo ki wajah se is ko napasand kiya."
"230","Yahya ibn Ishaq ne mujh se bayan kiya, Layth ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Qays se, Abu Sirmah se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se ke jab un ki wafaat ka waqt aaya to unhon ne kaha: Ae logo, main ne Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ek hadees suni thi jo main ne tum se chhupaye rakhi, aur agar ye waqt na aata to main ise tumhein bayan na karta. Main ne Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kehte suna: Agar ye na hota ke tum gunah karte ho, to Allah aisi makhlooq paida farmata jo gunah karti phir woh unhein bakhsh deta."
"231","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Hubab ne bayan kiya, Kathir ibn Zayd al-Madani se, unhon ne kaha: al-Muttalib ibn Abdillah ibn Hantab ne mujh se bayan kiya, Amir ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Ayyub se mila, aur unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhein us cheez ka hukm na dun jis ka Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe hukm diya tha, ke kasrat se kaho: Allah ki taufeeq ke baghair na koi taqat hai na quwwat, pas ye Jannat ke khazanon mein se hai."
"232","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, Ubadah ibn Amr ibn Ubadah ibn Awf se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abu Ayyub, kya main tumhein us sadqe ki rehnumai na karun jo Allah aur us ke Rasool ko mehboob hai: ke tum logon mein sulah kara do jab woh ek dusre se bughz rakhein aur bigad jayein."
"233","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid se, Abu Masud al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat mein Surat al-Baqarah ki aakhri do aayatein parhe, woh us ke liye kaafi hongi."
"234","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith se, Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Zayd se, Uqbah ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur un ke samne baitha, aur kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, raha aap par salam bhejna to hum ise jante hain, lekin aap par darood bhejne ka kya tariqa hai, hamein batayein hum aap par kaise darood bhejein, Unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khamosh rahe yahan tak ke main ne chaha ke jis aadmi ne un se sawal kiya tha us ne sawal na kiya hota, phir unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum mujh par darood bhejo to kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad unparh Nabi par aur Muhammad ki aal par rehmat bhej, jaisa Tu ne Ibrahim par aur Ibrahim ki aal par rehmat bheji, aur Muhammad unparh Nabi par aur Muhammad ki aal par barkat bhej, jaisa Tu ne Ibrahim par aur Ibrahim ki aal par barkat bheji. Beshak Tu Qabil-e-tareef, Buzurgi wala hai."
"235","al-Aswad ibn Amir ne hamein khabar di, Sharik ibn Abdillah ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Abu Amr al-Shaybani se, Abu Masud se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jis se mashwara liya jaye woh ameen banaya gaya hai."
"236","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah se, unhon ne kaha: al-Amash ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wail ko suna, Abu Masud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se Abu Shuayb nami ek aadmi ne Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye khana tayyar kiya, aur kaha: Tashreef layein, aap aur aap ke saath paanch, to Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mujhe chhathe ki ijazat dete ho."
"237","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, ek aadmi se, us ke walid se, Sufyan ne kaha: Mera khayal hai woh Iyad ibn Iyad hain, Abu Masud se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein khutba diya aur farmaya: Beshak tum mein munafiq hain, pas jis ka main naam lun woh khara ho jaye. Pas chhattees aadmi khare hue. Phir unhon ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein, ya tum mein se, pas Allah se aafiyat mango. Phir Umar ka guzar ek naqabposh aadmi ke paas se hua jise woh jante the, aur kaha: Tumhara kya haal hai, us ne unhein us ki khabar di jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tha, aur unhon ne kaha: Baqi din ke liye door ho jao."
"238","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahim ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, Mujalid ibn Said se, Amir se, Uqbah ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hum se al-Aqabah ke neeche qurbani ke din wada liya, jabke hum sattar aadmi the. Uqbah ne kaha: Main un mein sab se chhota tha. Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) humare paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: Guftagu mukhtasar rakho, pas main tumhare bare mein Quraysh ke kafiron se darta hun. Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, apne liye sawal karein, aur apne Rab ke liye sawal karein, aur apne sathiyon ke liye sawal karein, aur hamein batayein Allah ki taraf se aur aap ki taraf se badla kya hai, Unhon ne farmaya: Main tum se apne Rab ke liye sawal karta hun ke tum Allah par iman lao aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, aur main tum se sawal karta hun ke meri itaat karo taake main tumhein seedhe raaste ki hidayat dun, aur main tum se apne liye aur apne sathiyon ke liye sawal karta hun ke tum apne paas se humare saath hamdardi karo aur humari hifazat karo jaisa tum apni hifazat karte ho. Agar tum aisa karo to tumhare liye Allah ki taraf se Jannat hai, aur meri taraf se. Unhon ne kaha: Pas hum ne apne haath badhaye aur un se baiat ki."
"239","Ibrahim ibn al-Ashath ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, un ke walid se, Abu Masud al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main apne ek ghulam ko apne kode se maar raha tha, main ne apne peeche se ek aawaz suni: Jaan lo, ae Abu Masud. Na main ghusse ki wajah se palta na samjha yahan tak ke Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere qareeb tashreef laye, pas main palta, aur jab main ne unhein dekha to koda mere haath se un ke rob se gir para, ya main ne ise phenk diya. Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jaan lo, ae Abu Masud, ke Allah Azza wa Jalla tum par is se zyada qudrat rakhta hai jitni tum is par rakhte ho. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke saath bheja, main is ke baad kabhi apne kisi ghulam ko nahin maarunga."
"240","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sharik ne bayan kiya, al-Rukayn se, al-Qasim ibn Hassan se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main tum mein woh chhor raha hun ke agar tum use mazbooti se thaam lo to kabhi gumrah na hoge: Allah ki Kitab aur meri zurriyat, mere ahl-e-bait. Pas woh dono kabhi juda na honge yahan tak ke Hawz par mere paas aayein."
"241","al-Nadr ibn Shumayl ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, un ke walid se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: jab ye ayat nazil hui: 'Mominon mein se baith rehne wale aur Allah ki rah mein jihad karne wale barabar nahi hain', to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne shane ki haddi mangwai aur use likhwa liya, phir 'Abdullah ibn Umm Maktum aaye aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se shikayat ki to Allah Ta'ala ne ye ayat nazil farmai: 'Mominon mein se be-uzr baith rehne wale barabar nahi hain'."
"242","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujhe bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, 'Adi ibn Thabit se, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Zayd ibn Thabit ko kehte hue suna: jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Uhud ki taraf nikle to kuch log raste hi se wapas laut gaye, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke sahaba un ke bare mein do girohon mein bat gaye: ek giroh kehne laga hum unhein qatl karenge aur ek giroh kehne laga hum unhein qatl nahi karenge, to Allah Ta'ala ne ye ayat nazil farmai: 'Tumhein kya hua ke tum munafiqon ke bare mein do giroh ho gaye halanke Allah ne unhein un ke kiye ki wajah se aundha kar diya hai', aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Beshak ye Taybah hai; ye gandagi ko is tarah nikal deta hai jaise aag chandi ke mail ko nikal deti hai'."
"243","Musa ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Qays ibn al-Rabi' ne bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Thabit ibn 'Ubayd se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: 'Main ek qaum ko khat likhta hun aur mujhe dar hai ke wo meri taraf se kuch badha den ya kami kar den, lihaza tum Suryani zaban seekh lo', to main ne use satrah din mein seekh liya."
"244","'Abd al-Malik ibn 'Amr aur 'Uthman ibn 'Umar ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, 'Uqbah ibn 'Abd al-Rahman se, Muhammad ibn 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Thawban se, Zayd ibn Thabit se ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Allah Yahud se jang kare; unhon ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko masajid bana liya'."
"245","Rawh ibn 'Ubadah ne hamein bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Hassan ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Kathir ibn Aflah se, Zayd ibn Thabit se: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne unhein hukm diya ke har namaz ke akhir mein taintis martaba SubhanAllah kahen aur taintis martaba Alhamdulillah kahen aur chautis martaba Allahu Akbar kahen, unhon ne kaha: phir ek shakhs ne khwab mein dekha ke ek shakhs us se keh raha hai: 'Kash tum unhein pachchis kar do aur un ke sath tahlil ko shamil kar lo', unhon ne kaha: phir us ne is ka zikr Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se kiya to aap ne farmaya: 'Phir aisa hi kar lo'."
"246","'Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Kharijah ibn Zayd se, ke Zayd ibn Thabit ne kaha: jab hum ne masahif likhe to mujhe ek ayat nahi mili jo main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se sunta tha aur main ne use Khuzaymah ibn Thabit al-Ansari ke pas paya: 'Mominon mein se aise mard hain jinhon ne Allah se kiye hue ahd ko sach kar dikhaya' se le kar 'aur unhon ne koi tabdili nahi ki' tak, unhon ne kaha: Khuzaymah ko Dhu al-Shahadatayn kaha jata tha; Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne us ki gawahi ko do mardon ki gawahi ke barabar qarar diya tha, aur wo Siffin ke din 'Ali ke sath shaheed hue, Allah un par raham farmaye."
"247","'Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, al-Thawri ne hamein khabar di, Abu Sinan ne mujhe khabar di, Wahb ibn Khalid al-Himsi se, Ibn al-Daylami se, unhon ne kaha: mere dil mein taqdir ke bare mein kuch khaljan paida hua to main Ubayy ibn Ka'b ke pas aaya aur un se sawal kiya, unhon ne kaha: beshak Allah Ta'ala agar apne asmanon aur zamin ke rehne walon ko azab de to un par zulm nahi karega aur agar un par raham farmaye to us ki rahmat un ke a'mal se behtar hogi, agar tum Uhud ke barabar - ya kaha: Uhud ki tarah - sona kharch kar do to Allah use qubul nahi farmayega hatta ke tum taqdir par iman lao aur jaan lo ke jo tumhein pahucha wo tum se talne wala nahi tha aur jo tum se tal gaya wo tumhein pahunchne wala nahi tha, agar tum is ke alawa kisi aur aqide par mare to us fitrat ke alawa par maroge jis par Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam paida kiye gaye the, unhon ne kaha: phir main un ke pas se nikla aur Ibn Mas'ud ke pas aaya aur un se sawal kiya to unhon ne bhi mujh se wahi kaha, unhon ne kaha: phir main Hudhayfah ibn al-Yaman ke pas aaya aur un se sawal kiya to unhon ne bhi mujh se wahi kaha, phir main Zayd ibn Thabit ke pas aaya aur un se sawal kiya to unhon ne mujh se Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se wahi riwayat bayan ki."
"248","'Abd al-Malik ibn 'Amr ne hamein bayan kiya, Hisham al-Dastuwa'i ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke sath sehri khai phir hum namaz ke liye nikle, unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: un dono ke darmiyan kitna faasla tha? unhon ne kaha: jitne mein aadmi pachas ayatein padh le."
"249","Abu Nu'aym ne hamein bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amir ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, Sa'd ibn Sulayman se, Zayd ibn Thabit se: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam farmaya karte the: 'Kya main tumhein jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazane ka pata na bataun? Kasrat se kaho: La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah'."
"250","'Affan ibn Muslim ne hamein bayan kiya, Wuhayb ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, Musa ibn 'Uqbah ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu al-Nadr ko Busr ibn Sa'id se, Zayd ibn Thabit se riwayat karte hue suna: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne masjid mein chatai se ek hujra bana liya aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne us mein kuch raatein namaz padhi hatta ke log aap ke pas jama ho gaye, phir ek raat unhon ne aap ki awaz nahi suni aur samjhe ke aap so gaye hain to un mein se kuch aap ke bahar tashrif lane ke liye khankharne lage, aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhara ye amal jo main ne dekha musalsal jari raha hatta ke mujhe dar hua ke ye tum par farz kar di jayegi aur agar ye farz kar di jati to tum use qaim na rakh sakte, pas aye logon, apne gharon mein namaz padha karo, beshak aadmi ki behtarin namaz us ke ghar mein hai siwaye farz namaz ke'."
"251","'Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, Yazid ibn Qusayt se, 'Ata ibn Yasar se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke samne Surah al-Najm padhi to aap ne us mein sajdah nahi kiya."
"252","Muhammad ibn 'Umar al-Waqidi ne hamein bayan kiya, Salit ibn Yasar ibn Salit ibn Zayd ibn Thabit ne bayan kiya, Maryam bint Sa'd ibn Zayd ibn Thabit se, Umm Sa'd bint Sa'd ibn al-Rabi' se - jo Kharijah ibn Zayd ibn Thabit ki walida thin - Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: 'Jo shakhs Allah ki rah mein ghoda pale to wo us ke liye aag se dhal ban jayega'."
"253","Kathir ibn Hisham ne hamein bayan kiya, Ja'far ibn Burqan ne bayan kiya, Thabit ibn al-Hajjaj ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Thabit ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne hamein mukhabarah se mana farmaya, main ne kaha: mukhabarah kya hai? unhon ne kaha: ye ke tum zamin nisf ya tihai ya chauthai par lo."
"254","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn 'Ulayyah ne bayan kiya, al-Jurayri se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri se, Zayd ibn Thabit ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Banu al-Najjar ke ek bagh mein apne ek khachchar par the aur hum aap ke sath the to wo aap ko le kar bidka aur qareeb tha ke aap ko gira de aur wahan chhe ya panch ya char qabrein thin, aap ne farmaya: 'In qabron walon ko kaun janta hai?' ek aadmi ne kaha: main janta hun, aap ne farmaya: 'Wo kab mare?' us ne kaha: wo shirk par mare, aap ne farmaya: 'Ye ummat apni qabron mein azmayi jayegi, agar ye dar na hota ke tum dafan karna chhod doge to main Allah se dua karta ke tumhein azab-e-qabr mein se wo kuch sunaye jo main sunta hun', phir aap ne apna chehra hamari taraf phera aur farmaya: 'Allah se aag ke azab se panah mango', hum ne kaha: hum Allah se aag ke azab se panah mangte hain, aap ne farmaya: 'Allah se qabr ke azab se panah mango', hum ne kaha: hum Allah se qabr ke azab se panah mangte hain, aap ne farmaya: 'Allah se fitnon se panah mango, jo un mein se zahir hain aur jo poshida hain', hum ne kaha: hum Allah se fitnon se panah mangte hain, jo zahir hain aur jo poshida hain, aap ne farmaya: 'Allah se Dajjal ke fitne se panah mango', hum ne kaha: hum Allah se Dajjal ke fitne se panah mangte hain."
"255","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Waki' ne bayan kiya, Kathir ibn Zayd se, al-Muttalib ibn 'Abdullah ibn Hantab se, Zayd ibn Thabit se ke un se Zuhr aur 'Asr mein qiraat ke bare mein pucha gaya to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam qiyam ko tawil farmate the aur apne honton ko harkat dete the."
"256","'Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, al-Dahhak ibn Nibras ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, Zayd ibn Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: namaz ki iqamat kahi gayi to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam paidal chalte hue bahar tashrif laye aur main aap ke sath tha aur aap ne apne qadmon ko chhota kar liya, phir aap ne mujh se farmaya: 'Kya tum jante ho main ne aisa kyun kiya? taake namaz ki taraf chalte hue hamare qadmon ki tadad zyada ho'."
"257","Abu Nu'aym ne hamein bayan kiya, al-'Ala ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, Abu Sulayman ne bayan kiya: unhon ne Zayd ibn Arqam ke sath ek janaze ki namaz padhi aur us par panch takbirein kahin to main ne kaha: kya ye bhul se tha ya qasdan? unhon ne kaha: nahi balke qasdan; Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam aise hi namaz padhate the."
"258","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Husam ibn al-Misakk ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Qasim ibn 'Awf al-Shaybani se, Zayd ibn Arqam ne bayan kiya: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Quba ki masjid mein un ke pas tashrif laye aur unhein Duha ki namaz padhte hue dekha to farmaya: 'Ye awwabin ki namaz hai', unhon ne kaha: aur wo use us waqt padhte the jab oont ke bachche garmi mehsoos karte the."
"259","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sallam ibn Miskin Abu 'Abdullah al-Basri ne hamein khabar di, 'Aidhullah al-Mujashi'i se, Abu Dawud se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: hum ne kaha - ya unhon ne kaha, Yazid ko shak hua - ya Rasulullah, ye qurbaniyan kya hain? aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare walid Ibrahim ki sunnat hai', unhon ne kaha: in mein hamare liye kya hai? aap ne farmaya: 'Har baal ke badle ek neki hai', kaha gaya: ya Rasulullah, phir oon ka kya? aap ne farmaya: 'Oon ke har baal ke badle bhi ek neki hai'."
"260","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne hamein khabar di, al-Harith ibn Shubayl se, Abu 'Amr al-Shaybani se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: hum mein se koi namaz mein apne sathi se kisi zarurat ke bare mein baat kar leta tha hatta ke ye ayat nazil hui: 'Namazon ki aur darmiyani namaz ki hifazat karo aur Allah ke liye farmabardar ban kar khade raho', to hamein khamosh rehne ka hukm diya gaya."
"261","Hamein 'Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isra'il se, Abu Ishaq se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se poocha: Aap ne Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ke hamrah kitne ghazwon mein shirkat ki? Unhon ne kaha: Satrah ghazwon mein. Main ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne kitne ghazwon mein shirkat ki? Unhon ne kaha: Unnis ghazwon mein."
"262","Hamein 'Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isra'il se, Abu Ishaq se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne chacha ke saath tha aur main ne 'Abdullah ibn Ubayy ibn Salul ko apne sathiyon se kehte hue suna: Jo log Rasul Allah ke saath hain un par kharch na karo yahan tak ke woh muntashir ho jayen, aur agar hum Madinah ki taraf lauten to 'izzat wala zaroor zaleel ko us se nikal dega. Main ne is ka zikr apne chacha se kiya, aur unhon ne is ka zikr Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) se kiya. Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne mujhe bulaya aur main ne unhein khabar di. Phir Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne 'Abdullah ibn Ubayy ibn Salul aur us ke sathiyon ko bula bheja, aur unhon ne qasam khai ke unhon ne ye nahin kaha tha. To Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne mujhe jhutlaya aur use sachcha samjha. Mujh par aisa gham aaya jaisa kabhi nahin aaya tha, aur main ghar mein baith gaya. Mere chacha ne mujh se kaha: Tum ne to sirf ye chaha tha ke Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) tumhein jhutlayen aur tum se naraz hon?! Phir Allah Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Jab munafiq aap ke paas aate hain. To Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne mujhe bula bheja aur use mere samne tilawat kiya, phir farmaya: Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne tumhari tasdeeq kar di hai."
"263","Ya'la ne hum se riwayat ki, al-A'mash ne bayan kiya, Thumamah ibn 'Uqbah se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Ahl-e-Kitab mein se ek aadmi Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ai Abu al-Qasim, tum da'wa karte ho ke Ahl-e-Jannat khayenge aur piyenge. Unhon ne farmaya: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai, un mein se ek aadmi ko khane, peene, jima' aur khwahish mein sau aadmiyon ki quwwat di jayegi. Us ne kaha: Phir jo khayega aur piyega use to qaza-e-hajat ki zaroorat hogi?! Unhon ne farmaya: Mushk ki khushbu jaisa behne wala paseena aayega; jab aisa hoga to us ka pet simat jayega."
"264","Ya'la aur Muhammad, jo 'Ubayd ke bete hain, ne hum se riwayat ki, donon ne kaha: Yusuf ibn Suhayb ne bayan kiya, Habib ibn Yasar se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Jo apni moonchhen na kate woh hum mein se nahin hai."
"265","Hamein Ja'far ibn 'Awn ne khabar di, Abu Hayyan al-Taymi ne hamein khabar di, Yazid ibn Hayyan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zayd ibn Arqam ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) hamare darmiyan khade hue, Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Hamd ke ba'd, ai logo, main sirf ek bashar hun; qareeb hai ke mere Rabb ka qasid mere paas aaye aur main use jawab dun. Main tumhare darmiyan do bhaari cheezen chhore jata hun: pehli Allah ki Kitab hai, us mein hidayat aur noor hai, to Allah ki Kitab ko mazbooti se pakro aur use thaam lo. Unhon ne Allah ki Kitab par ubhara aur us ki targheeb di, phir farmaya: Aur mere Ahl-e-Bayt; main tumhein apne Ahl-e-Bayt ke bare mein Allah yaad dilata hun, teen martaba. Husayn ne kaha: Ai Zayd, un ke Ahl-e-Bayt kaun hain? Kya un ki biwiyan un ke Ahl-e-Bayt mein se nahin hain? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, un ki biwiyan un ke Ahl-e-Bayt mein se hain, lekin un ke Ahl-e-Bayt woh hain jin par un ke ba'd sadaqah haram hai. Unhon ne kaha: Woh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: 'Ali ka khandan, Ja'far ka khandan, 'Aqil ka khandan, aur al-'Abbas ka khandan. Unhon ne kaha: Kya in sab par sadaqah haram tha? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"266","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se riwayat ki, Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, 'Amr ibn Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hamzah ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zayd ibn Arqam ko kehte hue suna: Woh Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ke saath the, aur unhon ne farmaya: Tum un logon ka jo Hawz par mere paas aayenge sirf ek lakh hisson mein se ek hissa ho. Main ne kaha: Us waqt aap kitne the? Unhon ne kaha: Saat sau aadmi ya aath sau aadmi."
"267","Muhadir ibn al-Muwarri' ne mujh se riwayat ki, 'Asim ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne kaha: Hamein sikhao ya hum se riwayat karo. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhein sirf woh sikhaunga jo Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) hamein sikhaya karte the: Ai Allah, main Tujh se 'ajiz hone aur susti se, bakhl aur buzdili se, burhape aur qabr ke 'azab se panah mangta hun. Ai Allah, hamari janon ko un ka taqwa 'ata farma, aur Tu unhein pak karne wala sab se behtar hai; Tu un ka Wali aur Mawla hai. Ai Allah, main Tujh se us dil se panah mangta hun jo 'ajizi na kare, us nafs se jo sair na ho, us 'ilm se jo nafa' na de, aur us du'a se jo qubool na ho."
"268","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne khabar di, Shu'bah se, Abu 'Abdullah al-Shami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko khutbah dete hue suna, woh keh rahe the: Ai Ahl-e-Sham, hamein al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne kaha: ya'ni Zayd ibn Arqam, ke Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se ek jama'at hamesha haq par rahegi yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jaye, aur main samajhta hun ke woh tum ho, ai Ahl-e-Sham."
"269","Hamein 'Affan ibn Muslim aur Abu al-Walid ne riwayat ki, donon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Qays ibn Sa'd se, 'Ata ibn Abi Rabah se ke Ibn 'Abbas ne Zayd ibn Arqam se kaha: Kya tum nahin jante ke Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ko ihram ki halat mein shikar ka ek dast pesh kiya gaya aur unhon ne use qubool nahin kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"270","Hamein 'Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Sufyan se, Jabir se, Khaythamah se, Zayd ibn Arqam se: Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) un ki 'iyadat ke liye un ke paas aaye jab woh apni aankhon ki shikayat kar rahe the, aur farmaya: Agar tumhari aankhen jaisi hain waisi hi rahen ya is tarah ki koi baat to tum kya karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Tab main sabr karunga aur sawab chahunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Agar tumhari aankhen jaisi hain waisi hi rahen to tum Allah se is hal mein miloge ke tum par koi gunah na hoga."
"271","Mujh se Ahmad ibn Yunus ne riwayat ki, Abu Mu'awiyah ne bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Yazid ibn Hayyan se, Zayd ibn Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Yahud mein se ek aadmi ne Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) par jadu kiya. Woh beemar ho gaye, aur Jibril un ke paas aaye aur un par Mu'awwidhatayn nazil kin, aur kaha: Yahud mein se ek aadmi ne tum par jadu kiya hai, aur jadu falan ki kunwen mein hai. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne 'Ali ko bheja, jo use le aaye. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne unhein girah kholne aur ek ayat parhne ka hukm diya. Woh parhte rahe aur kholte rahe yahan tak ke Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) aise khade ho gaye goya bandhanon se aazad ho gaye hon. Unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne us Yahudi se us ke kiye ka kuch zikr nahin kiya, aur na main ne use un ke chehre mein dekha."
"272","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne riwayat ki, Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, ke Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban ne unhein khabar di ke Abu 'Amrah, jo Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani ke aazad kardah hain, ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani ko bayan karte hue suna ke Musalmanon mein se ek aadmi Khaybar mein faut ho gaya, aur unhon ne is ka zikr Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) se kiya taake woh us par namaz parhen. Unhon ne farmaya: Apne sathi par namaz parho. Logon ke chehre mutaghayyir ho gaye, aur jab unhon ne dekha jo unhein nagawar guzra to farmaya: Tumhare sathi ne Allah ke raste mein ghanimat mein khiyanat ki hai. Unhon ne kaha: To hum ne us ke saman ki talashi li aur Yahud ke mankon mein se manke paye, Allah ki qasam jo do dirham ke barabar bhi nahin the."
"273","Mujhe Abu 'Ali al-Hanafi ne khabar di, Malik ibn Anas ne riwayat ki, 'Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, ke un ke walid ne unhein khabar di ke 'Abdullah ibn Qays ibn Makhramah ne unhein khabar di ke Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main aaj raat Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ki namaz-e-shab ka mushahidah karunga. To main ne apna sar un ki dehleez ya un ke khayme par rakh diya. Woh khade hue aur do halki rak'aten parhin, phir do lambi rak'aten parhin, lambi, lambi, phir khade ho kar do rak'aten parhin jo un se kam thin, phir do rak'aten parhin jo un se pehli wali se kam thin, phir do rak'aten parhin jo un se pehli wali se kam thin, phir do rak'aten parhin jo un se pehli wali se kam thin, phir witr parhi. Ye terah rak'aten thin."
"274","Hamein 'Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Abi Labid se, al-Muttalib ibn 'Abdullah ibn Hantab se, Khallad ibn al-Sa'ib se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Jibril mere paas aaye aur mujh se kaha: Apne sathiyon ko hukm do ke talbiyah buland awaz se kahen, kyunke ye Hajj ke sha'a'ir mein se hai."
"275","Hamein Ya'la ibn 'Ubayd ne riwayat ki, 'Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman ne bayan kiya, 'Ata se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Apne gharon ko qabren na banao; un mein namaz parho."
"276","Hamein Ya'la ibn 'Ubayd ne riwayat ki, 'Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman ne bayan kiya, 'Ata se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) se unhon ne farmaya: Jo rozedar ko iftar karaye us ke liye us ke sawab jaisa likha jata hai, siwa is ke ke ye rozedar ke sawab mein se kuch kam nahin karta. Aur jo Allah ke raste mein ghazi ko tayyar kare ya us ke ghar walon ki dekh bhal kare us ke liye us ke sawab jaisa likha jata hai, siwa is ke ke ye ghazi ke sawab mein se kuch kam nahin karta."
"277","Hamein Abu Nu'aym ne riwayat ki, Shayban ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah se, Busr ibn Sa'id se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se ke Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Jis ne Allah ke raste mein ghazi ko tayyar kiya us ne ghazwah kiya, aur jis ne ghazi ke ghar walon mein achhai ke saath us ki khilafat ki us ne ghazwah kiya."
"278","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, al-Majishun ne hamein khabar di, Salih ibn Kaysan se, 'Ubaydullah ibn 'Abdullah ibn 'Utbah se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Murghe ko bura na kaho, kyunke woh namaz ke liye pukarta hai."
"279","Hamein Rawh ibn 'Ubadah ne riwayat ki, Malik ibn Anas ne riwayat ki, Rabi'ah ibn Abi 'Abd al-Rahman se, Yazid, jo al-Munba'ith ke aazad kardah hain, se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ke paas aaya aur un se luqtah ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ke bartan aur us ke bandhan ko pehchan lo, phir us ka ek saal tak e'lan karo. Agar us ka talash karne wala aa jaye, warna us ke saath jo chaho karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir gumshudah bakri? Unhon ne farmaya: Woh tumhare liye hai, ya tumhare bhai ke liye, ya bhediye ke liye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir gumshudah oont? Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhein us se kya? Us ke saath us ki mashk aur us ke joote hain; woh pani par aata hai aur darakhton se khata hai yahan tak ke us ka malik use pa le."
"280","Hamein 'Abd al-Malik ibn 'Amr ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Sa'd ne riwayat ki, Zayd ibn Aslam se, 'Ata ibn Yasar se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, ke Rasul Allah (Allah ki rehmat aur salamati ho un par) ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur apna wuzu mukammal kare, phir do rak'aten parhe jin mein ghaflat na kare, us ke pehle ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain."
"281","Mujhe Shababah ibn Sawwar ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne bayan kiya, Salih ghulam-e al-Taw'amah se, Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke saath Maghrib padhte the, phir bazaar ki taraf nikal jaate, aur agar teer phenka jaata to main dekh leta tha ke woh kahan gira hai."
"282","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Ibn Uyaynah ne hamein khabar di, Salim se, Busr ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Juhaym jo Ubayy ibn Ka'b ki behen ke bete hain unhon ne mujhe bheja: Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani se pucho ke tum ne namazi ke samne se guzarne wale ke baare mein kya suna hai? Unhon ne Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se zikr kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: Us ka chalis tak khada rehna us ke liye us ke samne se guzarne se behtar hai. Main nahi janta ke unhon ne chalis saal kaha, ya mahine, ya din, ya ghante."
"283","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Ibn Lahi'ah ne bayan kiya, Uqayl ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah se, Usamah ibn Zayd se, un ke walid Zayd ibn Harithah se, Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se: Ke Jibril Alayhis Salam ne sab se pehle jo Aap par nazil hua Aap ko wuzu aur namaz karke dikhaya. Jab Aap wuzu se farigh hue to ek chullu pani liya aur us se apni sharmgah par chhirak kiya."
"284","Hamein Abdullah ibn Yazid ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne bayan kiya, mujhe Humayd ibn Hani ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Amr ibn Hurayth ne khabar di ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Tum apne khadim ke kaam mein se jo kuch halka kar doge woh tumhare mizan mein tumhare liye ajr hoga."
"285","Hamein Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Suddi se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us shakhs ne khabar di jis ne Amr ibn Hurayth se suna, kehte hue: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko paiwand lage hue jooton mein namaz padhte dekha."
"286","Hamein Abu Asim ne khabar di, Sa'id ibn Zayd ne hamein khabar di, Ali ibn al-Hakam se, Abu al-Hasan al-Himsi se, Amr ibn Murrah se — jinhein suhbat hasil thi — ke unhon ne Mu'awiyah se kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo bhi hakim ya qazi — Ali ko shak hua — apna darwaza hajat-mandon, muhtajon aur miskino par band kar le, Allah us ki hajat, muhtaji aur miskini par apna darwaza band kar dega."
"287","Hamein Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne bayan kiya, mujhe Qays Abu Umarah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm ko apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Jo bhi musalman apne musalman bhai ko us ki musibat par tasalli de, Allah Ta'ala usey Qayamat ke din izzat ke jodon mein se pehnayega."
"288","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, mujhe Qays Abu Umarah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm ko apne walid se, woh apne dada se, Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se riwayat karte hue suna, Aap ne farmaya: Jo bhi bimar ki iyadat karta hai woh rahmat mein chalta rehta hai yahan tak ke jab baithta hai to us mein gharq ho jata hai, phir jab wapas laut-ta hai to usi mein chalta rehta hai yahan tak ke jahan se aaya tha wahan wapas pahunch jaye."
"289","Mujhe Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne Kathir ibn Abdullah ibn Amr ibn Awf al-Muzani se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne mere dada se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Jis ne meri koi aisi sunnat ko zinda kiya jo mar chuki ho aur us par amal kiya jaye to usey utna hi ajr milega jitna us par amal karne wale logon ko milega, un ke ajron mein se kuch kam kiye baghair. Aur jis ne koi bid'at ijad ki aur us par amal kiya gaya to us par utna hi bojh hoga jitna us par amal karne wale logon par hoga, un ke bojhon mein se kuch kam kiye baghair."
"290","Hamein Isma'il ibn Abi Uways ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Kathir ibn Abdullah ibn Amr ibn Awf al-Muzani ne apne walid se, woh apne dada se bayan kiya: Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam dono Eidon ki pehli rak'at mein saat martaba takbir kehte the aur aakhiri rak'at mein paanch martaba."
"291","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Kathir ibn Abdullah ibn Amr ibn Awf al-Muzani ne apne walid se, woh apne dada se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jum'ah mein din ki ek ghadi aisi hai ke banda us mein jo kuch bhi mange use woh diya jata hai jo woh mangta hai. Kaha gaya: Woh kaun si ghadi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jab se namaz khadi ki jaye yahan tak ke us se farigh hua jaye."
"292","Hamein Zayd ibn Hubab ne bayan kiya, mujhe Faraj ibn Fadalah ne Muhammad ibn Abd al-A'la se, woh apne walid se, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As se, woh apne walid se bayan kiya ke do jhagadne wale Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke paas aaye. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne Amr se farmaya: In ke darmiyan faisla karo. Maine kaha: Aap is ke mujh se zyada haqdar hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir bhi. Unhon ne kaha: Main faisla nahi karunga. Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum durust faisla karo to tumhare liye das nekiyan likhi jayengi, aur agar ijtihad karo aur khata kar jao to tumhare liye ek neki likhi jayegi."
"293","Hamein Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ulayy ibn Rabah al-Lakhmi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid ko kehte hue suna: Maine Abu Qays ghulam-e Amr ibn al-As ko kehte hue suna: Maine Amr ibn al-As ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Hamare roze aur Ahl-e Kitab ke roze ke darmiyan farq sehri khana hai."
"294","Hamein Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Abu Ja'far al-Khatmi se, Umarah ibn Khuzaymah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Amr ibn al-As ke saath Hajj ya Umrah mein the, aur jab hum Marr al-Zahran par the to ek aurat apne hawdaj mein apna haath apne hawdaj par rakhe hue thi. Jab woh utre to woh ghati mein dakhil hue aur hum bhi un ke saath dakhil hue. Unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke saath is jagah par the, jab bahut se kawwe the, aur un mein ek safed pet wala kawwa tha jis ki chonch aur tangen surkh thi. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Auraton mein se koi Jannat mein dakhil nahi hogi magar is kawwe ki tarah in kawwon mein."
"295","Mujhe Yahya ibn Hammad ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn al-Mukhtar ne bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hadhdha ne bayan kiya, Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Amr ibn al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne mujhe Dhat al-Salasil ke lashkar par amir muqarrar kiya. Main Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, logon mein Aap ko sab se zyada mehboob kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: A'ishah. Maine kaha: Mardon mein se? Aap ne farmaya: Un ke walid phir. Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir Umar. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne mardon ko ginwaya."
"296","Hamein Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ibn Aban ne bayan kiya, mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Isa ibn Buhayr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya: Woh masjid mein the jab Amr ibn al-As baithe hue the, aur unhon ne mujh se kaha: Kya tum Ahl-e Yaman mein se ho? Maine kaha: Ji haan. Unhon ne mujh se kaha: Mere qareeb aao, main tumhein ek hadith sunata hun jis se tumhari aankhen thandi hongi. Unhon ne kaha: Pas main un ke qareeb hua, aur Amr ne kaha: Jab hum ek din baithe hue the, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam tashrif laye aur hamare saath baith gaye, phir farmaya: Kahan hain mere bhai jin ka main hun aur jo mere hain; main Jannat mein dakhil hunga aur woh mere saath dakhil honge. Phir Aap khade hue aur chale gaye, aur zyada der na guzri ke Aap wapas aaye aur baithe, phir farmaya: Kahan hain mere bhai jin ka main hun aur jo mere hain; main Jannat mein dakhil hunga aur woh mere saath dakhil honge. Phir Aap khade hue aur chale gaye. Hum mein se baaz ne dusron se kaha: Kaash hum puchte: Kya woh hamare siwa koi aur hain, Ya Rasulullah? Thodi hi der guzri thi ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam wapas aaye aur baithe, aur farmaya: Kahan hain mere bhai jin ka main hun aur jo mere hain; main Jannat mein dakhil hunga aur woh mere saath dakhil honge. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya woh hamare siwa koi aur hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, woh Ahl-e Yaman hain, zameen ke kinaron mein dhutkare hue, hukmaranon ke darwazon se dhutkare hue; un mein se ek apni hajat seene mein liye mar jata hai, kabhi poori nahi hoti."
"297","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Hariz ibn Uthman ne hamein khabar di, Salim ibn Amir ne bayan kiya, Amr ibn Abasah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke paas aaya jab Aap Ukaz mein the, aur kaha: Is mu'amle mein kis ne Aap ki pairwi ki hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ek azad aur ek ghulam ne — aur Aap ke saath sirf Abu Bakr aur Bilal the. Unhon ne kaha: Jao yahan tak ke Allah apne Rasul ko ghalba de, phir us ke baad un ke paas aana. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Nabi Allah, Allah mujhe Aap par fida kare, koi aisi baat jo Aap jaante hain aur main nahi janta, jo mujhe nafa de aur Aap ko nuqsan na de: Kaun si ghadi Allah ke zyada qareeb hai, aur kaun si ghadi se bachna chahiye? Aap ne farmaya: Ay Amr ibn Abasah, tune mujh se aisi baat puchi hai jo tujh se pehle kisi ne mujh se nahi puchi. Rab Tabarak wa Ta'ala raat ke aakhiri hisse mein nuzul farmata hai aur bakhsh deta hai, siwaye shirk aur zulm ke. Namaz muqarrar hai aur haazir ki jati hai yahan tak ke suraj nikal aaye, kyunki woh shaytan ke seeng par nikalta hai, aur yeh kafiron ki namaz hai. Pas namaz se ruke raho yahan tak ke suraj buland ho jaye. Jab woh buland ho jaye to namaz haazir ki jati hai yahan tak ke nisf al-nahar ho. Jab dopahar barabar ho jaye to namaz se ruke raho, kyunki us waqt Jahannam bhadkai jati hai. Jab saya dhal jaye to namaz haazir ki jati hai yahan tak ke woh ghurub ki taraf dhal jaye, kyunki woh shaytan ke seeng par ghurub hota hai aur yeh kafiron ki namaz hai. Pas namaz se ruke raho yahan tak ke suraj ghurub ho jaye."
"298","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Bishr ibn Numayr ne hamein khabar di, al-Qasim se, Abu Umamah se, Amr ibn Abasah se ke Shurahbil ibn Hasanah ne un se pucha: Ay Amr, kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se koi aisi hadith hai jis mein na bhool hai na izafa? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo wuzu kare aur apne haath dhoye us ke gunah us ki ungliyon ke poron se nikal jate hain. Jab woh kulli kare aur naak mein pani dale us ke gunah us ke kaanon se nikal jate hain. Jab woh apna chehra dhoye us ke gunah us ke chehre se nikal jate hain. Jab woh apne haath dhoye us ke gunah us ke haathon se nikal jate hain. Jab woh apne sar ka masah kare us ke gunah us ke baalon ke kinaron se nikal jate hain. Jab woh apne paon dhoye us ke gunah us ke paon ki ungliyon se nikal jate hain. Agar woh apne wuzu par baitha rahe to us ka ajr pata hai, aur agar khada ho kar apni namaz mein mashghul ho jaye to is tarah laut-ta hai jaise us ki maa ne use jana tha, gunahon se paak. Shurahbil ne un se kaha: Ay Amr, dekho tum kya keh rahe ho? Unhon ne kaha: Agar maine ise sirf ek ya do ya teen martaba suna hota to main tumhein bayan na karta. Aur unhon ne kaha: Jo Allah ke raste mein ek safed baal ugaye woh Qayamat ke din us ke liye noor hoga, aur jo dushman par ek teer chalaye jo pahunch jaye — chahe lage ya khata jaye — to woh ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai."
"299","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Hariz ibn Uthman ne hamein khabar di, Salim ibn Amir ne bayan kiya ke Amr ibn Abasah Shurahbil ibn al-Simt ke saath the, aur unhon ne kaha: Ay Amr, kya koi hadith hai jo tum hamein Allah ke Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se bayan karte ho jis mein na koi kami hai na bhool? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke Haath mein Amr ki jaan hai: Jo bhi shakhs Allah ke raste mein ek safed baal ugata hai magar Allah usey Qayamat ke din noor bana deta hai. Jo bhi shakhs Allah Ta'ala ke raste mein dushman par teer chalata hai, chahe khata jaye ya lage, magar woh us ke liye Bani Isma'il mein se ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai. Jo koi momin ghulam azad kare, us ke har uzw ke badle us ka har uzw Aag se chhutkara pata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ay Amr ibn Abasah, tum bahut bada hadith bayan karte ho. Amr ne kaha: Mera haal bura hai; meri umr zyada ho gayi hai aur meri haddiyan kamzor ho gayi hain, aur mujhe Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam par jhooth bolne ka koi sabab nahi. Maine ise Aap se ek se zyada martaba suna hai."
"300","Hamein Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Dhakwan se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Amr ibn Abasah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, is mu'amle mein kis ne Aap ki pairwi ki hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ek azad aur ek ghulam ne. Maine kaha: Islam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Achchi baat kehna aur khana khilana. Maine kaha: Iman kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Sabr aur sakhawat. Maine kaha: Kaun sa Islam afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki zaban aur haath se musalman mehfooz rahen. Maine kaha: Kaun sa iman afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Husn-e akhlaq. Maine kaha: Kaun si namaz afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Lamba qiyam. Maine kaha: Kaun si hijrat afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tum woh chhod do jo tumhara Rab napasand karta hai. Maine kaha: Kaun sa jihad afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis ka ghoda kaat diya jaye aur us ka khoon baha diya jaye. Maine kaha: Kaun si ghadi afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Raat ka aakhiri gehra hissa. Phir namaz muqarrar hai aur haazir ki jati hai yahan tak ke fajr namudar ho. Jab fajr namudar ho to do rak'aton ke siwa koi namaz nahi yahan tak ke tum Fajr padh lo. Jab tum Fajr padh lo to namaz se ruke raho yahan tak ke suraj nikal aaye. Jab suraj nikal aaye to namaz se ruke raho, kyunki woh shaytan ke seeng mein nikalta hai, aur kafir use sajda karte hain. Ruke raho yahan tak ke woh buland ho jaye. Jab woh buland ho jaye to namaz muqarrar hai aur haazir ki jati hai yahan tak ke saya neze ki tarah khada ho jaye. Jab aisa ho jaye to koi namaz nahi yahan tak ke suraj dhal jaye. Jab woh dhal jaye to namaz muqarrar hai aur haazir ki jati hai yahan tak ke suraj ghurub ho jaye. Jab woh ghurub ke qareeb ho to namaz se ruke raho, kyunki woh shaytan ke seeng mein ghurub hota hai — ya ghaib hota hai — aur kafir use sajda karte hain."
"301","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Amr ibn Abasah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Islam kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Ye ke tum apna dil Allah Azza wa Jalla ke hawale kar do aur Musalman tumhari zaban aur tumhare hath se mahfuz rahen. Us ne kaha: Kaun sa Islam afzal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Iman. Us ne kaha: Iman kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Ye ke tum Allah, Us ke farishton, Us ki kitabon, Us ke rasulon aur maut ke ba'd dobara jiye jane par iman lao. Us ne kaha: Kaun sa iman afzal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Hijrat. Us ne kaha: Hijrat kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Ye ke tum burai chhod do. Us ne kaha: Kaun si hijrat afzal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Jihad. Us ne kaha: Jihad kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Ye ke jab tumhara kafiron se samna ho to tum un se jang karo. Us ne kaha: Kaun sa jihad afzal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Woh jis ka ghoda kata jaye aur us ka khun bahaya jaye. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Phir do amal sab se behtarin a'mal hain siwaye us ke jo un jaisa kare: Hajj mabrur ya Umrah."
"302","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Amr ibn Abasah se ke woh apne sathiyon ke sath baithe hue the jab ek shakhs ne kaha: Kaun hamein Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hadith bayan karega? Amr ne kaha: Main karunga. Us ne kaha: Allah ke liye hon tumhare walid aur khabardar raho. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs Allah ke raste me safed bal laye woh Qayamat ke din us ke liye nur hoga. Us ne kaha: Allah ke liye hon tumhare walid aur khabardar raho. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs Allah ke raste me tir chalaye ye ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai. Us ne kaha: Allah ke liye hon tumhare walid aur khabardar raho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs kisi jan ko azad kare Allah us ke har uzw ke badle us ka har uzw Aag se azad karta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs do janen azad kare Allah un ke har do a'za ke badle us ka ek uzw Aag se azad karta hai. Us ne kaha: Allah ke liye hon tumhare walid aur khabardar raho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ek hadith: Agar main ne ye Aap se ek ya do ya tin ya char ya paanch martaba ke siwa na suni hoti to main tumhen ye bayan na karta. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: Koi Musalman banda aisa nahin jo wuzu kare aur apna chehra dhoye magar us ke chehre ke gunah us ki dadhi ke kinaron se gir jate hain. Jab woh apne hath dhoye to us ke hathon ke gunah us ki ungliyon aur nakhunon ke darmiyan se gir jate hain. Jab woh apne sar ka masah kare to us ke sar ke gunah us ke balon ke kinaron se gir jate hain. Jab woh apne paon dhoye to us ke paon ke gunah un ke talwon se gir jate hain. Agar woh jama'at wali masjid me aye aur us me namaz padhe to us ka ajr Allah Azza wa Jalla ke zimme hai. Agar woh khada ho kar do rak'aten padhe to woh us ke liye kaffara hain."
"303","Rauh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Rashid ne bayan kiya, Makhul se, Amr ibn Abasah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Allah ke raste me ek din roza rakhe use Aag se sau baras ki musafat dur kar diya jata hai."
"304","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdul Hamid ibn Bahram ne bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Haushab ne bayan kiya, Abu Zabyah ne mujhe khabar di ke Shurahbil ibn al-Simt ne Amr ibn Abasah al-Sulami ko bulaya aur kaha: Ae Ibn Abasah, kya tum mujhe woh hadith bayan karoge jo tum ne khud Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suni ho jis me na izafa ho na jhut, aur mujhe kisi aur se bayan na karo jis ne Aap se tumhare siwa suni ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Meri muhabbat un ke liye wajib ho gayi jo Meri khatir ek dusre se muhabbat karte hain, aur Meri muhabbat un ke liye wajib ho gayi jo Meri khatir ek dusre par kharch karte hain, aur Meri muhabbat un ke liye wajib ho gayi jo Meri khatir ek dusre ki nusrat karte hain, aur Meri muhabbat un ke liye wajib ho gayi jo Meri khatir ek dusre se insaf karte hain, aur Meri muhabbat un ke liye wajib ho gayi jo Meri khatir ek dusre ki ziyarat karte hain. Amr ibn Abasah ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo bhi Musalman mard Allah ke raste me aisa tir chalaye jo pahunche, chahe khata kare ya lage, us ke liye us ghulam ke azad karne jaisa sawab hai jo Aulad-e-Isma'il me se ho. Jo shakhs Islam me safed bal laye woh us ke liye nur hai. Jo Musalman mard kisi Musalman mard ko azad kare, azad kardah ka har uzw azad karne wale ke har uzw ka Aag se fidya hai. Jo Musalman aurat kisi Musalman aurat ko azad kare, azad kardah ka har uzw azad karne wali ke har uzw ka Aag se fidya hai. Jo Musalman mard ya aurat ho jis ke sulb se Allah tin aise bachche pehle le le jo bulughat ko na pahunche hon woh us ke liye Aag se dhal hain. Jo shakhs namaz ka irada karke wuzu ke liye uthe aur wuzu ko us ke maqamat tak mukammal kare woh apne har gunah ya khat se mahfuz ho jata hai. Agar woh namaz ke liye khada ho Allah us ke zariye us ka ek darja buland karta hai, aur agar woh baithe to sahi-salim baithe. Shurahbil ibn al-Simt ne kaha: Kya tum ne ye hadith Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suni hai, ae Ibn Abasah? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabud nahin, agar main ne ye hadith Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ek ya do ya tin ya char ya paanch ya chhe ya saat martaba se zyada na suni hoti, woh saat par ruke, to main logon me se kisi se ye bayan karne ki qasam na khata, lekin Allah ki qasam main un martabon ki ginti nahin janta jitni martaba main ne ise Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna."
"305","Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Abdul Malik Abu Ja'far ne hamein khabar di, Abu Nadrah se, Sad ibn al-Atwal se ke un ke bhai ka inteqal hua aur unhon ne tin sau dirham aur ayal chhode. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne chaha ke ise un ke ayal par kharch karun, lekin Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara bhai apne qarz ki wajah se roka hua hai, pas us ki taraf se use ada karo. Unhon ne kaha: Pas unhon ne us ki taraf se ada kiya, phir kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main ne ada kar diya siwaye ek aurat ke jis ne do dinar ka da'wa kiya aur us ke pas koi sabut nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Use de do, kyunke woh sachchi hai."
"306","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Isa se, ek shakhs se, Sad ibn Ubadah se ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Das afrad ka koi amir aisa nahin jo Allah Azza wa Jalla se mile magar bandha hua, use insaf ke siwa koi cheez riha nahin karti. Aur koi shakhs aisa nahin jo Quran padhe phir use bhul jaye magar woh Allah se kate hue uzw wala ho kar milega."
"307","Husayn al-Ju'fi ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'idah se, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Isa ibn Fa'id se, Sad ibn Ubadah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se marfu'an riwayat karte hue ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Quran padhe phir use bhul jaye woh Qayamat ke din Allah ke pas bars ki bimari wala ho kar ayega, aur jo das afrad par muqarrar kiya gaya use Qayamat ke din bandha hua laya jayega, use us ke bandhanon se insaf ke siwa koi cheez azad nahin karegi."
"308","Isma'il ibn Abi Uways ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Amr ibn Shurahbil ibn Sa'id ibn Sad ibn Ubadah al-Ansari se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne huquq ke da'won me qasam ke sath ek gawah par faisla farmaya."
"309","Musa ibn Mas'ud ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Amr ibn Shurahbil ibn Sa'id se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, Sad ibn Ubadah se ke Ansar me se ek shakhs Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke pas aya aur kaha: Hamein Jumu'ah ke bare me batayiye, us me kya bhalai hai? Aap ne farmaya: Us me paanch khaslaten hain: us me Allah ne Adam ko paida kiya, aur us me Use utara, aur us me Allah ne Adam ki ruh qabz ki, aur us me ek ghadi hai jis me banda Allah se koi cheez nahin mangta magar Allah use ata karta hai, jab tak woh gunah ya qata-e-rahmi ka sawal na kare, aur us me Qayamat qayam hogi. Koi muqarrab farishta, na asman, na zamin, na pahad, na hawa hai magar woh Jumu'ah se darta hai."
"310","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Bukayr ibn Ata se ke unhon ne Abdur Rahman ibn Ya'mar ko kehte suna: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj Arafat hai ya Arafah hai, aur jo Muzdalifah ki rat fajr phutne se pehle pa le us ka Hajj mukammal ho gaya. Mina ke din tin hain, pas jo do din me jaldi kare us par koi gunah nahin, aur jo takhir kare us par koi gunah nahin."
"311","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Sakan ibn al-Mughirah Abu Muhammad se jo Uthman ibn Affan ke khandan ke azad kardah hain, unhon ne kaha: Walid ibn Ziyad ne mujh se bayan kiya, Farqad Abu Talhah se, Abdur Rahman ibn Khabbab al-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khutba dete hue dekha, aur Aap ne lashkar-e-usrat ke liye targhib di. Uthman ibn Affan raziyallahu anhu khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raste me sau unt un ke kajawon aur bordon samet. Phir Aap ne dusri martaba targhib di, aur Uthman ibn Affan khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raste me do sau unt un ke kajawon aur bordon samet. Phir Aap ne tisri martaba targhib di, aur Uthman ibn Affan khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raste me tin sau unt un ke kajawon aur bordon samet. Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha jab Aap minbar se utar rahe the farmate hue: Is ke ba'd Uthman jo bhi kare use nuqsan nahin dega, is ke ba'd Uthman jo bhi kare use nuqsan nahin dega."
"312","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi Abu Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah se, Azrah se, Sa'id ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Abza se, un ke walid se: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam witr me padhte the: Apne buland Rab ke naam ki tasbih karo, aur: Ae kafiro kaho, aur: Kaho Woh Allah Ek hai. Jab Aap salam pherte to tin martaba kehte: Badshah Nihayat Muqaddas ki zaat paak hai."
"313","Abdul Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Khalid se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abdur Rahman ibn Uthman al-Taymi se: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mendak ke qatl se mana farmaya."
"314","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Zayd ibn Sallam se, un ke dada se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ne Abdur Rahman ibn Shibl ko likha: Logon ko sikhao jo tum ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai. Pas unhon ne unhen jama kiya aur kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Quran sikho, aur jab tum ise sikh lo to us me hadd se na badho, na us se munh modo, na us ke zariye khao, na us ke zariye zyadati chaho. Phir unhon ne kaha: Tajir fajir hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kya Allah ne tijarat ko halal aur sud ko haram nahin kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, lekin woh qasmen khate hain aur gunah karte hain. Phir unhon ne kaha: Bigad karne waliyan Aag waliyan hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kaun hain bigad karne waliyan? Aap ne farmaya: Aurten. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kya woh hamari mayen aur behnen nahin? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, lekin jab unhen diya jaye to shukr nahin kartin, aur jab azmai jayen to sabr nahin kartin. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne kaha: Sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thode zyada ko. Jo salam ka jawab de us ke liye hai, aur jo jawab na de us par kuch nahin."
"315","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Aun ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Amir ibn Rabi'ah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to khade ho jao ya Aap ne kaha: thehar jao, yahan tak ke woh tumhare age se guzar jaye. Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar jab janaza dekhte to khade ho jate yahan tak ke woh un ke age se guzar jata. Unhon ne kaha: Aur jab Ibn Umar janaze ke sath nikalte to qabron ki taraf peeth kar lete."
"316","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sad ibn Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Asim ibn Ubaydullah ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'ah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sath ek siyah tarik rat me ek muhim par the aur qibla nahin jante the, pas hum me se har shakhs ne apne samne pattharon se masjid bana li, phir hum ne namaz padhi. Subah hum qibla ke siwa dusri taraf the, pas hum ne is ka zikr Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kiya, aur Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Mashriq aur maghrib Allah hi ke hain, pas tum jidhar bhi rukh karo udhar Allah ka chehra hai."
"317","Zayd ibn al-Hubab al-Ukli ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, Asim ibn Ubaydullah al-Umari se, Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'ah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko minbar par farmate hue suna: Koi banda aisa nahin jo mujh par durud bheje magar farishte us par durud bhejte hain jab tak woh mujh par durud bhejta rahe, pas use chahiye ke is me se kam kare ya zyada."
"318","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, al-Thawri ne hamein khabar di, Asim ibn Ubaydullah ibn Asim se, Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'ah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko roze ki halat me miswak karte dekha, itni martaba ke main gin nahin sakta."
"319","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'ah ne mujhe khabar di, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko apni sawari par har simt nafl namaz padhte dekha."
"320","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hariz ibn Uthman ne hamein khabar di, Habban ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ke Aap ne minbar par hote hue farmaya: Rahm karo tum par rahm kiya jayega, muaf karo Allah tumhen muaf karega. Halakat hai qaul ke qam'on walon ke liye, aur halakat hai israr karne walon ke liye jo us par israr karte hain jo unhon ne kiya jabke woh jante hain."
"321","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, al-Hajjaj ibn Artah ne hamein khabar di, 'Ata se, Ibn 'Amr se, aur Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Abu al-'Abbas se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya: Mujhe ye baat pahunchi hai ke tum din mein roza rakhte ho aur raat mein qiyam karte ho. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main aisa karta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo, kyunki agar tum aisa karoge to aankhein dhans jayengi aur jaan thak jayegi. Beshak tumhare ahl ka tum par haq hai, tumhari jaan ka tum par haq hai, aur tumhare jism ka tum par haq hai. Balke har mahine mein teen din roza rakho, ye tamam umr ke roze ke barabar hai. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main is se zyada ki taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne tamam umr roza rakha us ne roza nahi rakha, lekin agar tumhein zaroor karna hai to Dawud ka roza rakho, wo ek din roza rakhte the aur ek din iftar karte the, aur jab dushman se mad e muqabil hote to farar ikhtiyar na karte the."
"322","'Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan se, al-A'mash se, 'Abdullah ibn Murrah se, Masruq se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se jinhon ne farmaya: Char khaslaten hain, jis shakhs mein ye charon hongi wo khalis munafiq hai, aur jis mein in mein se koi ek khaslat hogi us mein nifaq ki ek khaslat hogi yahan tak ke wo use chhod de: jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab wada kare to khilaf warzi kare, jab jhagda kare to bad-kalami kare, aur jab mu'ahada kare to bad-'ahdi kare."
"323","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Baqiyyah ibn al-Walid ne hamein khabar di, Mu'awiyah ibn Sa'id al-Tujibi ne bayan kiya, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Qabil al-Misri ko kehte suna: Main ne 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ibn al-'As ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate suna: Jo Jum'ah ke din ya Jum'ah ki raat faut ho use qabr ke fitne se mahfuz rakha jata hai."
"324","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Mansur se, Salim se, Jabban se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se jinhon ne farmaya: Ehsan jatlane wala, sharab ka aadi, aur walad al-zina jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"325","'Abd al-Malik ibn 'Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, Humayd ibn 'Abd al-Rahman se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate suna: Kabira gunahon mein se ye hai ke aadmi apne walidayn ko gali de. Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, wo apne walidayn ko kaise gali deta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo kisi aadmi se gali-galoch karta hai to wo us ke baap ko gali deta hai, phir dusra us ke baap ko gali deta hai; phir wo us ki maa ko gali deta hai, phir dusra us ki maa ko gali deta hai."
"326","Ja'far ibn 'Awn ne hamein khabar di, Abu Hayyan al-Taymi ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zur'ah ibn 'Amr ibn Jarir se, jinhon ne kaha: Teen aadmi Madinah mein Marwan ke paas baithe aur use ye bayan karte hue suna ke nishaniyon mein se sab se pehle zahir hone wali Dajjal hai. Wo jama'at Marwan ke paas se uth kar 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ke paas baithi aur unhein Marwan ki baat se aagah kiya. 'Abdullah ne kaha: Marwan ne kuch nahi kaha. Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate suna: Nishaniyon mein se sab se pehle zahir hone wali suraj ka maghrib se tulu hona hai, aur Dabbat al-Ard hai. In dono mein se jo bhi pehle hogi dusri fauran us ke ba'd aayegi. Phir unhon ne bayan karna shuru kiya: Jab suraj ghurub hota hai to 'Arsh ke niche aata hai, sajda karta hai, aur wapas lautne ki ijazat talab karta hai, aur use ijazat di jati hai. Jab Allah Ta'ala chahega ke wo maghrib se tulu ho to wo 'Arsh ke niche aayega, sajda karega, aur wapas lautne ki ijazat chahega, aur use koi jawab nahi diya jayega. Aap ne farmaya: Phir wo wapas lautne ki ijazat talab karega, aur use koi jawab nahi diya jayega. Aap ne farmaya: Aur use malum ho jayega ke agar use ijazat mil jaye to wo mashriq tak nahi pahunch sakega. Wo kahega: Ai mere Rabb, mashriq kitna dur hai, aur logon ke liye kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yahan tak ke jab raat tauq ki tarah ho jayegi to wo 'Arsh ke niche aayega aur ijazat talab karega. Use kaha jayega: Apni jagah se tulu ho ja. Aap ne farmaya: 'Abdullah kitabein padha karte the. Aap ne farmaya: To unhon ne ye tilawat ki: Jis din tumhare Rabb ki kuch nishaniyan aa jayengi to kisi jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega jo pehle iman nahi layi ya apne iman mein koi neki nahi kamai."
"327","Qabisah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad se, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mata' hai, aur duniya ki behtareen mata' nek biwi hai. Aur koi dua is dua se zyada jaldi qubul nahi hoti jo ghair hazir ke liye ghair hazir ki dua ho."
"328","Ja'far ibn 'Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se jinhon ne farmaya: 'Auraton se un ke husn ki wajah se nikah na karo, ho sakta hai un ka husn unhein halak kar de, aur na un ke maal ki wajah se un se nikah karo, ho sakta hai un ka maal unhein sarkash bana de. Un se deen ki bunyad par nikah karo; deendar siyah kaniz jise naak chhidi hui ho behtar hai."
"329","Ja'far ibn 'Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke raste mein sardard mein mubtala ho phir sawab ki niyyat rakhe to Allah Ta'ala us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh deta hai."
"330","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dushman se samna hone ki tamanna na karo, aur Allah se 'afiyat mango. Jab un se samna ho jaye to sabit qadam raho aur Allah Ta'ala ko kasrat se yaad karo. Agar wo chillayen aur shor machayen to tum par khamoshi lazim hai."
"331","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se jaldi qubul hone wali dua ghair hazir ki ghair hazir ke liye dua hai."
"332","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi se muhabbat kare aur kahe: Main tum se Allah Ta'ala ke liye muhabbat karta hun, aur dono jannat mein dakhil hon, aur ek dusre se buland darje par ho, to use us ke saath mila diya jayega."
"333","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr ke ba'd do rak'aton ke siwa koi namaz nahi."
"334","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum kise shaheed shumar karte ho? Logon ne kaha: Jo Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jaye. Aap ne farmaya: Tab to meri ummat ke shuhada bahut thode hain. Jo Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jaye wo shaheed hai, jo Allah ke raste mein dub kar mare wo shaheed hai, aur jo ta'un se mare wo shaheed hai."
"335","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, ek aadmi se, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqa bahmi rishton mein sulah karana hai."
"336","'Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad ibn An'um al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Musalman kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki zaban aur haath se Musalman mahfuz rahen. Us ne kaha: Mumin kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis par log apne amwal aur jaanon ke baare mein bharosa karen. Us ne kaha: Muhajir kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo buraiyon ko chhod de. Us ne kaha: Mujahid kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne nafs se Allah Ta'ala ke liye jihad kare."
"337","'Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad ibn An'um ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhe majlisen hain: Musalman in mein se kisi mein bhi ho to Allah Ta'ala us ka zamin hai: Allah ke raste mein, ya jama'at ki masjid mein, ya kisi bimar ke paas, ya janaze ke peeche, ya apne ghar mein, ya kisi 'adil hakim ke paas jis ki wo Allah Ta'ala ke liye himayat aur izzat kare."
"338","'Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Hum un ke paas baithe hue the, aur unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhein wo kalimaat na sikhaun jo Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam sikhaya karte the, jo wo us waqt kehte the jab sone ka irada karte the? Main ne kaha: Ji haan. To unhon ne hamare liye ek sahifa nikala, aur us mein tha: Ai Allah, aasmanon aur zameen ke paida karne wale, ghaib aur hazir ke janne wale, Tu har cheez ka Rabb aur us ka Malik hai. Main gawahi deta hun ke Tere siwa koi ma'bud nahi, Tu akela hai, Tera koi shareek nahi, aur ye ke Muhammad Tere bande aur Tere rasul hain, aur farishte gawah hain. Ai Allah, main Tujh se shaitan aur us ke shirk se panah mangta hun, aur Tujh se panah mangta hun ke main apni jaan par koi bura kaam karun ya use kisi Musalman par laaun."
"339","'Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad ne bayan kiya, 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qiyamat ke din ek aadmi ko laya jayega, phir mizan laya jayega, phir ninaanwe daftar laye jayenge, har daftar hadd e nazar tak hoga, us ke aib aur gunah us mein honge, aur mizan ke ek palde mein rakhe jayenge. Phir us ke liye ek waraq nikala jayega — aur Aap ne apne anguthe ko apni ungli ke aadhe hisse par rakha — us mein ye dua hai, gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi aur ye ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur rasul hain — aur dusre palde mein rakha jayega, aur wo us ke aibon aur gunahon par bhari ho jayega."
"340","'Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne bayan kiya, Rabi'ah ibn Sayf al-Ma'afiri ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu 'Abd al-Rahman 'Abdullah ibn Yazid se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr se, jinhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se pucha: Ek kafir ka janaza hamare paas se guzarta hai, kya hum us ke liye khade hon? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, us ke liye khade ho, kyunki tum us ke liye khade nahi hote; tum sirf us Zaat ke ehtiram mein khade hote ho jo ruhon ko qabz karti hai."
"341","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne bayan kiya, Shurahbil ibn Sharik ne bayan kiya, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, Abdullah ibn Amr se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Falah paya woh jo farmabardar hua, use baqadr-e-kifayat diya gaya, aur Allah ne use jo ata kiya us par use qana'at bakhshi."
"342","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Haywah ibn Shurayh ne bayan kiya, Shurahbil ibn Sharik se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek behtareen saathi woh hai jo apne saathi ke haq me sab se behtar ho, aur Allah ke nazdeek behtareen padosi woh hai jo apne padosi ke haq me sab se behtar ho."
"343","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Haywah ibn Shurayh aur Ibn Lahi'ah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hani al-Khawlani se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte suna: Maine Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Allah ne taqdeeren aasmanon aur zameen ki takhleeq se pachaas hazaar saal pehle likh deen."
"344","Ya'mar ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Rishdin ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Huayy ibn Abdullah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi mareez ki iyadat kare to kahe: Ae Allah, Apne bande ko shifa ata farma, taake woh Teri khatir dushman ko zakhmi kare ya Teri khatir namaz ki taraf chale."
"345","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Lahi'ah ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: Jo khamosh raha woh nijat paya."
"346","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid al-Himmani ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Ayyub se, kehte hue: Abdullah ibn Junadah al-Ma'afiri ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli ne un se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Duniya momin ka qaid khana hai; jab woh duniya se nikalta hai to qaid se nikal jata hai."
"347","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Ayyub se, Bakr ibn Amr se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad se, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Momin ka tohfa maut hai."
"348","Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Haywah ibn Shurayh ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hani al-Khawlani ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Maine Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli ko kehte suna: Maine Abdullah ibn Amr ko kehte suna: Maine Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Bani Adam ke dil sab ke sab Rahman tabarak wa ta'ala ki ungliyon me se do ungliyon ke darmiyan ek dil ki tarah hain; Woh use jaisa chahta hai pherta hai. Phir Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae dilon ko pherne wale, hamare dilon ko Apni ita'at ki taraf pher de."
"349","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Imran ibn Abdullah se, Abdullah ibn Amr se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Teen muamlat hain: jo un ke liye qarz le phir ada kiye baghair mar jaye to Allah azza wa jalla us ki taraf se ada farmayega: ek woh mard jo Allah ke raste me ho aur us ki quwwat kamzor pad jaye, pas woh dushman ke muqable me qarz se quwwat hasil kare, phir ada kiye baghair mar jaye; ek woh mard jis ke paas koi Musalman faut ho aur us ke paas use kafan dene ke liye kuch na ho aur na dafn karne ke liye kuch ho magar qarz ke zariye, phir ada kiye baghair mar jaye; aur ek woh mard jo apne nafs par fitne se dare pas qarz le kar aurat se nikah ke zariye apni ismat mehfooz kare, phir ada kiye baghair mar jaye; Allah azza wa jalla Qiyamat ke din un ki taraf se ada farmayega."
"350","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Rafi' se, Abdullah ibn Amr se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye ajamiyon ki sarzameen fatah hogi, aur tum wahan aise ghar paoge jinhen hammam kaha jata hai; mard un me tehband ke baghair dakhil na hon, aur aurton ko un me dakhil hone se roko magar jo beemar ho ya nifas wali ho."
"351","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hudayj ibn Sufi al-Himyari ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Ghaflat teen cheezon me hai: Allah azza wa jalla ke zikr se ghaflat; fajr ki namaz se lekar suraj tuloo hone tak ghaflat; aur aadmi ka qarz ke bare me apne aap se ghaflat baranna yahan tak ke woh us par sawar ho jaye."
"352","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'ruf ibn Suwayd al-Judhami ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Ushshanah al-Ma'afiri se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jalla ki makhlooq me Jannat me dakhil hone wala sab se pehla kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ka Rasool behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jalla ki makhlooq me Jannat me sab se pehle dakhil hone wale gharib Muhajireen hain, jin ke zariye sarhadon ki hifazat ki jati hai aur jin ke zariye sakhtiyan door ki jati hain; un me se ek apni hajat apne seene me liye marta hai, use pura karne ki istita'at na rakhte hue. Pas Allah azza wa jalla Apne farishton me se jis se chahega farmayega: Un ke paas jao aur unhen salam karo. Farishte kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, hum Tere aasman ke rehne wale aur Teri makhlooq me sab se behtar hain, phir bhi Tu humen hukm deta hai ke hum in ke paas jayen aur unhen salam karen? Woh farmayega: Ye Mere bande the jo Meri ibadat karte the aur Mere sath kuch shareek na karte the; un ke zariye sarhadon ki hifazat ki jati thi aur un ke zariye sakhtiyan door ki jati thin; un me se ek apni hajat apne seene me liye marta tha, use pura karne ki istita'at na rakhte hue. Pas farishte us waqt un ke paas aayenge, har darwaze se un par dakhil honge: Tum par salam ho us sabr ke badle jo tum ne kiya; pas aakhri ghar kya hi khoob hai."
"353","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ka'b ibn Alqamah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Isa ibn Hilal al-Sadafi se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne ek din namaz ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Jo us ki hifazat kare to woh Qiyamat ke din us ke liye noor, daleel aur aag se nijat hogi; aur jo us ki hifazat na kare to woh us ke liye na noor hogi, na daleel, na nijat, aur Qiyamat ke din woh Qarun, Fir'awn, Haman aur Ubayy ibn Khalaf ke sath hoga."
"354","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ka'b ibn Alqamah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Jubayr se, Abdullah ibn Amr se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum muazzin ko suno to wahi kaho jo woh kehta hai, aur mujh par durood bhejo, kyunke jo mujh par durood bhejta hai Allah us ke badle us par das martaba rehmat bhejta hai. Aur mere liye Allah se al-Wasilah mango, kyunke al-Wasilah Jannat me ek martaba hai jo Allah azza wa jalla ke bandon me se ek bande ke siwa kisi ke layaq nahin; ummeed hai ke woh main hun. Jo mere liye us ka sawal kare us ke liye meri shafa'at wajib ho jayegi."
"355","Husayn al-Ju'fi ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'idah se, Ata ibn al-Sa'ib se, un ke walid se, Abdullah ibn Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke unhon ne farmaya: Rahman ki ibadat karo, khana khilao, aur salam phailao; tum Jannat me dakhil hoge."
"356","Abd al-Razzaq ne humen khabar di, Ma'mar ne humen khabar di, Ata ibn al-Sa'ib se, un ke walid se, Abdullah ibn Amr se ke unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Do khaslaten hain jin ki jo hifazat karega Jannat me dakhil hoga: jo har namaz ke baad das martaba Subhan Allah kahe, das martaba Allahu Akbar kahe, aur das martaba Alhamdulillah kahe, to ye zaban par ek sau pachaas aur meezan me ek hazaar paanch sau hain. Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se kaun apne din aur raat me ek hazaar paanch sau bura'iyon ka irtikab karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aur maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko unhen apni ungliyon se ginte dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya wajah hai ke hum unhen shumar nahin rakhte? Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se ek ki namaz ke waqt shaitan us ke paas aata hai aur use us ki hajaten yaad dilata hai, us se kehta hai: Falan falan hajat yaad karo, yahan tak ke woh baghair yaad kiye nikal jata hai; aur us ke sone ke waqt us ke paas aata hai aur use baghair yaad kiye sula deta hai."
"357","Ja'far ibn Awn ne humen khabar di, Ayman ibn Nabil ne humen khabar di, Qudamah ibn Abdullah al-Amiri se ke unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Yaum al-Nahr ke din jamrah ko kankariyan marte dekha, halanke Aap surkh-mayel untni par sawar the, na maar peet thi, na dhutkar thi, aur na hatte hatte ki pukaren thin."
"358","Hajjaj ibn al-Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr se, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim se, Alqamah ibn Waqqas se, Bilal ibn al-Harith se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aadmi Allah ke ghazab ki koi baat keh deta hai, use andaza nahin hota ke woh kahan tak pahunchegi, aur Allah azza wa jalla us ke liye us par Apna ghazab likh deta hai us din tak jab woh Us se milega; aur aadmi Allah ki raza ki koi baat keh deta hai, use andaza nahin hota ke woh kahan tak pahunchegi, aur Allah azza wa jalla us ke liye us par Apni raza likh deta hai us din tak jab woh Us se milega."
"359","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Ibn Abi Layla se, Bilal se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam dua farmate the: Ae dilon ko pherne wale, mere dil ko Apne deen par sabit rakh."
"360","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Ka'bah me dakhil hue, aur Bilal un ke sath dakhil hue. Maine Bilal se kaha: Tum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko kahan namaz padhte dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Baitullah ke agle hisse me, un ke aur deewar ke darmiyan teen hath ka fasla tha."
"361","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaibah ne bayan kiya, hamein Husain ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, al-Hafs nam ke ek shaikh se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hayat mein azan di, phir unhon ne Abu Bakr ke liye un ki hayat mein azan di, lekin Umar ke daur mein azan nahi di. Umar ne un se kaha: Tumhein azan dene se kya cheez rok rahi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye azan di yahan tak ke woh wafat pa gaye, aur Abu Bakr ke liye azan di yahan tak ke woh wafat pa gaye, kyunke woh mere mohsin the; aur main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Ae Bilal, tumhare is amal se behtar koi amal nahi siwaye Allah azza wa jalla ki raah mein jihad karne ke. Pas woh Shaam ki taraf nikal gaye aur wahan jihad kiya."
"362","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun aur Hibban ibn Hilal ne khabar di, hamein Amir ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, Ayyub ibn Musa se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi baap ne apne bete ko husn-e-akhlaq se behtar koi atiya nahi diya."
"363","Hamein Ja'far ibn Aun ne bayan kiya, hamein Mis'ar ne bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murrah se, Abu Burdah se, al-Agharr se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha, yani Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne: Apne Rabb ki taraf tauba karo, pas Allah ki qasam, main apne Rabb azza wa jalla ki taraf rozana sau martaba ruju karta hun."
"364","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Sabit al-Bunani se, Abu Burdah se, al-Agharr se, Muzaynah ke al-Agharr se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere dil par har roz ghubaar sa chha jata hai, is liye main sau martaba Allah se maghfirat talab karta hun."
"365","Mujhe Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, kehte hue: Salamah ibn Nubait ne zikr kiya, Nu'aim ibn Abi Hind se, Nubait ibn Sharit se, Salim ibn Ubaid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bimar hue aur behosh ho gaye, phir hosh mein aaye aur farmaya: Kya namaz ka waqt ho gaya hai? Hum ne kaha: Ji han. Farmaya: Bilal ko hukm do ke azan de aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhaye. Phir woh behosh ho gaye aur hosh mein aaye aur farmaya: Kya namaz ka waqt ho gaya hai? Hum ne kaha: Ji han. Farmaya: Bilal ko hukm do ke azan de aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhaye. Phir woh behosh ho gaye, aur Aishah ne kaha: Mere walid narm dil aadmi hain, pas kisi aur ko hukm de dijiye. Phir woh hosh mein aaye aur farmaya: Kya namaz khadi ho gayi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Farmaya: Bilal ko hukm do ke iqamat kahe aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhaye. Aishah ne kaha: Mere walid narm dil aadmi hain; kaash aap kisi aur ko hukm de dete. Farmaya: Tum Yusuf ke sathiyon ki tarah ho; Bilal ko hukm do ke azan de aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhaye. Pas Bilal ne azan di aur Abu Bakr aage badhe. Phir Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hosh aaya aur farmaya: Mere liye koi sahara dhundo jis par tek lagaun. Pas woh Barirah aur ek aur aadmi ka sahara le kar nikle hatta ke Abu Bakr ke pehlu mein baithe; Abu Bakr peeche hatna chahe, lekin Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein rok diya, aur Abu Bakr ne logon ko namaz padhayi. Jab Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wafat pa gaye, Umar ne kaha: Main jis kisi ko kehte sununga ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wafat pa gaye hain to use apni talwar se marunga. Salim ibn Ubaid ne kaha: Phir unhon ne mujhe bheja, kehte hue: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sathi ke paas jao aur unhein bula lao. Pas main Abu Bakr ke paas aaya jabke woh masjid mein the, ghabrahat ki halat mein, aur Abu Bakr ne mujh se kaha: Shayad Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wafat pa gaye hain? Main ne kaha: Umar keh rahe hain: Main jis kisi ko kehte sununga ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wafat pa gaye hain to use apni talwar se marunga. Abu Bakr radiyallahu anhu khade hue, mera bazu pakda, aur main un ke sath aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Mere liye rasta kholo. Pas logon ne un ke liye rasta khol diya. Unhon ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par jhuk kar unhein chhua, apne hathon, ya apna hath, rakha aur kaha: Aap bhi marne wale hain aur ye bhi marne wale hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasul Allah ke sathi, kya Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wafat pa gaye hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Pas unhein yaqeen ho gaya ke jaisa unhon ne kaha waisa hi hai; woh ummi qaum the jin mein un se pehle koi nabi nahi aaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasul Allah ke sathi, kya hum un par namaz-e-janazah padhenge? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Unhon ne kaha: Hum un par kaise namaz padhenge? Unhon ne kaha: Ek jamaat dakhil hogi, Allahu Akbar kahegi, namaz padhegi aur dua karegi, phir nikal jayegi; phir dusre dakhil honge, yahan tak ke sab pura kar len. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasul Allah ke sathi, kya unhein dafn kiya jayega? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Unhon ne kaha: Unhein kahan dafn kiya jayega? Unhon ne kaha: Us jagah jahan un ki ruh qabz ki gayi, kyunke un ki ruh sirf pakizah jagah par qabz ki gayi hai. Pas unhein yaqeen ho gaya ke jaisa unhon ne kaha waisa hi hai. Phir woh bahar nikle aur logon ko hukm diya ke un ke walid ke bete unhein ghusl dein. Phir woh bahar nikle aur Muhajirin mashwara ke liye jama hue. Unhon ne kaha: Ansar ka bhi is mamle mein hissa hai. Pas woh un ke paas gaye, aur un mein se ek ne kaha: Hum mein se ek amir ho aur tum mein se ek amir, yani Muhajirin mein se. Umar khade hue aur un se kaha: Kaun hai jis ke paas Abu Bakr jaisi teen cheezen hon? Ghaar mein do mein se dusra, woh kaun hain jab woh apne sathi se kehta hai: Gham na karo, Allah hamare sath hai? Woh kaun hain, jin ke sath Allah azza wa jalla tha? Phir unhon ne Abu Bakr ka hath pakda aur un ki bai'at ki, aur logon ne bai'at ki; ye achhi aur umdah bai'at thi."
"366","Hamein Abdullah ibn Yazid ne khabar di, hamein Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Bukair ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj se, Sulaiman ibn Yasar se, Abdur Rahman ibn Jabir se, Abu Burdah ibn Niyar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi das kode se zyada na mare siwaye Allah azza wa jalla ki had mein."
"367","Mujhe Zakariyya ibn Adi ne khabar di, hamein Ubaidullah ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, Zaid ibn Abi Unaisah se, us shakhs se jis ne unhein khabar di, Abu Kathir se jo Muhammad ibn Jahsh ke maula hain, Muhammad ibn Jahsh se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madinah mein chal rahe the jab un ka guzar Banu Adi ke Ma'mar nam ke ek aadmi par hua to unhon ne us se kaha: Apni ranein dhak lo, kyunke ye satr mein se hain. Phir woh baithe aur hum baithe. Unhon ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya, phir apna hath apni peshani par rakha aur farmaya: SubhanAllah, kya sakhti nazil ki gayi hai! Hum un se sawal karne mein mar'ub ho gaye. Agle din hum ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kal aap ne kaha tha: Kya sakhti nazil ki gayi hai, aur hum aap se puchhne mein mar'ub ho gaye the; woh kya hai? Farmaya: Agar koi aadmi Allah ki raah mein qatl kiya jaye, phir zinda kiya jaye, phir qatl kiya jaye, phir zinda kiya jaye, phir qatl kiya jaye, phir zinda kiya jaye, jabke us par qarz ho, to woh Jannat mein dakhil na hoga hatta ke us ka qarz ada kar diya jaye."
"368","Hamein Ya'la ibn Ubaid ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Ajlah ne bayan kiya, al-Hakam ibn Utaibah se, Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Laila se, Ka'b ibn Ujrah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye ayat nazil hui: Beshak Allah aur us ke farishte Nabi par darud bhejte hain; ae iman walo, un par darud aur salam bhejo, to main un ki khidmat mein khada hua aur kaha: Salam karna to hum jante hain, lekin hum aap par darud kaise bhejen, ae Allah ke Rasul? Farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par rehmat nazil farma jaisa Tu ne Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par rehmat nazil farmayi; beshak Tu Qabil-e-tareef, Buzurgi wala hai. Aur Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par barkat nazil farma jaisa Tu ne Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par barkat nazil farmayi; beshak Tu Qabil-e-tareef, Buzurgi wala hai."
"369","Hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Amr al-Aqadi ne bayan kiya, hamein Dawud ibn Qais ne bayan kiya, Sa'd ibn Ishaq se, Abu Thumamah al-Hannat se: ke Ka'b ibn Ujrah un se mile jabke woh masjid ki taraf ja rahe the, ek dusre se mulaqat karte hue; unhon ne mujhe ek hath ki ungliyan dusre hath mein dalte hue paya, to unhon ne mere hathon ko juda kar diya aur mujhe is se mana kiya, kehte hue: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare aur achhi tarah wuzu kare, phir masjid ki taraf nikal khada ho, to apni ungliyon ko ek dusre mein na dale, kyunke woh namaz mein hai."
"370","Hamein Abu Nu'aim ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, al-Sha'bi se, Asim al-Aqadi se, Ka'b ibn Ujrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamare paas tashreef laye jabke hum chamde ke gadday par baithe the aur farmaya: Mere baad hukmaran honge; jo shakhs un ke paas jaye, un ke jhoot ki tasdiq kare aur un ke zulm mein un ki madad kare, woh mujh se nahi aur main us se nahi, aur woh hauz par mere paas nahi aayega; aur jo shakhs un ke jhoot ki tasdiq na kare aur na un ke zulm mein un ki madad kare, woh mujh se hai aur main us se hun, aur woh hauz par mere paas aayega."
"371","Hamein Abu Nu'aim ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdur Rahman ibn al-Nu'man ne bayan kiya, mujhe Ishaq ibn Sa'd ibn Ka'b ibn Ujrah ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ka'b se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamare paas tashreef laye jabke hum masjid mein saat afrad the, hum mein se teen Arab aur hamare chaar maula, ya chaar Arab aur hamare teen maula. Woh apne ek hujre se nikal kar hamare paas aaye hatta ke hamare sath baith gaye aur farmaya: Tumhein yahan kis cheez ne bithaya hai? Hum ne kaha: Namaz ka intezar kar rahe hain. Unhon ne apni ungli se zameen ko thap-thapaya, phir kuch der sar jhukaye rakha, phir hamari taraf sar uthaya aur farmaya: Kya tum jante ho tumhare Rabb azza wa jalla ne kya farmaya hai? Hum ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasul behtar jante hain. Farmaya: Woh farmata hai: Jo shakhs namaz ko us ke waqt par padhe aur us ki hudud ki hifazat kare, us ke liye Mujh par ek ahad hai jis ke zariye Main use Jannat mein dakhil karunga; aur jo shakhs namaz ko us ke waqt par na padhe aur na us ki hudud ki hifazat kare, us ke liye Mujh par koi ahad nahi: agar chahunga to use Jahannam mein dakhil karunga, aur agar chahunga to use Jannat mein dakhil karunga."
"372","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, hamein Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko Shurahbil ibn al-Simt se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Murrah ibn Ka'b, ya Ka'b ibn Murrah ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Mudar ke khilaf dua ki, to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, Allah ne aap ko ata kiya hai aur aap ki dua qubul ki hai, lekin aap ki qaum halak ho gayi hai; Allah se un ke liye dua kijiye. Unhon ne mujh se munh pher liya, to main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, Allah ne aap ko ata kiya hai aur aap ki dua qubul ki hai, lekin aap ki qaum halak ho gayi hai; Allah se un ke liye barish ki dua kijiye. Farmaya: Ae Allah, hamein nijaat dene wali, pakizah, phal-dar, kasrat wali, gher lene wali, jald aane wali, der na karne wali, nafa dene wali, nuqsan na dene wali barish ata farma. Sirf ek Jumu'ah ya us ke qareeb guzra tha ke hum par barish ho gayi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur unhon ne Murrah ibn Ka'b, ya Ka'b se kaha: Hamein koi hadith bayan karo jo tum ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suni ho, tumhare walid Allah par qurban, aur hoshiyar rehna. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo bhi Musalman mard kisi Musalman ghulam ko azad kare, woh Jahannam se us ka fidya hoga, us ki haddi ke badle us ki har haddi; aur jo bhi Musalman mard do Musalman laundiyon ko azad kare, woh dono Jahannam se us ka fidya hongi, un dono ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddi; aur jo bhi Musalman aurat kisi Musalman aurat ko azad kare, woh Jahannam se us ka fidya hogi, us ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddi."
"373","Hamein Ja'far ibn Aun ne khabar di, hamein al-Mas'udi ne khabar di, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, Ibn Ka'b ibn Malik se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ki nazuk tehni ki tarah hai: hawa use jhukati hai, kabhi use gira deti hai aur kabhi sidha kar deti hai, yahan tak ke us ki ajal use aa pahunchti hai; aur kafir ki misaal apni jad par qayam mazbut deodar ki tarah hai, jise koi cheez nahi ukhadti yahan tak ke us ka katna ek hi bar aa jata hai."
"374","Hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne khabar di, hamein Ibrahim ibn Tahman ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Ibn Ka'b ibn Malik se, un ke walid se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein aur Aws ibn Hadathan ko Ayyam-e-Tashriq mein ye elan karne ke liye bheja ke Jannat mein momin ke siwa koi dakhil na hoga, aur ye khane peene ke din hain."
"375","Hamein Usman ibn Umar ne khabar di, hamein Yunus ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abdur Rahman ibn Ka'b ibn Malik se, ke Ka'b ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam safar par aksar Jumeraat ke din hi nikla karte the."
"376","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Ma'mar ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ibn Ka'b ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Umm Mubashshir ne Ka'b ibn Malik se, jabke woh bimar thin, kaha: Mere bete ko salam pahunchana, yani Mubashshir ko. Unhon ne kaha: Allah tumhein maaf kare, ae Umm Mubashshir, kya tum ne nahi suna jo Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki ruh ek parindah hai jo Jannat ke darkhton mein khati peeti hai yahan tak ke Allah use Qayamat ke din us ke jism mein wapas lautayega? Unhon ne kaha: Mujh se bhool hui, pas main Allah se maghfirat talab karti hun."
"377","Hamein Usman ibn Umar ne khabar di, hamein Yunus ne bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Abdullah ibn Ka'b se, un ke walid se: ke unhon ne masjid mein Ibn Abi Hadrad se apne qarz ki wapsi ka mutalba kiya, aur un ki awazein buland ho gayin hatta ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein sun liya aur un ki taraf bahar tashreef laye. Farmaya: Ae Ka'b, apne qarz mein se itna kam kar do, unhein nisf ki taraf ishara karte hue. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne aisa kar diya. Farmaya: Utho aur ise ada karo."
"378","Mujhe Abd al-Rahim ibn Abdur Rahman al-Muharibi ne bayan kiya, hamein Za'idah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Umair ne bayan kiya, Rib'i ibn Hirash se, Abu al-Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs tangdast ko mohlat de ya us ka qarz maaf kar de, Allah azza wa jalla use apne saye mein us din saya dega jis din us ke saye ke siwa koi saya na hoga."
"379","Hamein Usman ibn Umar ne khabar di, hamein Shu'bah ne khabar di, Abu Ja'far se, Umarah ibn Khuzaimah se, Usman ibn Hunaif se: ke ek nabina aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Allah se dua kijiye ke mujhe shifa de. Farmaya: Agar tum chaho to main is mein takheer kar dun, aur ye tumhare sawab ke liye behtar hoga; aur agar tum chaho to main Allah se dua kar dun. Us ne kaha: Us se dua kijiye. Pas unhon ne use hukm diya ke wuzu kare, do rak'aten padhe, aur is dua se dua kare: Ae Allah, main Tujh se sawal karta hun aur Tere Nabi Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam, Nabi-e-rehmat, ke waseele se Teri taraf mutawajjeh hota hun; ae Muhammad, main ne aap ke waseele se apne Rabb ki taraf apni is hajat mein ruju kiya hai ke ye puri ho jaye; ae Allah, un ki sifarish mere haq mein qubul farma."
"380","Hamein Ubaidullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Sufyan se, al-Jurairi se, Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir se, Usman ibn Abi al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, shaitan mere aur meri namaz aur meri qira'at ke darmiyan ha'il ho gaya hai. Farmaya: Ye Khanzab nam ka shaitan hai; jab tum use mehsoos karo to us se Allah ki panah mango aur apne bayen taraf teen martaba thuko."
"381","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Jurayri se, Abu al-Ala se, Mutarrif se, Uthman ibn Abi al-As se: ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - se namaz mein waswason ki shikayat ki. Aap ne farmaya: Ye ek shaitan hai jise Khanzab kaha jata hai; jab tum us ki taraf se kuch mehsoos karo to apni bain janib teen martaba thuthkaro aur us se Allah ki panah mango."
"382","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Yahya ibn Bukayr ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Khusayfah se, Umar ibn Abdallah ibn Ka'b se, Nafi' ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im se, Uthman ibn Abi al-As al-Thaqafi se: ke unhon ne kaha: Main Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ke paas ek dard ke sath aaya jis ne mujhe taqreeban mazoor kar diya tha. Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ne mujh se farmaya: Apna dayan hath us par rakho, phir kaho: Allah ke naam se; main Allah ki izzat aur Us ki qudrat ki panah mangta hun us cheez ke shar se jo main mehsoos karta hun, saat martaba. Main ne aisa kiya, to Allah - Azeez o Jaleel hai Wo - ne mujhe shifa ata farmai."
"383","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdallah ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, Ja'dah ibn Hubayrah se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen meri nasal hai, phir wo jo un ke baad aayen, phir wo jo un ke baad aayen, phir wo jo un ke baad aayen; phir aakhri log badtareen hain."
"384","Zakariyya ibn Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne hum se bayan kiya, Layth se, Talhah se, apne walid se, apne dada se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ko wuzu karte dekha: Aap ne apna hath apne sar par rakha, phir use gaddi tak peeche kheench kar le gaye, phir use thhodi ke neeche se bahar nikala."
"385","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Jamil se, Nafi' ibn Abd al-Harith se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ne farmaya: Admi ki khushbakhti ka hissa kushada makan, nek hamsaya aur aramdeh sawari hai."
"386","Safwan ibn Isa ne humein khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Ubayd se, Salamah ibn al-Akwa' se: ke Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - maghrib ki namaz us waqt padhte jab suraj ghuroob ho jata, jab us ka upari kinara ghayab ho jata."
"387","Uthman ibn Umar ne humein khabar di, Umar ibn Rashid ne humein khabar di, Iyas ibn Salamah se, apne walid se: ke Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - apni dua ka aghaz is se farmate: Paak hai mera Rab, Nihayat Buland, Ata farmane Wala."
"388","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne humein khabar di, Ikrimah ibn Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, Iyas ibn Salamah ne humein khabar di, apne walid se: ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ko Ashja' ke Busr ibn Ra'i al-Ir naam ke ek admi se farmate suna, jabke wo apne bain hath se kha raha tha: Apne dayen hath se khao. Us ne kaha: Main nahi kha sakta. Aap ne farmaya: Tum kabhi na kha sako. Unhon ne kaha: Us ke baad us ka hath kabhi us ke munh tak na pahuncha."
"389","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, Shayban ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Salamah ibn Nu'aym se, jo Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ke Sahaba mein se the, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ne farmaya: Jo Allah - Buland hai Wo - se is haal mein mile ke wo Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho, wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga, agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur agarche us ne chori ki ho."
"390","Husayn al-Ju'fi ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'idah se, Mansur se, al-Musayyab se, Warrad se, jinhon ne kaha: al-Mughirah ne Mu'awiyah ko likha: ke Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - jab namaz se farigh hote to kehte: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo Tanha hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi; Usi ke liye badshahat hai aur Usi ke liye hamd hai, aur Wo har cheez par Qadir hai. Ae Allah, jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahi, jo Tu rok le use koi dene wala nahi, aur kisi daulat wale ki daulat use Tere muqable mein kuch faida nahi deti."
"391","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Warrad, jo al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah ke katib the, ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Mu'awiyah ne al-Mughirah ko likha: Mujhe Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ki hadith mein se kuch likh bhejo. To unhon ne use likha: Main ne Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ko teen cheezon se panah mangte suna: maaon ki nafarmani, betiyon ko zinda dafan karna, aur rokna aur talab karna; aur main ne Aap ko teen cheezon se mana karte suna: bekar baatein, maal zaya karna, aur kasrat se sawal karna. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap ko kehte suna: Ae Allah, jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahi, jo Tu faisla farma de use koi talne wala nahi, aur kisi daulat wale ki daulat use Tere muqable mein kuch faida nahi deti."
"392","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Awanah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Warrad se, jo al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah ke katib the, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se, jinhon ne kaha: Sa'd ibn Ubadah ne kaha: Agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi mard ko dekhun to use talwar se maarun baghair reayat kiye. Ye baat Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - tak pahunchi, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum Sa'd ki ghairat par tajjub karte ho? Allah ki qasam, main us se zyada ghairatmand hun, aur Allah - Azeez o Jaleel hai Wo - mujh se zyada ghairatmand hai; aur Allah ki ghairat ki wajah se Us ne behayai ke kaamon ko haram kiya, jo un mein se zahir hain aur jo posheeda hain. Allah - Azeez o Jaleel hai Wo - se zyada uzr ko pasand karne wala koi shakhs nahi; isi liye Us ne rasoolon ko khushkhabri dene wale aur darane wale bana kar bheja. Aur Allah - Azeez o Jaleel hai Wo - se zyada Apni tareef ko pasand karne wala koi shakhs nahi; isi liye Allah ne Jannat ka wada farmaya."
"393","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, al-Thawri ne humein khabar di, Mansur se, Mujahid se, Aqqar ibn al-Mughirah se, yani Ibn Shu'bah, apne walid se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ko farmate suna: Jo daghwa le ya jhad-phoonk karwaye us ne tawakkul se baraat ikhtiyar ki."
"394","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Ishaq se, al-Nu'man ibn Sa'd se, al-Mughirah se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ko farmate suna: Qayamat ke din Pul par Musalmanon ka naara ye hoga: Ae mere Rab, salamti ata farma; ae mere Rab, salamti ata farma."
"395","Abu Nu'aym ne humein khabar di, Jarir ibn Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Main ne Muhammad ibn Sirin se suna, Amr ibn Wahb al-Thaqafi ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Mughirah se, jinhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - qazae hajat farmate to door chale jate."
"396","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Abi Sulayman aur Asim ibn Bahdalah se, Abu Wa'il se, al-Mughirah se: ke Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - falan qabile ke koode ke dher par tashreef laye, apni taangein kholin, aur khade ho kar peshab farmaya."
"397","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Ma'mar aur Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abbad ibn Ziyad se, Urwah ibn al-Mughirah se, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se, jinhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ke sath ek safar mein the; jab Aap raste ke ek hisse par the to Aap alag hat gaye aur main pani ka bartan uthaye Aap ke sath alag hata. Aap ne qazae hajat farmai, phir mere paas aaye aur main ne Aap ke hathon par pani dala, fajr ki namaz ke waqt. Jab Aap ne apna chehra dhoya aur apne baazu dhona chahe to Aap ke jubbe ki aasteenain tang thin, aur Aap par ek Shami jubba tha, to Aap ne apne hath jubbe ke neeche se bahar nikale aur apne baazu dhoye, phir wuzu kiya aur apne mozon par masah kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum logon tak pahunche, aur Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf unhein ek rakat padha chuke the. Main unhein ittila dene gaya, lekin Unhon ne farmaya: Inhein chhod do. To Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ne un ke sath ek rakat namaz padhi, phir tashreef le gaye; Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - khade hue aur ek rakat padhi, aur log is par ghabra gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne durust kiya, ya farmaya: Tum ne acha kiya, un ki is baat par tareef farmate hue ke unhon ne namaz us ke waqt par padhi."
"398","al-Dahhak ibn Makhlad ne humein khabar di, Sufyan se, Abu Qays se, al-Hudhayl ibn Shurahbil se, al-Mughirah se: ke Allah ke Rasool - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ne apne mozon aur apne jooton par masah farmaya."
"399","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ko khade ho kar peshab farmate dekha, phir main ne Aap ke liye pani dala, aur Aap ne wuzu farmaya aur apne mozon par masah farmaya."
"400","Umar ibn Sa'd ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sufyan al-Thawri se, al-Jurayri se, Abu al-Salil se, Mujibah al-Bahili se, apne chacha se, jinhon ne kaha: Main Nabi - Allah ka darood aur salam ho un par - ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya Aap mujhe pehchante hain? Main wohi hun jo pichhle saal Aap ke paas aaya tha. Unhon ne apne achhe jism ka zikr kiya aur kaha: Jab se Aap se mila hun main ne din mein roza iftar nahi kiya, siwae raat ke. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhein apne aap ko azab dene ka kis ne hukm diya? Sabr ke mahine aur mahine mein ek din roza rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Main is se zyada taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Sabr ke mahine aur mahine mein do din roza rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Main is se zyada taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Sabr ke mahine aur mahine mein teen din roza rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Main is se zyada taqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Hurmat wale mahinon mein roza rakho aur iftar karo."
"401","Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hamen bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Hassan ne hamen bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Ziyad Ma'qil ibn Yasar ke paas ayadat ke liye dakhil hua jabke wo bimar the aur hum un ke paas the, aur Ibn Ziyad governor tha, us ne un se sawal kiya, to Ma'qil ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main tumhen ek hadith bayan karunga jo main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se suni hai, Allah ki qasam main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs bhi Allah ri'aya ka zimmedar banaye phir wo is hal mein mare ke jis din mara wo apni ri'aya ko dhoka de raha ho to Allah us par Jannat haram farma dega, us ne kaha: Tum ne ye hadith mujhe aaj se pehle kyun bayan nahi ki, unhon ne kaha: Agar main apni is halat ko na dekh raha hota to main tumhen ye bayan na karta."
"402","Rawh ibn Ubadah aur Sulayman ibn Harb ne hamen bayan kiya, kehte hain: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hamen bayan kiya, al-Mu'alla ibn Ziyad se, Mu'awiyah ibn Qurrah se, Ma'qil ibn Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitna o fasad ke zamane mein ibadat meri taraf hijrat karne ki tarah hai."
"403","Sa'id ibn al-Rabi' ne hamen bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Iyad se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ma'qil ko kehte hue suna: Un ke do padosiyon ke darmiyan hadd e zameen par jhagra hua to unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisi qasam khaye jis ke zariye wo apne bhai ka maal qata' kar le to wo Allah se is hal mein milega ke Allah us par ghazabnak hoga."
"404","Sulayman ibn Harb ne hamen bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamen bayan kiya, Asim ibn Bahdalah se, Habib ibn Abi Jubayrah se, Ya'la ibn al-Sayyabah se: ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ek qabr ke paas se guzre jis ka murda azab diya ja raha tha to aap ne farmaya: Is qabr wala kisi bari baat ki wajah se azab nahi diya ja raha, phir aap ne khajoor ki ek tehni mangwai, use us ki qabr par rakh diya aur farmaya: Shaayad jab tak ye tar rahegi us ke azab mein takhfeef rahe."
"405","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Ata ibn al-Sa'ib se, Abdallah ibn Hafs se, Ya'la ibn Murrah al-Thaqafi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki teen baaten dekhin: Hum aap ke saath safar mein the ke paani dhone wale ek oont ke paas se guzre, jab oont ne aap ko dekha to bilbilaya aur apna bojh neeche jhuka diya, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam us ke paas ruk gaye aur farmaya: Is oont ka malik kahan hai, wo aaya to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ise mere haath bech de, us ne kaha: Balke main ise aap ko hadiya deta hun, aap ne farmaya: Balke ise mere haath bech de, us ne kaha: Balke main ise aap ko hadiya deta hun, halanke ye ek aise gharane ka hai jis ke liye is ke siwa koi guzara nahi, aap ne farmaya: Jab tum ne is ki ye halat batayi hai to is ne zyada kaam aur kam chaare ki shikayat ki hai, pas is ke saath achha sulook karo, phir hum chale yahan tak ke ek manzil par utre, aur Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam so gaye, ek darakht zameen ko cheer kar aaya yahan tak ke us ne aap ko dhaanp liya phir apni jagah wapas laut gaya, jab Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam bedar hue to main ne aap ko ye bataya to aap ne farmaya: Ye ek darakht hai jis ne apne Rabb se Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko salam karne ki ijazat mangi to Allah ne use ijazat de di, phir hum chale aur ek paani ke maqam se guzre to ek aurat apne ek bachche ko le kar aap ke paas aayi jo junoon mein mubtala tha, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne use naak se pakda aur farmaya: Nikal ja, kyunke main Muhammad, Allah ka Rasool sallallahu alayhi wa sallam hun, phir hum chale, aur jab hum apne safar se wapas laute to usi paani ke maqam se guzre to wo aurat zibah ke liye ek oont aur doodh le kar aap ke paas aayi, aap ne use hukm diya ke zibah ka oont wapas le jaye aur apne Sahaba ko hukm diya to unhon ne doodh piya, aur aap ne us se bachche ke baare mein pucha to us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke saath bheja hai, jab se aap tashreef le gaye hain hum ne us mein koi takleef nahi dekhi."
"406","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne hamen bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Za'idah ne hamen bayan kiya, Abu Ya'fur se, Ayman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ya'la al-Thaqafi ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs baghair haq ke zameen le le use qayamat ke maidan mein us ki mitti uthane ka bojh diya jayega."
"407","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Husayn ibn Ali ne hamen bayan kiya, Za'idah se, al-Rabi' ibn Abdallah se, Ayman ibn Nabil se, Ya'la ibn Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs na-haq ek balisht zameen bhi le le to Allah use us ki khudai ka mukallaf karega yahan tak ke wo saat zameenon ki teh tak pahunch jaye, phir use us ki gardan mein tauq bana kar dal diya jayega yahan tak ke qayamat ke din logon ke darmiyan faisla kar diya jaye."
"408","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamen khabar di, Hariz ibn Uthman ne hamen khabar di, Abu al-Hasan al-Hawzani, Nimran ibn Mikhmar al-Rahabi ne hamen bayan kiya, Shurahbil ibn Aws al-Kindi se, jo Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke Sahaba mein se the, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs sharab piye use kode maro, phir agar dobara piye to use kode maro, phir agar dobara piye to use kode maro, phir agar chauthi martaba piye to use qatl kar do."
"409","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamen khabar di, Bahz ibn Hakim ne hamen khabar di, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Tum sattar ummaton ko mukammal karte ho, tum un mein sab se aakhiri ho aur Allah azza wa jalla ke nazdeek un mein sab se mu'azzaz ho."
"410","Ali ibn Asim ne hamen bayan kiya, al-Jurayri se, Hakim ibn Mu'awiyah al-Qushayri se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jannat mein paani ka ek samandar hai, doodh ka ek samandar hai, shahad ka ek samandar hai aur sharab ka ek samandar hai, phir us ke baad wahin se nahrein phoot kar nikalti hain."
"411","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamen bayan kiya, kehte hain: Main ne al-Jurayri ko Hakim ibn Mu'awiyah se, apne walid se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum sattar ummaton ko mukammal karte ho, tum un mein sab se behtar aur Allah azza wa jalla ke nazdeek sab se mu'azzaz ho, Jannat ke darwaze ke do paton ke darmiyan chalis saal ki musafat hai, aur us par ek din aisa aayega jab wo bheer ki wajah se bhara hua hoga."
"412","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamen bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, kehte hain: Jarad ne mujhe khabar di, Raja ibn Haywah se, Mu'awiyah se: ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah jis ke saath bhalai ka irada farmata hai use deen ki samajh ata farmata hai."
"413","Abu Usamah ne hamen khabar di, Habib ibn al-Shahid se, Abu Mijlaz, Lahiq ibn Humayd se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ek ghar mein dakhil hue jis mein Abdallah ibn Amir aur Abdallah ibn al-Zubayr the, Abdallah ibn Amir khade ho gaye aur Abdallah ibn al-Zubayr khade nahi hue, Mu'awiyah ne Abdallah ibn Amir se kaha: Baith jao, kyunke main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs ye chahe ke log us ke liye khade rahen to wo apna thikana Jahannam mein bana le."
"414","Yahya ibn Bishr ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Hakam ibn al-Mubarak ne hamen bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Muslim se, Ibn Jabir ne hamen khabar di, Abu Abd Rabbihi ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: A'mal bartan ki tarah hain, jab us ka upar ka hissa achha ho to neeche ka hissa bhi achha hota hai, aur jab us ka upar ka hissa kharab ho to neeche ka hissa bhi kharab hota hai."
"415","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hamen bayan kiya, Talhah ibn Yahya ne hamen bayan kiya, Abu Burdah se, Mu'awiyah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Momin ko us ke jism mein jo bhi takleef pahunchti hai jo use dukh deti hai to us ke zariye us ke kuch bure a'mal ka kaffara kar diya jata hai."
"416","Ya'la ne hamen bayan kiya, Uthman ibn Hakim ne hamen bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ka'b al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko khutba dete hue suna, kehte hain: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko in lakdiyon par farmate hue suna: Aye Allah, jo tu de use koi rokne wala nahi, aur jo tu roke use koi dene wala nahi, aur Allah jis ke saath bhalai ka irada farmata hai use deen ki samajh ata farmata hai."
"417","Uthman ne kaha: Aur Ziyad, jo al-Harith ka azad karda ghulam hai, ne mujh se is hadith ki tarah riwayat ki, is mein ye izafa karte hue: Aur daulatmand ki daulat tere muqable mein use kuch faida nahi deti."
"418","Ya'la ne hamen bayan kiya, Talhah ibn Yahya ne hamen bayan kiya, Isa ibn Talhah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Azan dene wale qayamat ke din logon mein sab se lambi gardan wale honge."
"419","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammam ibn Yahya ne hamen bayan kiya, Qatadah ne hamen bayan kiya, ke Abu Shaykh al-Huna'i ne kaha: Main Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke Sahaba ki ek jama'at mein Mu'awiyah ke saath tha, Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, kya tum jante ho ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne resham pehenne se mana farmaya tha, unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah, haan, aur main gawahi deta hun, unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, kya tum jante ho ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne chandi ke bartanon mein peene se mana farmaya tha, unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah, haan, aur main gawahi deta hun, unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, kya tum jante ho ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne cheeton ki dhabbedar khalon par sawar hone se mana farmaya tha, unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah, haan, aur main gawahi deta hun, unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, kya tum jante ho ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Hajj aur Umrah ko ek saath jama karne se mana farmaya tha, unhon ne kaha: Is ke baare mein to nahi, unhon ne kaha: Beshak ye bhi unhin mein se hai."
"420","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ibn Uyaynah ne hamen khabar di, Amr ibn Dinar se, kehte hain: Ibn Munabbih ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne bhai se, ke unhon ne Mu'awiyah ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se israar kar ke sawal na karo, Allah ki qasam, jo bhi mujh se israar kar ke mangta hai aur main use de deta hun to jo main ne use diya wo us ke liye ba-barkat nahi hota."
"421","Sulaiman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, jinhon ne kaha: main ne Amir al-Bajali ko Jarir ibn Abdallah se riwayat karte hue suna, jinhon ne kaha: main ne Mu'awiyah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) tainsath baras ki umar me wafat pa gaye; Abu Bakr tainsath baras ki umar me wafat pa gaye; Umar tainsath baras ki umar me wafat pa gaye; aur main tainsath baras ka hun."
"422","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Umar se, Rafi' ibn Khadij se, jinhon ne kaha: main ne Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko farmate hue suna: Fajr ki namaz ujale me ada karo, kyunke is me sawab zyada hai."
"423","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Asim ibn Umar se, Rafi' se, jinhon ne kaha: main ne Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko farmate hue suna: Allah ke liye sachchai ke sath sadaqe par kaam karne wala us mujahid ki manind hai jo Allah ke raste me ladta hai yahan tak ke woh apne ghar walon ki taraf lot aaye."
"424","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Masruq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abayah ibn Rifa'ah ibn Rafi' ibn Khadij se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, jinhon ne kaha: main ne Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko farmate hue suna: Bukhar Jahannam ki bhaap me se hai, pas ise pani se thanda karo."
"425","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, Abayah ibn Rifa'ah se, un ke dada Rafi' ibn Khadij se, jinhon ne kaha: Jibrail, ya ek farishta, Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke paas aaya aur kaha: tum apne un logon ko kya shumar karte ho jinhon ne Badr me haziri di? Unhon ne kaha: apne behtareen log. Us ne kaha: isi tarah woh hamare nazdeek bhi farishton me behtareen hain."
"426","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Mus'ab ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awza'i se, Abu al-Najashi se, Rafi' ibn Khadij se, jinhon ne kaha: hum Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke sath namaz padhte the, phir zibah ka oont zibah kiya jata, das hisson me taqseem kiya jata, phir pakaya jata, phir hum maghrib ki namaz se pehle achchi tarah paka hua gosht khate the."
"427","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, al-Awza'i ne hamein khabar di, Abu al-Najashi ne hamein khabar di, Rafi' ibn Khadij ne mujh se bayan kiya, jinhon ne kaha: hum Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke zamane me maghrib ki namaz padhte the, aur hum me se koi nikalta to ab bhi apne teeron ke girne ki jaghon ko dekh sakta tha."
"428","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: main ne apne walid ko hum se bayan karte hue suna, kehte hue: main ne Layla, Bashir ibn al-Khasasiyyah ki ahliya, ko kehte hue suna, aur Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne un ka naam Bashir rakha tha jabke is se pehle un ka naam Zahm tha, ke: mujhe Bashir ne khabar di ke unhon ne Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) se sawal kiya, kehte hue: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya main Jumu'ah ke din roza rakhun aur us din kisi se baat na karun? Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Jumu'ah ke din roza na rakho magar un dino me jin me woh bhi ek ho, ya mahine me; rahi baat na karna, meri jaan ki qasam, tumhara neki ka hukm dete aur burai se rokte hue guftagu karna is se behtar hai ke tum khamosh raho."
"429","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Iyad ne mujh se bayan kiya, Layla se, Bashir ki ahliya se, jinhon ne kaha: main ne do din paiwast roza rakhna chaha, to Bashir ne mujhe roka, kehte hue: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne is se mana farmaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Nasara aisa karte hain; balke wese roza rakho jese Allah ne tumhein hukm diya hai, aur raat tak roza pura karo, aur jab raat aa jaye to iftar karo."
"430","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdallah ibn al-Ayzar ne hamein khabar di, ahl-e-Sham me se ek shakhs se: ke Umar ne Bishr ibn Asim ko aamil muqarrar karna chaha, to unhon ne kaha: main aap ke liye kaam nahin karunga. Unhon ne kaha: kyun? Unhon ne kaha: main ne Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko farmate hue suna: hukmaran ko laya jayega aur Pul par khada kiya jayega; woh us ke sath hilega yahan tak ke us ka har jod apni jagah se hat jayega. Agar woh adil hua to guzar jayega; agar zalim hua to sattar khizan tak Aag me girta rahega. Pas Umar masjid me badle hue rang ke sath dakhil hue, aur Abu Dharr ne un se kaha: aap ko kya hua hai, Ae Ameer al-Mu'minin? Unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Asim ne mujhe ek hadith bayan ki hai. Unhon ne kaha: aur woh kya hai? To unhon ne unhein woh bayan ki, aur Abu Dharr ne kaha: haan, main ne Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko ise farmate hue suna hai. Umar ne kaha: aur is ke baad kaun ohde ki khwahish karega? Abu Dharr ne kaha: woh jis ki naak Allah ne khak aalud ki aur jis ka rukhsar Us ne past kiya."
"431","Sulaiman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Hilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdallah ibn Sawadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, jo Banu Abdallah ibn Ka'b me se ek shakhs the, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke sawar hum par hamla awar hue aur hamare ek hamsaye ke oont le gaye. Main Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khana khate hue paya. Aap ne farmaya: aao aur khao. Main ne kaha: main roze se hun. Aap ne farmaya: aao, main tumhein is ke bare me bataun: Allah, jo aziz o jaleel hai, ne musafir se aadhi namaz aur roza utha liya hai, aur hamila aur doodh pilane wali aurat se bhi. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne ye dono baatein farmayin, ya in me se ek. Woh kehte the: kash main ne Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke khane me se khaya hota."
"432","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ya'la ibn Ata se, Umarah ibn Hadid al-Bajali se, Sakhr al-Ghamidi se riwayat karte hue, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri ummat ke liye un ki subhon me barkat de. Unhon ne kaha: jab Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) koi dasta bhejte to use din ke aaghaz me bhejte. Sakhr tajir the, aur jab woh apne ladkon ko bhejte to unhein din ke aaghaz me bhejte. Un ka maal badh gaya yahan tak ke woh na jante the ke ise kahan rakhein."
"433","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Qurrah ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Dirghamah ibn Ulaybah ibn Harmalah se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, jinhon ne kaha: main Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke paas aaya aur Aap ke sath fajr ki namaz padhi. Jab Aap namaz se farigh hue, main ne logon ke chehron ko dekha; namaz se farigh hone ke baad un ke chehre mushkil se pehchane jate the. Jab main rawana hone laga, main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mujhe naseehat kijiye. Aap ne farmaya: tum par Allah ka taqwa lazim hai, jo aziz o jaleel hai; jab tum logon me se utho aur unhein tumhare liye woh kehte suno jo tumhein pasand aaye to use karo, aur jo tum un se apne liye na-pasandida baat kehte suno to use chhor do. Unhon ne kaha: mere walid Ulaybah apne walid Harmalah ke sath nek suluk karne wale the. Main ne kaha: aur un ka un ke sath nek suluk kya tha? Unhon ne kaha: jab khana qareeb laya jata to woh sab se bhari, laziz haddi talash karte aur use unhein dete; aur jab safar karte to sab se narm, umda oont talash karte aur unhein us par sawar karte. Ye un ka un ke sath nek suluk tha."
"434","Amr ibn Awn ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sayyar Abu al-Hakam se, Khalid ibn Abdallah al-Qasri se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se: ke Nabi (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne un se farmaya: Ae Yazid ibn Asad, logon ke liye wohi pasand karo jo apne liye pasand karte ho."
"435","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hatim ibn Isma'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Imran al-Qasir se, jinhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Sulayman ne mujhe khabar di, Yazid ibn Na'amah al-Dabbi se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: jab koi shakhs kisi shakhs se dosti kare to use us ka naam, us ke walid ka naam, aur woh kin me se hai, puchna chahiye, kyunke ye mohabbat ka mazboot tar zariya hai."
"436","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Masruq se, Sa'id ibn Ashwa' se, Yazid ibn Salamah se: ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, main ne Aap se bohat si ahadith suni hain, aur mujhe darr hai ke us ka pehla hissa mujhe aakhri hissa bhula dega; mujhe koi aisa kalima bayan kijiye jo jami' ho. Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: jitna tum jante ho us me Allah se daro."
"437","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, Abdallah ibn al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: tum me se koi apne sathi ka maal na le, na sanjeedagi me na mazaq me; aur jab tum me se koi apne sathi ki lathi paye to use usay wapas kar de."
"438","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn al-Sa'ib se, Hakim ibn Abi Yazid se, un ke walid se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rehmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: logon ko chhor do, taake un me se baaz baaz se faida uthayen; jab koi shakhs kisi shakhs se mashwara talab kare to use khair-khwahi ke sath mashwara de."
"439","Musa ibn Mas'ud ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Sa'ib al-Ta'ifi ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid al-Sa'ib ibn Yasar ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hue: main ne Yazid ibn Amir al-Suwa'i ko suna, jinhon ne mushrikon ke sath Hunayn me haziri di thi phir Islam qabool kiya; hum un se us rob ke bare me puchte the jo Allah, jo aziz o jaleel hai, ne Hunayn ke din mushrikon ke dilon me dala tha, ke woh kaisa tha. Unhon ne kaha: woh hamare liye ek kankari lete aur use tasht par phenkte, to woh khankhanati. Hum apne peton me usi jaisi kuch kaifiat pate the."
"440","Musa ibn Mas'ud ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Sa'ib ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sa'ib ibn Yasar se, Yazid ibn Amir se, jinhon ne kaha: ek shikast me jis me Musalman Hunayn ke din shikast kha gaye, kafir un ke peeche lage. Allah ke Rasool ne mitti ki ek mutthi li, phir use lekar mushrikon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur use un ke chehron par phenk diya, farmate hue: palto; chehre bigad jayen. Jo bhi apne bhai se milta woh kankar ki shikayat karta ya apni aankhein malta tha."
"441","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Mujahid se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke Yazid ibn Shajarah apne sathiyon ke darmiyan khade hue aur kaha: Tum par subah aur sham aa chuki hai, hare, surkh aur zard ke darmiyan, aur gharon me jo kuch hai so hai; jab tum kal dushman se milo to aage badho, aage badho. Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Koi shakhs ek qadam aage nahi badhata magar hoor-e-ayn uski taraf aage badhti hain; agar woh usse ruki rahen aur agar woh shaheed ho jaye to uske khoon ka pehla phawwara uske gunahon ka kaffara ban jata hai; do hoor-e-ayn us par utarti hain, usse gard jhadti hain aur kehti hain: Khush amdeed, tumhara waqt aa pahucha; aur woh kehta hai: Khush amdeed, tumhara waqt aa pahucha."
"442","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, hamein Nafi' ibn Umar al-Jumahi ne Umayyah ibn Safwan se, Abu Bakr ibn Abi Zuhayr al-Thaqafi se, unke walid se khabar di, unhone kaha ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne hamein al-Banah ya al-Banawah par khutba diya, aur al-Banawah Ta'if me hai, farmate hue: Anqareeb tum jannat walon ko jahannam walon se pehchan loge, ya farmaya: Apne behtareen logon ko apne badtareen logon se. Main sirf itna janta hun ke unhone farmaya: Jannat wale jahannam walon se. Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kis cheez se? Unhone farmaya: Achchi tareef aur buri tareef se; tum ek dusre par gawah ho."
"443","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Zuray' ne bayan kiya, hamein Dawud ibn Abi Hind ne Abdullah ibn Qays se, al-Harith ibn Waqsh ya Wuqaysh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi do musalman aise nahi jin ke chaar bachche faut ho jayen magar Allah unhein apni rehmat se jannat me dakhil karega. Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur teen? Farmaya: Aur teen. Unhone kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur do? Farmaya: Aur do. Farmaya: Meri ummat me ek shakhs jahannam ke liye itna bada hoga ke uska ek kona ban jayega; aur meri ummat me ek shakhs aisa hoga jiski shafa'at se Mudar se zyada log jannat me dakhil honge."
"444","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne khabar di, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit al-Bunani se, Habib ibn Abi Subay'ah al-Duba'i se, al-Harith se bayan kiya ke ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas baitha hua tha jab ek aadmi guzra. Usne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Allah ke liye usse mohabbat karta hun. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tumne use is baat ki ittila di hai? Usne kaha: Nahi. Farmaya: Jao aur use ittila do. To woh gaya aur kaha: Main Allah ke liye tumse mohabbat karta hun. Usne kaha: Woh Zaat jiske liye tumne mujhse mohabbat ki woh tumse mohabbat kare."
"445","Hamein Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Lahi'ah ne bayan kiya, hamein Khalid ibn Yazid al-Saksaki ne Sa'id ibn Abi Hilal al-Madani se, Muhammad ibn Abi al-Jahm se, al-Harith ibn Malik al-Ansari se bayan kiya ke woh Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas se guzre to Aap ne unse farmaya: Ae Harith, tumne kis haal me subah ki? Unhone kaha: Maine sache momin ki haisiyat se subah ki. Farmaya: Ghaur karo tum kya keh rahe ho, har sach ki ek haqiqat hoti hai. Unhone kaha: Kya maine duniya ko apne nafs se nahi pher liya, apna din pyaasa kar liya, apni raat bedaar rakhi, aur goya main apne Rab ke Arsh ko zahir dekhta hun, goya main jannat walon ko usme ek dusre se mulaqat karte dekhta hun, aur goya main jahannam walon ko usme waa waila karte, ya'ni cheekhte chillate dekhta hun? Farmaya: Ae Harith, tumne pehchan liya, pas mazbuti se pakde raho, teen martaba."
"446","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Ma'mar ne al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhone kaha ke mujhe Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'ah ne Harithah ibn al-Nu'man se khabar di, unhone kaha ke main Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas se guzra jabke Jibril unke paas baithne ki jaghon me baithe hue the. Maine salam kiya, phir aage chala gaya. Jab main wapas aaya aur Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam tashreef laaye to farmaya: Kya tumne use dekha jo mere paas tha? Maine kaha: Ji han. Farmaya: Woh Jibril alayhis salam the, aur unhone tumhare salam ka jawab diya tha."
"447","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, hamein Shu'bah ne Waqid ibn Muhammad ibn Zayd se khabar di ke unhone Safwan ko Muhammad ibn Sahl se, unke walid se, ya Muhammad se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat karte hue suna ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi kisi cheez ki taraf rukh karke namaz padhe to uske qareeb ho jaye, taake shaitan uski namaz na kaat de."
"448","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne al-Zuhri se, Sahl ibn Sa'd al-Sa'idi se khabar di ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke darwaze ke surakh se jhanka jabke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam kanghe se apna sar khujla rahe the. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe ilm hota ke tum mujhe dekh rahe ho to main ise tumhari aankh me chubho deta. Ijazat talab karna sirf dekhne ki wajah se muqarrar kiya gaya hai."
"449","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Ma'mar ne Abu Hazim se, Sahl ibn Sa'd se khabar di ke Uhud larza jabke us par Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, Abu Bakr, Umar aur Uthman the. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sambhal ja ae Uhud, tujh par ek nabi, ek siddiq aur do shaheedon ke siwa koi nahi."
"450","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Ma'mar ne Abu Hazim se khabar di, unhone kaha ke main Sahl ibn Sa'd ke paas tha jab unse kaha gaya: Banu Amr ibn Awf aur Quba walon ke darmiyan kuch muamla hua tha. Unhone kaha: Yeh bahut pehle ki baat hai. Hum Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath the jab Aap ko khabar pahunchi ke Quba walon ke darmiyan kuch pesh aaya hai, to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam unke darmiyan sulah karane tashreef le gaye aur logon se ruk gaye. Bilal ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Kya main iqamat kah dun? Unhone kaha: Jaise tum chaho. Bilal ne iqamat kahi aur logon ne Abu Bakr ko aage badha diya. Jab woh namaz padha rahe the to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam tashreef laaye, safon ko cheerte hue yahan tak ke Abu Bakr ke peeche khade ho gaye. Log taali bajane lage, lekin Abu Bakr namaz me mud kar na dekhte the. Jab taaliyan badh gayin to woh mude aur dekha ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam unke peeche khade hain. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne unhein ishara kiya ke jaise hain waise hi namaz padhate rahen, lekin Abu Bakr peeche hat gaye aur Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam aage badhe aur namaz padhayi. Jab farigh hue to Abu Bakr se farmaya: Jab maine tumhein hukm diya tha to tumhein namaz jari rakhne se kis cheez ne roka? Unhone kaha: Abu Quhafah ke bete ke liye munasib nahi ke woh Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki imamat kare. Phir Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz me yeh taali bajana kaisa hai? Taali bajana auraton ke liye hai aur tasbeeh kehna mardon ke liye hai."
"451","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, hamein Abd al-Hamid ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Hazim ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke ek aurat Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aayi jabke Aap ke kuch sahaba Aap ke saath the. Woh unke darmiyan chali phiri lekin jagah na payi to ek aadmi ne uske liye jagah kushada ki; woh khada ho gaya aur woh baith gayi aur apni hajat puri ki, phir khadi ho gayi. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum use jante ho? Usne kaha: Nahi. Farmaya: Kya tumne us par rehem kiya, Allah tum par rehem kare, teen martaba."
"452","Hamein Yazid ibn Abi Hakim ne khabar di, hamein Abd al-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn Aslam al-Madani ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Hazim ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat me zameen me dhansna, suraton ka maskh hona aur pathar barsaya jana hoga. Kaha gaya: Aur yeh kab hoga, Ya Rasulullah? Farmaya: Jab gane waliyan aur saaz zahir ho jayen aur sharabon ko halal qarar diya jaye."
"453","Mujhe Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne apne walid se, Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya ke unse Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke zakhm ke baare me Uhud ke din pucha gaya. Unhone kaha ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ka chehra zakhmi hua, aapka saamne ka daant toot gaya aur khud aapke sar par kuchal diya gaya. Fatimah, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki beti, khoon dho rahi thin aur Ali dhal par se unke upar pani daal rahe the. Jab Fatimah ne dekha ke pani khoon ko aur badha raha hai to unhone chatai ka ek tukda liya, use jalaya yahan tak ke woh raakh ban gaya, aur use zakhm par rakh kar daba diya to khoon band ho gaya."
"454","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Sulayman ibn Bilal ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Abu Hazim ibn Dinar ne bayan kiya, kehte hain maine Sahl ibn Sa'd ko kehte hue suna: Hum jumu'ah ke din na dopahar ka khana khate the na qailulah karte the magar jumu'ah ki namaz ke baad."
"455","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Sulayman ibn Bilal ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Abu Hazim ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat me ek darwaza hai jise al-Rayyan kaha jata hai, usme se rozedar qiyamat ke din dakhil honge; unke siwa koi usme se dakhil nahi hoga. Kaha jayega: Rozedar kahan hain? Woh khade honge aur usme se dakhil honge; jab unka aakhiri fard dakhil ho jayega to woh band kar diya jayega aur koi usme se dakhil nahi hoga."
"456","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Sulayman ibn Bilal ne bayan kiya, mujhe Abu Hazim ne bayan kiya, kehte hain maine Sahl ibn Sa'd ko kehte hue suna ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum me se kisi ka Allah ke raste me subah ka nikalna ya shaam ka nikalna duniya aur jo kuch usme hai usse behtar hai; aur jannat me kode ke barabar jagah duniya aur jo kuch usme hai usse behtar hai."
"457","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Sulayman ibn Bilal ne bayan kiya, kehte hain mujhe Abu Hazim ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi jannat walon ke amal karta hai jaisa ke logon ko nazar aata hai halanke woh jahannam walon me se hota hai, aur dusra jahannam walon ke amal karta hai jaisa ke logon ko nazar aata hai halanke woh jannat walon me se hota hai."
"458","Hamein Amr ibn Sa'd ne Sufyan se, Abu Hazim se, Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhone kaha ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yeh ummat bhalai par rahegi jab tak woh iftar me jaldi karte rahenge."
"459","Mujhe Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, kehte hain hamein Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne apne walid se, Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ka ek ghazwah me mushrikeen se samna hua aur jang hui, aur har qaum apne camp ki taraf laut gayi, aur musalmanon me ek aadmi tha jo mushrikeen ki koi akeli ya muntashir jama'at na chhodta magar uske peeche lagta aur use apni talwar se marta. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, aaj kisi ne aisa kaam nahi kiya jaisa falan ne kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Phir bhi woh jahannam walon me se hai. Logon ne is baat ko bada samjha aur kaha: Agar falan jahannam walon me se hai to hum me se kaun jannat walon me se hai? Logon me se ek aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh is haal par kabhi nahi marega. Woh uske peeche lag gaya; jab woh tez chalta to woh bhi tez chalta, aur jab woh dheema padta to woh bhi dheema padta, yahan tak ke woh aadmi zakhmi hua aur uske zakhm shadeed ho gaye, to usne maut me jaldi ki: usne apni talwar ka dasta zameen par rakha aur uski nok apne seenon ke darmiyan rakhi, phir apne aap ko us par gira diya aur khudkushi kar li. Woh aadmi Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke aap Allah ke Rasul hain. Aap ne farmaya: Woh kya baat hai? Usne jo hua tha uski khabar di. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi jannat walon ke amal karta hai jaisa ke logon ko nazar aata hai halanke woh jahannam walon me se hota hai, aur woh jahannam walon ke amal karta hai jaisa ke logon ko nazar aata hai halanke woh jannat walon me se hota hai."
"460","Mujhe Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, kehte hain hamein Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne apne walid se, Sahl se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke sattar hazar - ya saat lakh, Abu Hazim ne kaha ke mujhe nahi ma'lum dono me se kaunsi thi - jannat me dakhil honge, ek dusre ko pakde hue, har ek dusre ka haath pakde hue; unka pehla shakhs us waqt tak dakhil nahi hoga jab tak unka aakhiri shakhs dakhil na ho jaye, unke chehre chaudahvin raat ke chaand ki tarah honge."
"461","Mujh se Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne apne walid se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd ko sawal ka jawab dete hue suna: Kya tum ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein safed maida dekha tha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne maida kabhi nahin dekha yahan tak ke Allah ne Apne Rasool ko wafaat de di. Main ne kaha: Kya Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein tumhare paas chhalniyan thin? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne chhalni kabhi nahin dekhi yahan tak ke Allah ne Apne Rasool ko wafaat de di. Main ne kaha: Kya tum bina chhane hue jau khate the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; hum us par phoonk marte the to jo urrna hota urr jata aur jo baqi rehta use geela karke kha lete the."
"462","Mujh se Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne apne walid se, unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya: Ek aurat Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas ek buni hui chadar lekar aayi jismein uska hashiya laga hua tha. Phir Sahl ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho burdah kya hai? Logon ne kaha: Haan, shamlah. Unhon ne kaha: Haan, woh shamlah hi hai. Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, main ne ise apne haath se buna hai aur aayi hun taake aap ko ise pehnaun. Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ise le liya is haal mein ke aap ko uski zaroorat thi, aur aap hamare paas bahar tashreef laye ise apne tehband ke taur par pehne hue. Unhon ne kaha: Falan bin falan, use chhute hue, ek shakhs ka naam lekar, ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, yeh chadar kitni khoobsurat hai; mujhe ise pehna dijiye. Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Jab Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam andar dakhil hue to aap ne use teh karke unki taraf bhej diya. Logon ne un se kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum ne achha nahin kiya; Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne use is haal mein pehna tha ke aap ko uski zaroorat thi, phir tum ne un se uska sawal kiya halanke tum jante the ke woh kisi maangne wale ko radd nahin karte. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main ne use pehenne ke liye nahin maanga; main ne use sirf is liye maanga taake woh mere marne ke din mera kafan bane. Sahl ne kaha: Aur woh unke marne ke din unka kafan bani."
"463","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Zayd ibn Hubab ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Sa'id ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Makhzumi ne bayan kiya, kaha: Main ne Abu Hazim ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Sahl ibn Sa'd ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Jannat ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Us mein woh kuch hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha, na kisi kaan ne suna, aur na kabhi kisi insaan ke dil mein uska khayal guzra."
"464","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Mu'awiyah ibn Hisham ne Abu Hafs al-Ta'ifi se, unhon ne Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Arafah ke din roza rakhe use do lagatar saalon ki maghfirat milti hai."
"465","Hum se Abdullah ibn Yazid ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Ayyash ibn Uqbah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Main ne Yahya ibn Maymun al-Hadrami ko kehte hue suna: Sahl ibn Sa'd hamare paas se guzre jabke hum masjid mein the, aur Sahl ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs namaz ke intezar mein masjid mein baithe woh namaz hi mein masroof hai."
"466","Humain Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Musa ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne apne bhai se, unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam hamare paas bahar tashreef laye jabke hum ek dusre ko Qur'an parha rahe the, aur aap ne farmaya: Tamam ta'reef Allah ke liye hai; Allah ki Kitab ek hai, aur tum mein nek log bhi hain, aur tum mein surkh aur siyah bhi hain. Phir aap ne farmaya: Parho, parho, parho, is se pehle ke aise log aayen jo uske huroof ko teer ki tarah seedha karenge, jo unki hansliyon se aage nahin guzrega; woh uska ajr jaldi chahenge aur uska intezar nahin karenge."
"467","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Waki' ne Rabi'ah ibn Uthman se bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Imran ibn Abi Anas ne Sahl ibn Sa'd se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein do aadmiyon ne us masjid ke baare mein ikhtilaf kiya jiski bunyad taqwa par rakhi gayi: un mein se ek ne kaha woh Madinah ki masjid hai, aur dusre ne kaha woh Quba ki masjid hai. Woh dono Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaye, to aap ne farmaya: Woh meri yeh masjid hai."
"468","Hum se Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Hammad ibn Zayd ne Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne Sa'id ibn Ubayd ibn al-Sabbaq se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Sahl ibn Hunayf se bayan kiya: Unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se madhi ke baare mein pucha, to aap ne farmaya: Uske liye wuzu tumhein kafi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur jo mere kapre ko lag jaye uska main kya karun? Aap ne farmaya: Ek chullu pani lo aur apne kapre par jahan tumhara khayal ho ke woh laga hai chhirak do."
"469","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Ibn Numayr ne Musa ibn Ubaydah se bayan kiya, kaha: Mujhe Yusuf ibn Tahman ne Abu Umamah ibn Sahl se, unhon ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs achhi tarah wuzu kare, phir Quba ki masjid aaye aur us mein chaar rak'aten parhe, to yeh ek Umrah ke barabar hai."
"470","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Abu Usamah ne Musa ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne Ya'qub ibn Zayd se, unhon ne Abu Umamah ibn Sahl se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahe: Assalamu alaykum, uske liye das nekiyan likhi jati hain; aur jo shakhs kahe: Assalamu alaykum wa rahmatullah, uske liye bees nekiyan likhi jati hain; aur jo shakhs kahe: Assalamu alaykum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, uske liye tees nekiyan likhi jati hain."
"471","Hum se Zakariyya ibn Adi ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Ubaydullah ibn Amr ne Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Allah ke raste mein kisi mujahid ki, ya apni tangdasti mein kisi maqrooz ki, ya apni azaadi ki qeemat ke muamle mein kisi mukatab ki madad kare, Allah use us Din saya dega jis Din Uske saye ke siwa koi saya nahin hoga."
"472","Mujh se Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne apne walid se, unhon ne Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Usamah ibn al-Had se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne Suhayl ibn al-Bayda se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek raat pukara jabke main aap ke peeche sawar tha, farmate hue: Ae Suhayl ibn al-Bayda, apni aawaz buland karte hue. Main ne kaha: Hazir hun, uske sath apni aawaz buland karte hue yahan tak ke hamare peeche aur aage walon ne use suna, aur woh jama ho gaye, jaante hue ke woh kuch kehna chahte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahe: La ilaha illallah, Allah uske zariye uske liye Jannat wajib kar dega aur use Aag se azaad kar dega."
"473","Hum se Zakariyya ibn Adi ne bayan kiya, kaha: Humain Ibn al-Mubarak ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid ibn Jabir se khabar di, kaha: Mujh se Busr ibn Ubaydullah ne Abu Idris se, unhon ne Wathilah ibn al-Asqa' se, unhon ne Abu Marthad se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Qabron par na baitho, aur na unki taraf rukh karke namaz parho."
"474","Hum se Habban ibn Hilal ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Abu al-Ushara ne apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya zabah sirf labbah aur gale se hi hota hai? Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum use raan mein bhi neza mar dete to tumhein kafi ho jata."
"475","Mujh se al-Dahhak ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, kaha: Mujh se Abu Dawud al-Subay'i ne bayan kiya, kaha: Mujh se Abu al-Hamra ne bayan kiya, kaha: Main nau mahine Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sath raha; jab bhi subah hoti aap Ali aur Fatimah ke darwaze par aate, farmate hue: Allah tum par rehem kare: Allah sirf yehi chahta hai ke tum se napaki door kar de, ae Ahl al-Bayt, aur tumhein khoob paak saaf kar de."
"476","Humain Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Isra'il ibn Yunus se, unhon ne Mansur se, unhon ne Rib'i ibn Hirash se, unhon ne Imran ibn Husayn se, unhon ne apne walid se khabar di, ke ek shakhs Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, Abd al-Muttalib apni qaum ke liye tum se behtar tha; woh unhein kaleji aur kohaan khilata tha jabke tum unhein qatl karte ho. Aap ne use woh jawab diya jo Allah ne chaha. Jab us ne jaane ka irada kiya to us ne kaha: Main kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, mujhe mere nafs ke shar se mehfooz rakh aur mere muamle mein sab se zyada hidayat wale ka faisla farma. Woh Islam qabool kiye baghair chala gaya, phir us ne Islam qabool kiya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, main aap ke paas aaya tha aur kaha tha: Mujhe sikhaen, aur aap ne farmaya tha: Ae Allah, mujhe mere nafs ke shar se mehfooz rakh aur mere muamle mein sab se zyada hidayat wale ka faisla farma; to ab jab main Islam le aaya hun main kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, mujhe mere nafs ke shar se mehfooz rakh aur mere muamle mein sab se zyada hidayat wale ka faisla farma; Ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de jo main ne chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya, jo main ne ghalti se kiya aur jo jaan bujh kar kiya, aur jo main ne jahalat mein kiya."
"477","Hum se Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Sufyan ne Ma'bad ibn Khalid se, unhon ne Harithah ibn Wahb al-Khuza'i se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Kya main tumhein Jannat walon ke baare mein na bataun: har kamzor, kamzor samjha jane wala, agar woh Allah ki qasam khaye to Allah use poora kar de. Kya main tumhein Jahannam walon ke baare mein na bataun: har sakht mizaj, mutakabbir shakhs."
"478","Hum se Hajjaj ibn Nusayr ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Shu'bah ne Ma'bad ibn Khalid se, unhon ne Harithah ibn Wahb se bayan kiya, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa do, kyunke tum par ek aisa waqt aane wala hai jab aadmi sadqa dega aur use qabool karne wala koi nahin milega."
"479","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Waki' ne Shu'bah se, unhon ne Ma'bad ibn Khalid se bayan kiya, kaha: Main ne Harithah ibn Wahb ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa do; qareeb hai ke aadmi apna sadqa lekar nikle aur use qabool karne wala koi na mile."
"480","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hum se Waki' ne Sufyan se, unhon ne Ma'bad ibn Khalid se, unhon ne Harithah ibn Wahb se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jawwaz Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga, na hi ja'zari. Aur jawwaz sakht, darasht shakhs hota hai."
"481","Hamein Zayd ibn Hubab al-Ukli ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Mu'awiyah ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, kaha: mujhe Abd al-Rahman ibn Jubayr ibn Nufayr ne apne walid se khabar di, kaha: maine Amr ibn al-Hamiq ko kehte huye suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ke liye bhalai ka irada farmata hai to use asalahu (mitha bana deta hai). Kaha gaya: Aur uska mitha banana kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Uske liye uski maut se pehle nek amal ka darwaza khol deta hai hatta ke uske ird-gird ke log usse razi ho jate hain."
"482","Hamein Muhammad ibn Bakr al-Bursani ne khabar di, kaha: hamein Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'far ne bayan kiya, kaha: mujhe Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi ne Abu Shurayh al-Adawi al-Khuza'i se, jo Sahaba mein se the, khabar di, unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mezbani teen din hai, aur uska ja'izah (izzat ka hissa) ek din aur ek raat hai; aur tum mein se kisi ke liye halal nahi ke woh apne bhai ke han is had tak thahre ke use gunah mein mubtala kar de. Unhone kaha: Maine kaha: Aur use gunah mein mubtala karna kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh uske han thahra rahe jabke uske pas uski mezbani ke liye kuch na ho."
"483","Hamein Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'far se, unhone Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id se, unhone Abu Shurayh al-Khuza'i se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamari taraf tashreef laye aur farmaya: Khush ho jao, khush ho jao; kya tum gawahi nahi dete ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi aur ye ke main Allah ka Rasul hun? Unhone kaha: Ji han. Aap ne farmaya: To ye Qur'an ek rassi hai jiska ek sira Allah ke Dast mein hai aur dusra sira tumhare hathon mein hai, pas ise mazbuti se thaame raho, kyunki iske baad tum kabhi na gumrah hoge aur na halak hoge, hargiz."
"484","Hamein Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Abu Aqil al-Thaqafi ne Abdullah ibn Yazid se, unhone Rabi'ah ibn Yazid aur Atiyyah ibn Qays se, unhone Atiyyah al-Sa'di se, jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Sahaba mein se the, bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda muttaqin mein shumar hone ke maqam ko nahi pahunchta jab tak ke woh us cheez ko bhi na chhod de jisme haraj nahi, us cheez se bachne ke liye jisme haraj hai."
"485","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ibn Hammam ne khabar di, kaha: hamein Ma'mar ne Simak ibn al-Fadl se, unhone Urwah ibn Muhammad se, unhone apne walid se, unhone apne dada se khabar di, unhone kaha: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate huye suna: Upar wala dene wala hath neeche wale (lene wale) hath se behtar hai."
"486","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, kaha: hamein Ma'mar ne Mansur se, unhone Mujahid se, unhone Sufyan ibn al-Hakam - ya al-Hakam ibn Sufyan - se khabar di: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab wuzu farmate aur apna wuzu mukammal kar lete to ek chullu pani le kar use apne (tahband ke) neeche chhidakte the."
"487","Hamein al-Dahhak ibn Makhlad ne Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'far se, unhone Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, unhone Abdullah ibn al-Harith ibn Jaz al-Zubaydi se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Main pehla shakhs hun jisne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko is baat se mana farmate huye suna ke aadmi qiblah ki taraf rukh karke peshab kare. Unhone kaha: Pas main logon ki taraf nikla aur unhein ittila di."
"488","Hamein Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein al-Ajlah ne al-Hakam ibn Utaybah se, unhone Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, unhone Abdullah ibn Ukaym se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein khat likha: Murdar se khal ya paththe (nas) ke zariye faida na uthao."
"489","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Abu Bakr ibn Hafs ne Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabi'ah se bayan kiya ke ek aurat masjid se tinke aur gandagi chun kar nikalti thi phir woh faut ho gayi; Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam uski qabr ke pas se guzre aur us par namaz-e-janazah padhi."
"490","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ibn Hammam ne khabar di, kaha: hamein Ma'mar ne al-Zuhri se, unhone Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi se, unhone Abdullah ibn Adi ibn al-Hamra se khabar di: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon ke darmiyan baithe huye the ke ek aadmi Aap ke pas aaya aur munafiqin mein se ek shakhs ko qatl karne ke liye sargoshi ki ijazat talab ki. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni baat buland awaz se farmayi aur kaha: Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi? Usne kaha: Ji han, ya Rasulullah, lekin uski koi gawahi nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke main Allah ka Rasul hun? Usne kaha: Ji han, ya Rasulullah, lekin uski koi gawahi nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya woh namaz nahi padhta? Usne kaha: Ji han, lekin uski koi namaz nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Yahi log hain jinko qatl karne se mujhe mana kiya gaya hai."
"491","Mujhe Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne khabar di, kaha: mujhe mere walid ne Salih ibn Kaysan se, unhone Ibn Shihab se bayan kiya, kaha: mujhe Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di ke Abdullah ibn Adi ibn al-Hamra ne unhein khabar di ke unhone Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko, jabke Aap Makkah mein al-Hazwarah par apni sawari par khade the, Makkah se ye farmate huye suna: Allah ki qasam, tu Allah ki zameen mein sab se behtareen jagah hai aur Allah ki zameen mein mujhe sab se zyada mehboob hai; agar mujhe tujh se nikala na gaya hota to main tujhe chhod kar na jata."
"492","Mujhe Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Muslim ne apne chacha se bayan kiya, kaha: mujhe Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah ibn Mas'ud ne khabar di ke Shibl ibn Khulayd al-Muzani ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne londi ke baare mein farmaya: Agar woh zina kare to use kode maro; phir agar woh zina kare to use kode maro; phir agar woh zina kare to use kode maro; phir agar woh zina kare to use bech do khwah ek rassi ke badle - aur rassi (dafir) ek dori hai - teesri ya chauthi martaba par."
"493","Hamein Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Isra'il ne Jabir se, unhone Amir se, unhone Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Ansari se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Maghrib mein wat-teeni waz-zaitoon (anjeer aur zaitoon ki qasam) ki tilawat farmaya karte the."
"494","Hamein Ibn Abi Fudayk ne khabar di, kaha: hamein Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne Abu Sa'id al-Barrad se, unhone Mu'adh ibn Abdullah ibn Khubayb se, unhone apne walid se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hum ek barish wali, sakht andheri, sakht raat mein nikle, aur Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko talash kiya gaya taake woh hamare liye namaz padhayen. Unhone kaha: Main Aap ko pa gaya, aur Aap ne farmaya: Kaho. Maine kuch na kaha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kaho. Maine kuch na kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho. Maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur main kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Qul huwallahu ahad aur do panah maangne wali suratein, jab tum shaam karo aur jab subah karo, teen martaba; woh tumhein har cheez se kifayat karengi."
"495","Hamein Husayn al-Ju'fi ne Za'idah se, unhone Asim ibn Bahdalah se, unhone Abu Razin se, unhone Ibn Umm Maktum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha: Main budha hun, nabina hun, ghar se door rehta hun, aur mera ek rahnuma hai jo mere munasib nahi; kya aap mere liye koi rukhsat pate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum azan sunte ho? Maine kaha: Ji han. Aap ne farmaya: Phir main tumhare liye koi rukhsat nahi pata."
"496","Mujhe Sa'id ibn Amir ne Awf se, unhone Zurarah ibn Awfa se, unhone Abdullah ibn Salam se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madinah tashreef laye to log unke intezar mein jhanke; unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef le aaye hain. Unhone kaha: Pas main bhi un logon ke sath nikla jo nikle, aur jab maine Aap ka chehra dekha to pehchan gaya ke ye kisi jhoote ka chehra nahi hai. Pehli baat jo maine Aap ko farmate huye suni woh ye thi: Ai logo, salam ko aam karo, khana khilao, namaz padho jab log so rahe hon, aur salamati ke sath Jannat mein dakhil ho jao."
"497","Mujhe al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Asim ibn Bahdalah se, unhone al-Musayyab ibn Rafi' se, unhone Kharashah ibn al-Hurr se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Main Madinah aaya aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki masjid mein kuch buzurgon ke pas baitha, aur ek budha aadmi apni ek lathi par tek lagaye huye aaya. Logon ne kaha: Jise Jannat walon mein se kisi shakhs ko dekh kar khushi ho, woh is shakhs ko dekh le. Unhone kaha: Pas woh ek sutun ke peeche khada hua aur do rak'atein padhin. Main uske pas gaya aur usse kaha: Kuch logon ne aisa aisa kaha. Usne kaha: Jannat Allah Azza wa Jalla ki hai, woh jise chahta hai usme dakhil farmata hai. Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke zamane mein ek khwab dekha: Maine dekha jaise ek aadmi mere pas aaya aur mujhse kaha: Chalo, to main uske sath chal diya, aur woh mujhe ek bade raste par le gaya. Mere bayen janib ek rasta zahir hua aur maine us par chalne ka irada kiya, to usne kaha: Tum uske logon mein se nahi ho. Phir mere dayen janib ek rasta zahir hua aur main us par chala yahan tak ke main ek phislan bhare pahad tak pahunch gaya; usne mera hath pakda aur mujhe upar dhakel diya, aur main uski choti par tha, aur main na jam sakta tha na qaim reh sakta tha. Uski choti par lohe ka ek sutun tha jisme sone ka ek halqa tha; usne mera hath pakda aur mujhe upar dhakel diya yahan tak ke maine kundah thaam liya. Usne kaha: Mazbuti se thaame raho. Maine kaha: Ji han. Usne sutun ko apne paon se thokar mari jabke main kundah ko thaame huye tha. Maine ise Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tumne achha khwab dekha hai: raha bada rasta to woh maidan-e-hashr hai; raha woh rasta jo tumhare bayen zahir hua to woh Jahannamiyon ka rasta hai aur tum unme se nahi ho; raha woh rasta jo tumhare dayen zahir hua to woh Jannatiyon ka rasta hai; raha phislan bhara pahad to woh shuhada ka maqam hai; aur raha woh kundah jo tumne thaama to woh Islam ka kundah hai, pas ise mazbuti se thaame raho yahan tak ke tum wafat pa jao. Pas mujhe ummeed hai ke main Jannat walon mein se hunga - aur woh Abdullah ibn Salam the."
"498","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Yahya ibn Ya'la al-Taymi Abu al-Muhayyah ne Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, unhone Abdullah ibn Salam ke bhatije se, unhone Abdullah ibn Salam se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Zamana-e-Jahiliyyah mein mera naam falan tha, aur Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mera naam Abdullah ibn Salam rakha."
"499","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Muhammad ibn Umar ne Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'far se, unhone Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, unhone Yusuf ibn Abdullah ibn Salam se, unhone apne walid se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Jumu'ah ke din hamein khutba diya aur farmaya: Tum mein se kisi par koi haraj na hota agar woh apne Jumu'ah ke liye apne kaam ke kapde ke alawa do kapde khareed leta."
"500","Mujhe Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, kaha: hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Yazid al-Raqashi se, unhone Abu Na'amah se bayan kiya ke Abdullah ibn Mughaffal al-Muzani ne apne bete ko ye kehte huye suna: Ai Allah, main Tujhse al-Firdaws ka sawal karta hun, aur main Tujhse sawal karta hun, aur main Tujhse sawal karta hun. Abdullah ne usse kaha: Allah se Jannat ka sawal karo aur Jahannam se uski panah mango, kyunki maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate huye suna: Is Ummah mein anqareeb aise log honge jo dua aur taharat mein hadd se tajawuz karenge."
"501","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se, Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum oonton ke baithne ki jagahon par aao to un mein namaz na parho; aur jab tum bakriyon ke baithne ki jagahon par aao to agar chaho to un mein namaz parho."
"502","Sa'id ibn Amir ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah se, al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se, ke Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisa kutta rakhe jo shikari kutta ho na bakriyon wala kutta na kheti wala kutta, to har din us ke ajr se ek qirat kam kar diya jata hai."
"503","Sa'id ibn Amir aur Hawdhah ne hum se bayan kiya, Awf se, al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se, ke Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar ye baat na hoti ke kutte makhluqat mein se ek makhluq hain to main un ke qatl ka hukm deta; pas un mein se har khalis siyah ko qatl karo."
"504","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus aur Humayd se, al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se, ke Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Narm hai aur narmi ko pasand karta hai, aur us par wo ata karta hai jo sakhti par ata nahin karta."
"505","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ash'ath ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di, al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne ghusl khane mein peshab na kare phir usi mein wuzu kare, kyunke aksar waswase usi se aate hain."
"506","Yazid ibn Harun ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hariz ibn Uthman al-Rahabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn Busr se kaha: Kya Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) umr rasida the? Unhon ne kaha: Un ki thoddi par chand safed baal the."
"507","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Khumayr se, Abdullah ibn Busr se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) mere walid ke paas aaye aur un ke han qiyam kiya; unhon ne un ke samne khana pesh kiya, aur haysah, sattu aur khajuren. Phir un ke liye peene ki cheez laye to unhon ne piya aur apne dayen taraf wale ko diya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur wo khajuren khate the, guthliyon ko apni do ungliyon, shahadat ki ungli aur darmiyani ungli ki pusht par rakhte aur phenk dete. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah, unhein is mein barkat de jo Tu ne unhein ata kiya, unhein bakhsh de aur un par rehem farma."
"508","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr se, Khalid ibn Ma'dan se, Abdullah ibn Busr se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hafta ke din roza na rakho siwaye us ke jo tum par farz kiya gaya hai; aur agar tum mein se koi angur ki tehni ya darakht ki chhaal ke siwa kuch na paye to use chabay."
"509","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ibn Salih ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Qays ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Busr al-Khuza'i se, ke ek dehati ne Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se kaha: Logon mein sab se behtar kaun hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Wo jis ki umr lambi ho aur amal achha ho."
"510","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Asim al-Ahwal ne humein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Sarjis se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) safar karte to kehte: Ae Allah, main safar ki mashaqqat se, wapsi ke ranj se, zyadati ke ba'd kami se, mazlum ki dua se, aur ehel o maal ke bare mein buri nazar se Teri panah chahta hun. Yazid ne kaha: Main ne ise Asim se suna, aur Shu'bah ne mujhe is ki tasdiq ki."
"511","Sulayman ibn Harb aur Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim al-Ahwal se, Abdullah ibn Sarjis se: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) jab safar karte to kehte: Ae Allah, Tu safar mein sathi hai aur ehel par khalifa hai. Ae Allah, hamare safar mein hamare sath reh aur hamare ehel par hamara khalifa ban. Ae Allah, hum safar ki mashaqqat aur wapsi ke ranj se Teri panah chahte hain; aur main zyadati ke ba'd kami se, mazlum ki dua se, aur ehel o maal ke bare mein buri nazar se Teri panah chahta hun. Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne apni riwayat mein izafa karte hue kaha: Asim se zyadati ke ba'd kami ke bare mein pucha gaya; unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: seedha rehne ke ba'd bigad gaya."
"512","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nuh ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Imran ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim al-Ahwal se, Abdullah ibn Sarjis al-Muzani se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tahammul, miyanah rawi aur husn e waqar nubuwat ke chaubis hisson mein se ek hissa hain."
"513","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne humein khabar di, Qatadah se, Mutarrif ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas pahuncha is ke ba'd ke un par ye nazil ho chuki thi: Tumhein kasrat ki hirs ne ghafil kar diya, jabke wo tilawat kar rahe the: Tumhein kasrat ki hirs ne ghafil kar diya, aur farma rahe the: Ibn e Adam kehta hai: Mera maal, mera maal; aur tere maal mein se tere liye siwaye us ke kya hai jo tu ne sadqa karke aage bheja, ya kha kar khatm kiya, ya pehen kar purana kar diya?"
"514","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Mutarrif se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke wo namaz parh rahe the, aur un ke seene se handi ke josh jaisi awaz aa rahi thi."
"515","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaddad ibn Sa'id al-Rasibi Abu Talhah se, unhon ne kaha: Ghaylan ibn Jarir ne mujh se bayan kiya, Mutarrif ibn Abdullah ibn al-Shikhkhir se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke wo namaz parh rahe the, baithe aur khade hote hue, tilawat kar rahe the: Tumhein kasrat ki hirs ne ghafil kar diya, yahan tak ke unhon ne ise mukammal kiya."
"516","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abbad ibn Tamim se, apne chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko dekha ke wo barish talab karne ke liye nikle; unhon ne logon ki taraf apni pusht ki, qibla ki taraf rukh kiya, apni chadar ko ulta kiya, dua mangna shuru ki, do rak'aten parhin aur buland awaz se qira'at ki."
"517","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abbad ibn Tamim se, apne chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko masjid mein tek lagaye dekha, ek tang dusri tang par rakhte hue."
"518","Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abbad ibn Tamim al-Ansari se, Abdullah ibn Zayd se, Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne Makkah ko hurmat wala qarar diya aur us ke liye dua ki; aur main ne Madinah ko hurmat wala qarar diya hai jaise Ibrahim ne Makkah ko hurmat wala qarar diya tha, aur main ne us ke mudd aur sa' ke bare mein dua ki hai usi ki manind jo Ibrahim ne Makkah ke liye dua ki thi."
"519","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Layth ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, ke Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr ne unhein bayan kiya: Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne al-Zubayr se Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke samne al-Harrah ki naliyon par jhagda kiya jin se wo khajur ke darakhton ko pani dete the, aur al-Zubayr ne use mana kar diya. Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Pani de, ae Zubayr, phir apne padosi ki taraf chhod de. Ansari ghusse mein aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya is liye ke wo aap ki phuphi ka beta hai?! Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ka chehra mutaghayyir ho gaya, phir unhon ne farmaya: Pani de, ae Zubayr, phir pani ko rok ke rakh yahan tak ke wo band tak wapas laut aaye. Al-Zubayr ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mere khayal mein ye ayat isi bare mein nazil hui: Pas nahin, aap ke Rabb ki qasam, wo iman nahin layenge yahan tak ke wo aap ko hakim banayen us mein jo un ke darmiyan paida ho - ayat."
"520","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaykah se, Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ek chuski aur do chuskiyan hurmat sabit nahin kartin."
"521","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib al-Mu'allim se, Ata se, Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein ek namaz kisi bhi dusri masjid mein hazar namazon se behtar hai siwaye Masjid al-Haram ke; aur Masjid al-Haram mein ek namaz meri is masjid ki namaz se sau namazon se behtar hai."
"522","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubayd ibn al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ruku se sar uthate to farmate: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd kare; Aye Allah, aye hamare Rab, tere hi liye hamd hai, aasmanon ko bhar kar aur zameen ko bhar kar aur uske baad jo kuch tu chahe kisi bhi cheez se bhar kar."
"523","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Maine Ibn Abi Awfa se kaha: Kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne Ahzab ke khilaf bad-dua ki thi? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah, Kitab ke nazil farmane wale, hisab mein jaldi karne wale, Ahzab ko shikast dene wale; Aye Allah, Ahzab ko shikast de aur unhein jhinjhod de."
"524","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Khalid al-Wasiti se, Ibrahim se - jo al-Nakha'i nahi hain - Ibn Abi Awfa se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main Qur'an yaad nahi kar sakta, to mujhe koi aisi cheez sikha dijiye jo mujhe kafi ho jaye. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah paak hai, tamam ta'reef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi aur Allah sab se bada hai; aur Allah ke siwa na koi taqat hai na quwwat. Dehati ne kaha: Is tarah - aur apna haath band kar liya. Aap ne farmaya: Ye Allah ke liye hai, to mere liye kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aye Allah, mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehem farma, mujhe aafiyat de, mujhe rizq de aur mujhe hidayat de. Dehati ne unhein le liya aur apne dono haath band kar liye. Aap ne farmaya: Raha ye, to is ne apne dono haath khair se bhar liye hain."
"525","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, us shakhs se jis ne Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Zina kar zina nahi karta jab wo zina karta hai is haal mein ke wo momin ho; aur na sharab peene wala sharab peeta hai jab wo peeta hai is haal mein ke wo momin ho; aur na chor chori karta hai jab wo chori karta hai is haal mein ke wo momin ho; aur na koi lootne wala koi qeemti ya izzat wali cheez loot-ta hai is haal mein ke wo momin ho. Shu'bah ne kaha: al-Hakam ne shak kiya."
"526","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: al-Hasan ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ya'fur se, Ibn Abi Awfa se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath - ya hum ne Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath - saat ghazwat mein jihaad kiya, tidiyan khate hue."
"527","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani se, al-Qasim se, Ibn Abi Awfa se, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Awwabeen ki namaz us waqt hai jab oont ke chhote bachchon ko suraj ki garmi mehsoos hoti hai."
"528","Sa'id ibn al-Rabi' ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Mukhtar se, kehte hue: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam safar mein the aur log pyaas se mutassir hue, aur wo paani par pahunche. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam logon ko paani pilane lage. Logon ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, peejiye, peejiye, aye Allah ke Rasul. Aap ne farmaya: Logon ko paani pilane wala un mein sab se aakhir mein peeta hai."
"529","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Warqa se, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs gyarah martaba kahe: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi shareek nahi, wo Ahad hai, Samad hai, jis ne na jana aur na jana gaya aur koi uska humsar nahi - Allah uske liye bees lakh nekiyan likh dega."
"530","Abdullah ibn Bakr al-Sahmi ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Fa'id Abu al-Warqa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa al-Aslami se, unhon ne kaha: Main nikla aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam, Abu Bakr aur Umar baithe hue the, aur ek chhota bachcha ro raha tha. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne Umar se farmaya: Bachche ko apni taraf kheench lo, kyunki wo gumshuda hai. Umar ne use apni taraf kheench liya. Jab hum baithe hue the to uski maan cheekhti hui aayi - mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha - kehte hue: Aye mere bete! aur ro rahi thi. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne Umar se farmaya: Khatoon ko bulao, kyunki ye bachche ki maan hai; us ne apne bete ke gham mein apna sar khol rakha tha, us par koi odhni nahi thi. Wo aayi yahan tak ke us ne Umar ki god se bachche ko rote hue pakad liya, bachcha uski god mein tha. Wo palti, aur jab us ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko dekha to kaha: Main kitni bad-naseeb hoti agar Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko na dekhti. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne us waqt farmaya: Kya tum is khatoon ko apne bachche par meherban samajhte ho? Aap ke Sahaba ne kaha: Haan, aye Allah ke Rasul; momin ki rehmat kafi hai. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jiske haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, Allah momin par is khatoon ke apne bachche par meherban hone se zyada meherban hai."
"531","Abdullah ibn Bakr al-Sahmi ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Fa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko dekha, jab subah hoti to aap farmate: Hum ne subah ki aur hukumat Allah ke liye hai; aur azmat, kibriyayi, khalq, raat aur din aur jo kuch un mein tehra hua hai Allah wahdahu la shareeka lah ke liye hai. Aye Allah, is din ko bana: iska aaghaz durusti, iska darmiyan khushhali aur iska anjaam kamyabi; aur main tujh se duniya ki bhalai aur aakhirat ki bhalai maangta hun."
"532","Abd al-Rahim ibn Harun al-Wasiti al-Ghassani ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Fa'id ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, jab hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath baithe hue the, ek dehati aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, shiddat ki khwahish aur bhook ne mujhe halak kar diya hai. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aye dehati, khwahish aur bhook? Us ne kaha: Wahi baat hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jao, pehli aurat jise tum milo jiska koi shauhar na ho wo tumhari biwi hai. Dehati ne kaha: To main Banu al-Najjar ke khajoor ke baagh mein dakhil hua, aur wahan ek laundi tokri mein khajoorein jama kar rahi thi. Maine us se kaha: Aye tokri wali, kya tumhara koi shauhar hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: Neeche utar aao, kyunki Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne tumhara nikah mujh se kar diya hai. Us ne kaha: To wo neeche utar aayi, aur main uske saath uske ghar gaya, aur us ne apne walid se kaha: Ye dehati hamare paas aaya jab main tokri mein khajoorein jama kar rahi thi, aur us ne mujh se pucha: Kya tumhara koi shauhar hai? Maine kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: Neeche utar aao, kyunki Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne tumhara nikah mujh se kar diya hai. Laundi ke walid dehati ke paas nikle, aur dehati ne un se kaha: Tokri wali tumhari kya lagti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Meri beti hai. Us ne kaha: Kya uska koi shauhar hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne uska nikah mujh se kar diya hai. Laundi aur laundi ke walid Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas gaye aur aap ko khabar di. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: Kya uska koi shauhar hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Jao, use achhi tarah taiyyar karo, phir use uske paas bhej do. Laundi ke walid gaye, apni beti ko taiyyar kiya, use achhi tarah sanwara, phir uske saath khajoorein aur doodh bhej diya. Wo dehati ke ghar khajoorein aur doodh le kar aayi, aur dehati apne ghar gaya aur ek aarasta laundi dekhi, aur khajoorein aur doodh dekha, to wo namaz ke liye khada ho gaya. Jab fajr hui to wo subah sawere Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas gaya, aur laundi ke walid subah sawere apni beti ke paas gaye, aur us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, wo hamare qareeb nahi aaya, aur na hamari khajooron ya hamare doodh ke qareeb aaya. Us ne kaha: To laundi ke walid Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas gaye aur aap ko khabar di, aur aap ne dehati ko bulaya aur farmaya: Aye dehati, tumhein apni biwi se sohbat karne se kis cheez ne roka? Us ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, main aap ke paas se nikla aur ghar mein dakhil hua, aur wahan ek aarasta laundi thi, aur maine khajoorein aur doodh dekhe; to mujh par Allah ke liye lazim ho gaya ke main apni raat subah tak ibadat mein zinda rakkhun. Aap ne farmaya: Aye dehati, jao aur apni biwi se sohbat karo."
"533","Abu Jabir ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Fa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa se, unhon ne kaha: Madina mein ek maflooj shakhs tha, aur us ne apne ghar walon se kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke unki masjid ki taraf jaane wale raaste par bitha do. Us ne kaha: To maflooj ko Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke raaste par bitha diya gaya. Us ne kaha: Jab bhi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam masjid ki taraf jaate to maflooj ko salam karte. Maflooj ke ghar wale use wapas ghar le jaane ke liye aaye, aur us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, main is jagah ko nahi chhodunga jab tak Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam zinda hain; to mere liye sarkandon ki ek jhonpri bana do. Us ne kaha: To unhon ne uske liye sarkandon ki jhonpri bana di, aur maflooj usi mein raha; jab bhi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam masjid ki taraf guzarte to jhonpri mein dakhil hote aur maflooj ko salam karte. Jab bhi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas khane ka koi luqma aata to aap use maflooj ki taraf bhej dete. Us ne kaha: Jab hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath the, ek pukarne wale ne aakar aap ko maflooj ki wafat ki khabar di. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam khade hue, aur hum bhi aap ke saath khade ho gaye, yahan tak ke jab aap jhonpri ke qareeb pahunche to apne Sahaba se farmaya: Mere siwa koi jhonpri ke qareeb na jaye. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam jhonpri ke qareeb hue, aur Jibril Alaihissalam maflooj ke sirhane baithe hue the. Jibril ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, agar aap hamare paas na aate to hum aap ko uske maamle mein kafi ho jaate; lekin jab se aap aa gaye hain to aap uske zyada haqdar hain. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam uske upar khade hue, apne haath se use ghusl diya, kafnaya, us par namaz padhi aur use qabr mein rakha."
"534","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: al-Awwam ibn Hawshab ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Ibrahim Abu Isma'il al-Saksaki ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Maine Abu Burdah ibn Abi Musa ko Yazid ibn Abi Kabshah se kehte hue suna - aur hum safar mein saath the, aur Ibn Abi Kabshah safar mein roza rakhta tha - Abu Burdah ne kaha: Maine Abu Musa ko baar baar kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Jab musalman aadmi beemar ho jaye ya safar kare to uske liye wahi ajr likha jata hai jo wo muqeem aur tandrust hone ki haalat mein karta tha."
"535","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: al-Jurayri ne hamein khabar di, Ghunaym ibn Qays al-Tamimi se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Is dil ki misaal sehra ki zameen mein ek par ki misaal jaisi hai, jise hawa peeth aur pet ke bal ulat-palati rehti hai."
"536","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: al-Mas'udi ne hamein khabar di, Sa'id ibn Abi Burdah se, uske walid se, uske dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ek marhoom ummat hai; us par aakhirat mein koi azab nahi - uska azab is duniya mein hai: qatl, fitne aur zalzale."
"537","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, Talhah ibn Yahya se, Abu Burdah se, uske walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Ye ummat ek marhoom ummat hai; uska azab uske apne haathon mein hai. Jab Qayamat ka din aayega to un mein se har aadmi ko ahl-e-zimmah ya mushrikeen mein se ek aadmi diya jayega, aur kaha jayega: Ye aag se tumhara fidya hai."
"538","Husayn al-Ju'fi ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ja'far ibn Burqan se, Thabit ibn Hajjaj al-Kilabi se, Abu Burdah ibn Abi Musa se, uske walid se: Do aadmi zameen ke baare mein jhagad rahe the, un mein se ek Hadramawt ke logon mein se tha, aur unhon ne maamla Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki taraf uthaya. Aap ne qasam ek par daal di, aur dusra cheekh pada aur kaha: Us ne ise apni qasam bana liya aur apni qasam ke zariye meri zameen kaat raha hai. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Agar wo na-haq apni qasam ke zariye tumhari zameen kaat le to wo un logon mein se hoga jin ki taraf Allah Qayamat ke din na dekhega, na unhein paak karega, aur uske liye dardnaak azab hai. Dusre ne kaha: Phir mujhe parwah nahi. Us ne kaha: Aur dusra qasam se baaz raha."
"539","Husayn al-Ju'fi ne hamein khabar di, Mujammi' ibn Yahya al-Ansari se, Sa'id ibn Abi Burdah se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath Maghrib padhi, aur hum ne kaha: Kaash hum baithe rahein yahan tak ke unke saath Isha padh lein. Us ne kaha: To hum baithe rahe. Us ne kaha: Aap hamari taraf tashreef laaye aur farmaya: Kya tum yahin thehre hue the? Hum ne kaha: Haan, aye Allah ke Rasul; hum ne kaha tha ke hum aap ke saath Isha padhenge. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne achcha kiya - ya farmaya tum ne durust kiya. Us ne kaha: Phir aap ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya - aur aap aksar apna sar aasman ki taraf uthate the - aur farmaya: Sitare aasman ke liye hifazat hain; jab sitare chale jayenge to aasman par wo kuch aa jayega jiska us se waada kiya gaya hai. Aur main apne Sahaba ke liye hifazat hun; jab main chala jaunga to mere Sahaba par wo kuch aa jayega jiska un se waada kiya gaya hai. Aur mere Sahaba meri ummat ke liye hifazat hain; jab mere Sahaba chale jayenge to meri ummat par wo kuch aa jayega jiska us se waada kiya gaya hai."
"540","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Umarah se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Qayamat ke din tamam ummaton ko ek hi maidan mein jama karega. Jab use apni makhlooq ke darmiyan faisla karna manzoor hoga to har qaum ke saamne wo kuch pesh kiya jayega jiski wo ibadat karti thi, aur wo unke peeche chale jayenge yahan tak ke wo unhein aag mein gira denge. Phir hamara Rab hamare paas aayega jab hum ek buland jagah par honge aur farmayega: Tum kaun ho? Hum kahenge: Hum musalman hain. Wo farmayega: Tum kis cheez ka intezaar kar rahe ho? Wo kahenge: Hum apne Rab, Azz wa Jall ka intezaar kar rahe hain. Wo farmayega: Aur kya tum use pehchan loge agar use dekho? Wo kahenge: Haan. Wo farmayega: Tum use kaise pehchanoge jab tum ne use dekha nahi? Wo kahenge: Hum use pehchante hain ke uska koi misl nahi. Us ne kaha: Phir hamara Rab, Azz wa Jall, hanste hue zahir hoga, phir farmayega: Khush ho jao, aye musalmanon ki jamaat, kyunki tum mein se koi bhi aisa nahi magar maine uske badle aag mein ek Yahudi ya ek Nasrani rakh diya hai."
"541","Ubaidullah bin Musa ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan se, Hakim bin ad-Daylam se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam chaar kalimaat ke sath hamare darmiyan khare hue aur farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla na sota hai aur na sona Us ke shayan hai, Woh tarazu ko past karta hai aur buland karta hai, raat ka amal din se pehle Us ki taraf uthaya jata hai aur din ka amal raat se pehle, Us ka hijab aag hai, agar Woh use khol de to Us ke Chehre ka jalal har us cheez ko jala de jahan tak Us ki nazar pahunchti hai."
"542","Husain al-Jufi ne hum se riwayat ki, Zaidah se, Asim al-Ahwal se, Abu Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Qais ne mujh se bayan kiya: Hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath the aur hum ne ek wadi par ittila ki, Unhon ne kaha: Log us me utre, kehte hue: Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah, wallahu Akbar, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, apni janon par narmi karo, pas tum na kisi behre ko pukarte ho na ghaib ko, tum Sunne Wale, Qareeb ko pukarte ho, Woh tumhare sath hai, Unhon ne kaha: To main rasta tey karta raha, un ke peeche kehte hue: La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais, kya main tumhe Jannat ke khazane me se ek kalime ki rehnumai na karun, Maine kaha: Haan, mere maa baap aap par qurban, Unhon ne farmaya: La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah."
"543","Yazid bin Harun ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Sulaiman at-Taimi ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abu Musa se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab do Musalman apni talwaron ke sath aamne samne hon aur un me se ek dusre ko qatl kar de to dono Aag me hain, kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasul, yeh to qatil hai, lekin maqtul ka kya, Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne apne sathi ko qatl karne ka irada kiya tha."
"544","Yazid bin Harun ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Hammam bin Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Abu Imran al-Jawni se, Abu Bakr bin Abi Musa se, apne walid se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Unhon ne farmaya: Khaima moti hai, aasman me us ki bulandi saath meel hai, us ke har kone me momin ke liye log honge jinhe dusre nahi dekhte."
"545","Abu Nuaim ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: Abu Qudamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-Jawni se, Abu Bakr bin Abdullah bin Qais se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Firdaws ke baghat chaar hain: do sone ke, un ki zeenat, un ki imaratein aur jo kuch un me hai, aur do chandi ke, un ki zeenat, un ki imaratein aur jo kuch un me hai, aur logon aur apne Rab ko dekhne ke darmiyan Adan ke Baghat me Us ke Chehre par azmat ki chadar ke siwa kuch nahi, aur yeh aise baghat hain jo Adan ke Baghat se ek gadhay me photte hain, phir us ke baad nahron me phat jate hain."
"546","Muhammad bin Ubaid ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: Ubaidullah bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Said bin Abi Hind se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Sona aur resham meri Ummat ke mardon par haram, us ki aurton ke liye halal hain."
"547","Muhammad bin Ubaid ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Said bin Abi Hind se, Abu Musa se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo nard se khele us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasul ki nafarmani ki."
"548","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Abdullah bin Said bin Abi Hind ne hamein khabar di, apne walid se, ek shakhs se, Abu Musa se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo pason se khele us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasul ki nafarmani ki."
"549","Hawdah bin Khalifah ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, Qasamah bin Zuhair se, unhon ne kaha: Maine al-Ashari ko kehte suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Adam ko ek mutthi se paida kiya jo Us ne tamam zameen se li, to Aulad-e-Adam zameen ke mutabiq aayi: un me surkh, safed aur siyah aaya, aur us ke darmiyan narm aur sakht, bure aur achhe."
"550","Ubaidullah bin Musa ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Israil ne hamein khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah bin Abi Musa se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hamein hukum diya ke hum Jafar bin Abi Talib ke sath Najashi ki sarzameen ki taraf rawana hon, yeh baat Quraish ko pahunchi to unhon ne Amr bin al-As aur Umarah bin al-Walid ko bheja aur Najashi ke liye ek tohfa jama kiya, Unhon ne kaha: Hum pahunche, aur woh Najashi ke paas hum se pehle pahunche, unhon ne use us ka tohfa pesh kiya aur us ne use qubul kiya, aur unhon ne use sajda kiya, phir Amr bin al-As ne us se kaha: Hamare kuch log apne deen se phir gaye hain aur aap ki sarzameen me hain, Najashi ne un se kaha: Meri sarzameen me, Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Unhon ne kaha: To us ne hamein bulawa bheja, Jafar ne hum se kaha: Tum me se koi na bole, aaj main tumhara tarjuman hun, Unhon ne kaha: Hum Najashi ke paas pahunche jabke woh apni majlis me baitha tha, aur Amr bin al-As us ke dayein aur Umarah bin al-Walid us ke bayein tha, aur padri aur rahib do safon me baithe the, aur Amr bin al-As aur Umarah bin al-Walid ne use bataya tha ke woh use sajda nahi karte, Unhon ne kaha: Jab hum us ke paas pahunche to hum qareeb hue, us ke sath jo padri aur rahib the unhon ne kaha: Badshah ko sajda karo, Jafar ne kaha: Hum Allah Azza wa Jalla ke siwa kisi ko sajda nahi karte, Unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Najashi ke paas pahunche to us ne kaha: Tumhe sajda karne se kis ne roka, Unhon ne kaha: Hum Allah Azza wa Jalla ke siwa kisi ko sajda nahi karte, Najashi ne us se kaha: Aur woh kya hai, Unhon ne kaha: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne hamare darmiyan ek Rasul bheja hai, aur wohi hai jis ki Isa bin Maryam alaihis salam ne khushkhabri di: mere baad aane wala ek Rasul jis ka naam Ahmad hai, Us ne hamein hukum diya ke hum Allah ki ibadat karein aur Us ke sath kuch sharik na karein, namaz qaim karein aur zakat dein, aur hamein bhalai ka hukum diya aur burai se mana kiya, Unhon ne kaha: Najashi us ki baat se mutassir hua, jab Amr bin al-As ne yeh dekha to us ne kaha: Allah badshah ko durust rakhe, woh Ibn-e-Maryam ke bare me aap ki mukhalifat karte hain, Najashi ne Jafar se kaha: Tumhara sathi Ibn-e-Maryam ke bare me kya kehta hai, Unhon ne kaha: Woh un ke bare me Allah Azza wa Jalla ka kalima kehta hai: Woh Allah ki Ruh aur Us ka Kalima hai, jise Us ne kunwari pakdaman se nikala jise kisi insan ne chhua nahi, Unhon ne kaha: Najashi ne zameen se ek lakdi li aur kaha: Ae padriyon aur rahibon ki jamaat, yeh Ibn-e-Maryam ke bare me hamari baat par is wazan se zyada izafa nahi karte, tumhe aur use jis ke paas se tum aaye ho khush aamdeed, main gawahi deta hun ke woh Allah ka Rasul hai aur wohi hai jis ki Isa bin Maryam ne khushkhabri di, agar woh badshahat na hoti jis me main hun to main us ke paas jata taake us ki jutiyan uthaun, jab tak chaho meri sarzameen me raho, aur us ne hamare liye khane aur kapre ka hukum diya, aur kaha: In dono ka tohfa inhe wapas kar do, Unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al-As past qad tha aur Umarah bin al-Walid khubsurat tha, Unhon ne kaha: Woh samandar ke raste Najashi ki taraf nikle, aur unhon ne sharab pi, aur Amr bin al-As ke sath us ki biwi thi, jab unhon ne sharab pi to Umarah ne kaha: Apni biwi ko hukum do ke mujhe bosa de, Amr ne kaha: Kya tumhe sharm nahi, Umarah ne Amr ko pakda aur use samandar me phenk diya, Amr Umarah se iltija karta raha hatta ke us ne use kashti me chadha liya, Amr ne is par us ke khilaf keena rakha, Amr ne Najashi se kaha: Jab aap nikalte hain to Umarah aap ke ghar walon ke paas peeche rehta hai, Unhon ne kaha: To Najashi ne Umarah ko bulaya aur us ki peshabgah me phunk mara, aur woh wehshi janwaron ke sath nikal gaya."
"551","Yahya bin Ishaq ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Sinan se, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne ek bete ko dafan kiya jabke main qabr me tha, ke Abu Talhah al-Khawlani ne mera hath pakda aur mujhe bahar khincha, Unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhe khushkhabri na dun, Maine kaha: Haan, Unhon ne kaha: ad-Dahhak bin Abdur Rahman bin Arzarm ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Musa al-Ashari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Ae Maut ke farishte, kya tum ne Mere bande ke bachche ki jaan li, Woh kehta hai: Haan, Woh farmata hai: Kya tum ne us ki aankh ki thandak aur us ke dil ka phal le liya, Woh kehta hai: Haan, Woh farmata hai: To us ne kya kaha, Woh kehta hai: Us ne Teri hamd ki aur kaha: Inna lillahi wa inna ilaihi rajiun, Woh farmata hai: Us ke liye Jannat me ek ghar banao aur us ka naam Bait-ul-Hamd rakho."
"552","Muhammad bin Ubaid ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaqiq se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, ek shakhs ek qaum se muhabbat karta hai lekin abhi un se mila nahi, Unhon ne farmaya: Insan us ke sath hai jis se woh muhabbat karta hai."
"553","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, kaha: as-Sauri ne hamein khabar di, al-Amash se, Abu Wail se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, ek shakhs dikhawe ke liye ladta hai, ek shakhs ghairat ki wajah se ladta hai, aur ek shakhs bahaduri ki wajah se ladta hai, to us me se kaun Allah ke raste me hai, Unhon ne farmaya: Jo is liye lade ke Allah ka kalima buland ho woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raste me hai."
"554","Ubaidullah bin Musa ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan aur Israil se, Mansur se, Abu Wail se, Abu Musa al-Ashari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Bhuke ko khilao, beemar ki iyadat karo, aur qaidi ko aazad karo, Sufyan ne kaha: Al-ani qaidi hai."
"555","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, main Abdur Razzaq hun, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Abu Usman an-Nahdi se, Abu Musa al-Ashari se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath tha, mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: ek bagh me, ke ek shakhs aaya aur salam kiya, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jao, use ijazat do aur use Jannat ki khushkhabri do, Unhon ne kaha: To main gaya, aur woh Abu Bakr the, Maine kaha: Dakhil ho, aur Jannat ki khushkhabri pao, Woh Allah ki hamd karte rahe hatta ke baith gaye, phir ek aur aaya aur salam kiya, Unhon ne farmaya: Jao, use ijazat do aur use Jannat ki khushkhabri do, Main gaya, aur woh Umar the, Maine kaha: Dakhil ho, aur Jannat ki khushkhabri pao, Woh Allah ki hamd karte rahe hatta ke baith gaye, phir ek aur aaya aur salam kiya, Unhon ne farmaya: Jao, use ijazat do aur use shadeed aazmaish ke bawajud Jannat ki khushkhabri do, Main gaya, aur woh Usman the, Maine kaha: Dakhil ho, aur shadeed aazmaish ke bawajud Jannat ki khushkhabri pao, Woh kehte rahe: Ae Allah, sabr, hatta ke baith gaye."
"556","Abu Asim ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan se, Abu Burdah bin Abdullah bin Abi Burdah se, apne dada Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Momin momin ke liye imarat ki tarah hai, us ka ek hissa dusre ko mazbut karta hai."
"557","Rawh bin Ubadah ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: Sabit bin Umarah al-Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Maine Ghunaim bin Qais ko kehte suna: Maine Abu Musa ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat karte suna: Jo bhi aurat khushbu lagaye aur logon ke paas se guzre taake woh us ki khushbu payein to woh zaniyah hai, aur har aankh zaniyah hai."
"558","Abu Nuaim ne hum se riwayat ki, kaha: al-Mughirah bin Abi al-Hurr al-Kindi ne hum se bayan kiya, Said bin Abi Burdah se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashrif laye jabke hum baithe the aur farmaya: Mujh par koi subah nahi aayi magar maine us me sau martaba Allah se maghfirat talab ki."
"559","Khalid bin Makhlad ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Amr bin Abi Amr ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Muttalib bin Hantab se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bure amal se nakhush ho aur apne achhe amal se khush ho woh momin hai."
"560","Zaid bin Hubab al-Ukli ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan se, Qais bin Muslim se, Tariq bin Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Gaaye ke doodh ko lazam pakdo, pas woh har darakht se charti hai, Abu Musa ki riwayat ka tatimma."
"561","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Burdah se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqah lazim hai. Kaha gaya: Agar woh sadqah na paye to? Aap ne farmaya: Apne hathon se kaam kare, apne aap ko nafa pahunchaye aur sadqah de. Kaha gaya: Agar woh is ki taqat na rakhe to? Aap ne farmaya: Mohtaj, pareshan haal ki madad kare. Kaha gaya: Agar woh is ki bhi taqat na rakhe to? Aap ne farmaya: Bhalai ka hukm de. Kaha gaya: Agar woh ye bhi na kar sake to? Aap ne farmaya: Burai se baaz rahe, pas yahi us ke liye sadqah hai."
"562","Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya - Amr ne kaha: Unhone mujhe khabar di - Abu Ubaydah se, Abu Musa se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall raat ko Apna Dast phailata hai taake din ka gunahgar tauba kare, aur din ko Apna Dast phailata hai taake raat ka gunahgar tauba kare, yahan tak ke suraj apne ghurub ki jagah se tulu ho jaye."
"563","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Hammam ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Tamimah se, Abu Musa se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Jo hamesha roza rakhe, Allah Jahannam ko us par tang kar dega yahan tak ke woh nabbe se bhi zyada tang ho jayegi."
"564","Hammam ne kaha: Aban ibn Abi Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Tamimah se, Abu Musa se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se isi ki manind riwayat hai. Hammam ne kaha: Pas maine us se kaha: Qatadah ne ise marfu' nahi kiya. Us ne kaha: Aban ne mujhe mere ghar mein marfu' bayan kiya."
"565","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Hammam ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ne hum se Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se bayan kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: Qur'an padhne wale momin ki misaal turanj jaisi hai: us ka zaiqa khushgawar hai aur us ki khushbu bhi khushgawar hai. Aur Qur'an na padhne wale momin ki misaal khajoor jaisi hai: us ka zaiqa khushgawar hai aur us mein koi khushbu nahi. Aur Qur'an padhne wale fajir ki misaal raihan jaisi hai: us ki khushbu khushgawar hai aur us ka zaiqa karwa hai. Aur Qur'an na padhne wale fajir ki misaal hanzal jaisi hai: us ka zaiqa karwa hai aur us mein koi khushbu nahi."
"566","Sa'id ibn al-Rabi' ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murrah se riwayat hai, kaha: Maine Murrah al-Hamdani ko suna, Abu Musa se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Mardon mein se bahut se kamal ko pahunche, aur auraton mein se kamal ko koi nahi pahunchi siwaye Maryam bint Imran aur Asiyah zaujah Firaun ke; aur A'ishah ki fazilat auraton par aisi hai jaise tharid ki fazilat tamam khanon par hai."
"567","Yahya ibn Ishaq al-Saylahini ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Ulaylah ibn Badr ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, woh apne dada se, Abu Musa se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aur us se zyada jama'at hai."
"568","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Sulayman ibn Bilal ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha: Amr ibn Abi Amr ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Muttalib ibn Hantab se, Abu Musa se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni duniya se muhabbat karega woh apni aakhirat ko nuqsan pahunchayega, aur jo apni aakhirat se muhabbat karega woh apni duniya ko nuqsan pahunchayega; pas jo baqi rehne wala hai use fana hone wale par tarjih do."
"569","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, Dawud ibn Husayn se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, kaun se adyan Allah Azza wa Jall ko sab se zyada mehboob hain? Aap ne farmaya: Aasan, hanifiyat wali tauhid."
"570","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, kaha: al-Mustalim ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha: Abu Ali al-Rahabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne janabat se ghusl kiya aur apne kandhe par ek jagah dekhi jise pani ne nahi chhua tha. Unhone kaha: Pas Aap ne apne baalon ko us par nichoda aur usi se use ponch diya."
"571","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di: Jarir ibn Hazim ne hamein khabar di, Ya'la ibn Hakim se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Ma'iz ibn Malik se jab woh Aap ke pas aaya aur Aap ke samne zina ka iqrar kiya to farmaya: Shayad tum ne bosa diya ya chhua hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum ne us se jima kiya? Us ne kaha: Ji han. Pas Aap ne hukm diya to use rajm kar diya gaya."
"572","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di: Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Chhoti ungli aur angutha barabar hain."
"573","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya: Abbad ibn Mansur ne hamein khabar di, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke pas ek surmeh dani thi jis se Aap sone se pehle har aankh mein teen martaba surma lagate the."
"574","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di: Abbad ibn Mansur ne hamein khabar di, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Hijama karane ka behtareen din satrahwin, unniswin aur ikkiswin hai. Aap ne farmaya: Aur jis raat mujhe upar le jaya gaya main farishton ki kisi jama'at ke pas se nahi guzra magar unhone kaha: Ae Muhammad, hijama ko apne upar lazim kar lo."
"575","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di: Abdullah ibn Ja'far ne hamein khabar di, Amr ibn Abi Amr se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jise tum qaum-e-Lut ka fe'l karte pao to fa'il aur maf'ul dono ko qatl kar do; aur jise tum kisi janwar se jima karte pao to use qatl kar do aur janwar ko bhi us ke sath qatl kar do."
"576","Mu'adh ibn Hisham al-Dastawa'i ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha - aur mera khayal hai ke unhone ise Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se marfu' kiya - Aap ne farmaya: Gadha, kutta, haiza aurat, Yahudi, Isai, Majusi aur khinzir namaz ko qata kar dete hain. Unhone kaha: Aur tumhare liye itna kafi hai ke agar woh tum se pathar phenkne ke faasle par hon to woh tumhari namaz ko qata nahi karte."
"577","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ibn Aban ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Allah Ta'ala ke is farman ke bare mein: Jis ke waste se tum ek dusre se sawal karte ho, aur rishtedariyon ka khayal rakho. Unhone kaha: Aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala farmata hai: Silah rahmi ko barqarar rakho, pas ye tumhare liye duniya ki zindagi mein zyada baqi rehne wala aur tumhari aakhirat ke liye behtar hai."
"578","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya: Thabit ibn Yazid al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya: Hilal ibn Khabbab ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne ek dushman se jang ki, aur Aap un se farigh nahi hue yahan tak ke Asr apne waqt se muakkhar ho gayi. Jab Aap ne dekh kar ye manzar dekha to farmaya: Ae Allah, jis ne hamein namaz-e-wusta se roke rakha, un ke dilon ko aag se bhar de aur un ki qabron ko aag se bhar de."
"579","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne hamein khabar di, Ali ibn Nizar se, woh apne walid se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke do girohon ka Islam mein koi hissa nahi: Murji'ah aur Qadariyyah."
"580","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya: Abu Sa'd al-Baqqal ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke pas aaya aur kaha: Meri behen ne Baitullah tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani hai, aur us ke liye paidal chalna mushkil hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke sawar ho jaye agar woh paidal na chal sake, pas Allah ko tumhari behen ko mashaqqat mein daalne ki koi hajat nahi."
"581","Usman ibn Umar ne hamein khabar di: Hisham ne hamein khabar di, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) is haal mein wafaat pa gaye ke un ki zirah ek shakhs ke paas bees Sa' jau ke badle girwi thi jo unhon ne apne ahl o ayal ke khane ke liye liye the."
"582","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hamein khabar di, Asim se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Makkah fatah kiya to aap bees raatein namaz qasr karke thehre."
"583","Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se riwayat ki: mere walid ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Yazid al-Madani ko Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna, ke unhon ne kaha: Zuhr aur Asr mein qiraat nahi hai. Un se kaha gaya: log to qiraat karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Agar mujhe un par ikhtiyar hota to main un ki zabanein kaat deta. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qiraat ki, to un ki qiraat hamare liye qiraat hai; aur aap khamosh rahe, to un ki khamoshi khamoshi hai."
"584","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se riwayat ki: Hammad ibn Salamah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Humaid se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Maimunah bint al-Harith se nikah kiya jabke dono ihram mein the."
"585","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se riwayat ki: Sharik ne hum se riwayat ki, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Asbahani se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) fatah ke baad Makkah mein satrah din thehre, do rak'atein namaz parhte hue."
"586","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se riwayat ki: Sharik ne hum se riwayat ki, Laith se, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bashir se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: 'Jo hamare chhoton par rehem na kare, hamare badon ki izzat na kare, neki ka hukm na de aur burai se mana na kare, woh hum mein se nahi.'"
"587","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se riwayat ki: Qais ibn al-Rabi' ne hum se riwayat ki, Nusair ibn Dha'luq se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) is haal mein wafaat pa gaye ke un ki zirah ek Yahudi ke paas tees Sa' jau ke badle girwi thi."
"588","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se riwayat ki: al-Hasan ibn Salih ne hum se riwayat ki, Jabir se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: 'Qurbani mujh par farz ki gayi hai aur tum par farz nahi ki gayi, aur mujhe Duha ki namaz ka hukm diya gaya hai aur tumhein is ka hukm nahi diya gaya.'"
"589","Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ibn Bilal ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Abi Amr ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne zameen ki hadon ke nishanat badal diye; Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne apne aaqaon ke siwa kisi aur se wala jodi; Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne andhe ko raste se bhatkaya; Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne apne walidain par la'nat ki; Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne ghairullah ke liye zabah kiya; Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne janwar se badkari ki; Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne qaum e Lut ka amal kiya' - phir 'Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne qaum e Lut ka amal kiya' - phir 'Allah ne la'nat ki us par jis ne qaum e Lut ka amal kiya.'"
"590","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujh se riwayat ki: Sulaiman ibn Bilal ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Abi Amr ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jumu'ah ke din ghusl wajib nahi hai, lekin jo ghusl kare to behtar aur zyada pakeezah hai. Phir unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein log oon pehna karte the, aur masjid tang thi jis ki chhat neechi thi. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek Jumu'ah ko sakht garmi ke shadeed tapte din mein bahar tashrif laye, aur aap ka mimbar chhota tha, sirf teen seedhiyon wala. Aap ne logon se khitab kiya, aur log apni oon mein paseene mein sharabor ho gaye, to paseene aur oon ki bu uthne lagi hatta ke qareeb tha ke woh ek dusre ko taklif pahunchayen, hatta ke un ki bu Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tak pahunchi jabke aap mimbar par the. Aap ne farmaya: 'Aye logo, jab ye din aaye to ghusl karo, aur tum mein se har shakhs behtarin khushbu ya tel lagaye jo use muyassar aaye.'"
"591","Amr ibn Talhah al-Qannad ne mujh se riwayat ki: al-Asbat ibn Nasr ne hum se riwayat ki, Simak ibn Harb se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek chuha aaya aur batti ghaseetne laga. Laundi use bhagane ke liye uthi, to Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Ise chhod do.' To woh use le aaya aur use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne us chatai par phenk diya jis par aap baithe the, aur us ne us ka ek dirham ke barabar hissa jala diya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum so jao to apne chiraagh bujha diya karo, kyunke shaitan isi tarah kisi ko is ki taraf le jata hai, aur woh tumhein jala deta hai.'"
"592","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Thabit ibn Yazid ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hilal ibn Khabbab se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kai raatein khali pet bhukhe guzarte jabke un ke ghar walon ko raat ka khana na milta, aur un ki aksar roti jau ki roti hoti."
"593","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se riwayat ki: Sa'id ibn Zaid - Hammad ibn Zaid ke bhai - ne hum se riwayat ki: Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas kaha karte the: Is hadith ko yaad rakho: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ek sahabzadi qareeb ul marg thi, to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use apne hathon par rakha aur us ka sar apne hathon ke darmiyan rakha jabke woh aalam e naz'a mein thi hatta ke woh wafaat pa gayi, aur aap ne use leta diya jabke aap ro rahe the. Umm Aiman cheekh kar ro padi, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhein Rasulullah ke huzur rote hue dekh raha hun?' Unhon ne kaha: Kya main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko rota hua na dekhun? Unhon ne farmaya: 'Main rota hun, aur ye rehmat hai. Momin har haal mein bhalai mein hota hai; us ki jaan us ke pehluon ke darmiyan se is haal mein nikali jati hai ke woh Allah ki hamd karta hai, jo aziz o bartar hai.'"
"594","Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne mujh se riwayat ki: Ibrahim ibn Ismail ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Husain ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) humein har dard aur bukhar ke khilaf ek dua sikhaya karte the, farmate hue: 'Allah ke naam se, jo Azmat wala hai. Main Allah ki panah mangta hun, jo Zabardast hai, ubharne wali rag ke shar se aur Aag ki garmi se.'"
"595","Sulaiman ibn Harb ne mujh se riwayat ki: Hammad ibn Zaid ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke un se Sad mein sajdah ke bare mein pucha gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Ye wajib sajdon mein se nahi hai, lekin maine Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko is mein sajdah karte hue dekha hai."
"596","al-Qa'nabi ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne mujh se riwayat ki, Amr ibn Abi Amr se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Ek shakhs ne apne maqruz ko das dinaron ke liye pakda aur us ne us se kaha: Allah ki qasam, mere paas aaj tumhein ada karne ke liye kuch nahi hai. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main tumhein nahi chhodunga jab tak tum mujhe ada na karo ya mere liye koi zamin na lao jo tumhari zamanat de. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mere paas adaigi nahi hai aur mujhe koi zamanat dene wala nahi milta. Unhon ne kaha: To woh use Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ghaseet kar le gaya aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, is shakhs ne mujhe pakad liya hai, aur maine us se ek mahine ki mohlat mangi, lekin us ne inkar kiya illa ye ke main use ada karun ya zamin laun. Maine kaha: Allah ki qasam, mujhe koi zamin nahi milta aur mere paas aaj adaigi nahi hai. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Kya tum sirf ek mahine ki mohlat doge?' Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: 'To phir main us ki taraf se is ki zamanat deta hun.' To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf se is ki zamanat di. Woh shakhs gaya aur muqarrarah waqt par us ke paas raqam le aaya. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Ye sona tumhein kahan se mila?' Us ne kaha: Ek kaan se. Aap ne farmaya: 'Jao, humein is ki koi hajat nahi; is mein koi bhalai nahi hai.' To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf se use ada kar diya."
"597","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Abi al-Furat ne hum se riwayat ki, Ilba ibn Ahmar se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaar khutut khenche, phir farmaya: 'Kya tum jante ho ye kya hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul behtar jante hain. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Jannat ki behtarin khawatin Khadijah bint Khuwailid, Fatimah bint Muhammad, Maryam bint Imran, aur Asiyah bint Muzahim hain, jo Firaun ki biwi hain.'"
"598","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se riwayat ki: Thabit ibn Yazid al-Ahwal ne hum se riwayat ki: Hilal ibn Khabbab ne hum se riwayat ki, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Uhud ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, mujhe ye pasand nahi hoga ke Uhud Aale Muhammad ke liye sona bana diya jaye jise main Allah ki rah mein kharch karun, jo aziz o bartar hai, aur jis din main marun us mein se do dinar bhi bacha kar marun siwaye do dinar ke jo main qarz ke liye alag rakh dun, agar koi ho.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir aap ne is haal mein wafaat pai ke na dinar chhoda na dirham, na ghulam na laundi, aur aap ne apni zirah ek Yahudi ke paas tees Sa' jau ke badle girwi chhodi."
"599","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se riwayat ki: Thabit ibn Yazid ne hum se riwayat ki: Hilal ibn Khabbab ne hum se riwayat ki, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Umar Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hue jabke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek chatai par the jis ne aap ke pehlu par nishanat chhod diye the. Unhon ne aap se kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, kaash aap is se zyada narm bistar le lete! Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujhe is duniya se kya matlab? Mujhe is duniya se kya matlab? Us Zaat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein meri jaan hai, meri aur is duniya ki misaal sirf us sawaar jaisi hai jo sakht garmi ke din mein safar kare, phir din ki ek ghadi ke liye darakht ke saye mein thehre, phir aage badhe aur use chhod de.'"
"600","Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne hum se riwayat ki: Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum raste ke bare mein ikhtilaf karo to use saat haath chauda rakho.'"
